        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals from 26 populations with reconstructed genomes (final phase 3), 2015</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26432245</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here we report completion of the project, having reconstructed the genomes of 2,504 individuals from 26 populations using a combination of low-coverage whole-genome sequencing, deep exome sequencing, and dense microarray genotyping.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
