        <obo:IAO_0000116>Black and White participants recruited from the 4 communities</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35769078</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ARIC is a population-based epidemiologic study among a total of 15,792 Black and White participants recruited from 4 communities (17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
