        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A birth cohort of children and their families recruited through pregnancies in the Bristol area of the United Kingdom during 1990–1992, with later recruitment of eligible children, followed prospectively to investigate genetic and environmental influences on health and development across the life course.</owl:annotatedTarget>
