        <obo:IAO_0000116>live-born index children in the enrolled sample (from 15 247 enrolled pregnancies, by age 18), 2012</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22507743</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ‘Children of the 90s’ ‘enrolled sample’ consists of 14 775 (75.7% of the 19 600 eligible live births) live-born children from the 15 247 pregnancies (15 458 foetuses) where an individual, either the mother/primary caregiver or the child, has provided data.</rdfs:comment>
