        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of patients with newly diagnosed bladder cancer in the West Midlands, United Kingdom, recruited from December 2005 and followed prospectively to investigate lifestyle factors, molecular predictors, recurrence, progression and quality of life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
