        <rdfs:comment>The summary statistic for CAD was from the Coronary ARtery DIsease Genome Wide Replication and Meta-analysis plus The Coronary Artery Disease Genetics (CARDIoGRAMplusC4D) Consortium (60,801 cases and 123,504 controls) (Nikpay et al., 2015).</rdfs:comment>
