        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A consortium of coronary-disease genetic studies combining European, South Asian and East Asian case-control data to identify susceptibility variants for coronary artery disease and myocardial infarction. CARDIoGRAMplusC4D joins the Coronary Artery Disease Genome-wide Replication and Meta-analysis and Coronary Artery Disease Genetics consortia.</owl:annotatedTarget>
