        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001000620</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The aim of this project is to identify rare genetic variants of large effect implicated in complex diseases by focusing on the study of cardiovascular diseases and related quantitative traits in a well characterized isolated population in Cilento area, Italy.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
