        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control collection of people of Punjabi ancestry, predominantly originating from Mirpur, Pakistan, with type 2 diabetes or normal glucose regulation, assembled to investigate genetic susceptibility to diabetes and related glycaemic traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
