        <owl:annotatedTarget>A randomised trial cohort of people with impaired fasting glucose or impaired glucose tolerance from 21 countries, assigned in a factorial design to ramipril, rosiglitazone or corresponding placebos to evaluate prevention of diabetes and effects on atherosclerosis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
