        <rdfs:comment>Participants in Study 1 were recruited from existing prospective cohort studies in or around each of the following European cities: Malmö, Sweden (Malmö Diet and Cancer Study [ 12 ]); Amsterdam, The Netherlands (Hoorn Study [ 3 ]); Copenhagen, Denmark (Inter99 [ 10 ]); and Kuopio, Finland […] Participants in Study 2 of DIRECT are recruited from or nearby each of the following European cities: Malmö, Sweden; Amsterdam, the Netherlands; Copenhagen, Denmark; Exeter, UK; Newcastle, UK; Dundee, UK</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
