        <owl:annotatedTarget>A randomised trial cohort of people with atrial fibrillation in the multinational Effective Anticoagulation with Factor Xa Next Generation in Atrial Fibrillation–Thrombolysis in Myocardial Infarction 48 (ENGAGE AF-TIMI 48) trial, comparing edoxaban with warfarin for prevention of stroke and systemic embolism, with recruitment beginning in November 2008.</owl:annotatedTarget>
