        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5465852/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The DIetary, Lifestyle and Genetic determinants of Obesity and Metabolic syndrome (DILGOM) study was conducted in the framework of the National FINRISK study, which is a Finnish population-based chronic disease risk factor monitoring survey carried out at 5-year intervals since 1972</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000071"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001729"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC4210840</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>FINRISK surveys 1992, 1997 and 2002 were included in the current analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000071"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Finland"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8183175/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The FINRISK studies were cross‐sectional population surveys carried out in Finland in a systematic and standardized fashion every 5 years since 1972</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000071"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
