        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of men aged 40–69 with a family history of prostate cancer, recruited through London clinics, a UK prostate cancer study and public advertisements to evaluate genetic risk assessment and prostate biopsy for targeted prostate cancer screening.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym PROFILE also denotes the Crohn&apos;s disease trial PRedicting Outcomes For Crohn&apos;s disease using a moLecular biomarker (COHO:0000320); this term is the prostate cancer risk study. The EGA study EGAS00001007958 tagged PROFILE is the Crohn&apos;s disease trial, not this cohort.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">115</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PROFILE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
