        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants with clinical data and biomaterials available in the NIMH repository (approximately), 2016</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.nimh.nih.gov/about/advisory-boards-and-groups/namhc/2016/may/namhc-minutes-of-the-245th-meeting</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Currently, clinical data and biomaterials from approximately 120,000 participants are available, with more than 200,000 to be available soon.</rdfs:comment>
