        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41714267</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between 2005 and 2015, 3063 participants aged 40-69 yr (median 54 yr) were recruited from 65 centres in 20 countries in two cohorts: (1) BRCA1/BRCA2 PGV carriers (915 BRCA1, 901 BRCA2); and (2) age-matched noncarriers for a familial PGV (727 BRCA1 and 520 BRCA2 noncarriers).</rdfs:comment>
