        <rdfs:comment>Gabriel Advanced Survey</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000142"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3182531/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PROCARDIS</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001915"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3640650/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The MS subjects were recruited from three clinical sites: 453 cases from the UK (IMSGC UK) and 342 cases from the US (IMSGC US); the remaining 860 MS patients were recruited at Partners MS Center in Boston, MA (BWH).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001916"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3343041/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We employed the NINDS dbGaP dataset that includes genomewide genotypes (Affymetrix GeneChip Human Mapping 500K Array Set) for 931 individuals with MS from the IMSGC [8], all drawn from the UK and the USA.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002282"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3681825/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>we performed a GWAS with OCB status using the PROGEMUS/PROGRESSO subset of the IMSGC-WTCCC GWAS [9] as a discovery sample</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002310"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3283173/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>REFGENSEP is a member of the International Multiple Sclerosis Genetics Consortium (IMSGC).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>EGAS00001003216</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Multiple Sclerosis Replication Chip data (MS Chip)</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001003216</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>UK Multiple Sclerosis (MS) cases that were recruited through the University of Cambridge and included in the IMSGC Replicationchip experiment</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST001505</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study of multiple sclerosis confirms a novel locus at 5p13.1.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22570697</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3343041/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also analyzed a dataset (named hereafter IMSGC/WT) based on 931 MS cases from the International Multiple Sclerosis Genetic Consortium (IMSGC) [8] and 2938 controls from the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium (WTCCC), who had been genotyped using Affymetrix 500K array [9].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A consortium of research groups that combines multiple sclerosis case collections from people of European descent across 15 countries with control datasets to investigate genetic susceptibility to multiple sclerosis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21833088</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
        <dcterms:contributor>GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9772</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cases and controls passing QC in the 2011 IMSGC/WTCCC2 GWAS discovery analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21833088</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We introduced a number of novel quality control (QC) methods for processing these datasets (see Supplementary Information), which ultimately provided reliable information from 9772 cases and 17376 controls (see Figure 1A).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">17376</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cases and controls passing QC in the 2011 IMSGC/WTCCC2 GWAS discovery analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21833088</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We introduced a number of novel quality control (QC) methods for processing these datasets (see Supplementary Information), which ultimately provided reliable information from 9772 cases and 17376 controls (see Figure 1A).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
