        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CARE also denotes Canadian Airways Research Group (COHO:0000229), Cholesterol and Recurrent Events (COHO:0001569), Childhood Asthma Research and Education Network (COHO:0001570) and Candidate Gene Association Resource (COHO:0001586); this term is Los Angeles component of The Womens Contraceptive and Reproductive Experiences Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
