    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000110"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">380</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>African American cases and controls in the AABC GWAS scan (analysed subset)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2608/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2608_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cases in Los Angeles County were diagnosed from July 1, 1994 through April 30, 1998, and controls were sampled by random-digit dialing (RDD) from the same population and time period; 380 African American cases and 224 African American controls were included in Stage 1 of the scan.</rdfs:comment>
