        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000126"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid1432"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>ovarian cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001034.v1.p1</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The project recruited cases from Eastern Massachusetts and New Hampshire, and became known as the New England-based Case-Control study (NECC) of ovarian cancer. 3957 ovarian cancer cases diagnosed at ages 18-80 and residing in Eastern Massachusetts and New Hampshire were identified through tumor boards and registries.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000126"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001034.v1.p1</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The project recruited cases from Eastern Massachusetts and New Hampshire</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000126"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST009008</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Identification of novel epithelial ovarian cancer loci in women of African ancestry.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:31469419</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7523187/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also thank other OCAC members who provided less than 10 EOC samples for the current analysis: Diether Lambrechts (BEL), Digna Velez Edwards (BVU), James Brenton (CAM), Mary Anne Rossing (DOV), Marc Goodman (HAW), Ellen Goode (MAY), Douglas Levine (MSK), Daniel Cramer (NEC)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000126"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:33634849</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Intrauterine device use and risk of ovarian cancer: Results from the New England Case-Control study and Nurses&apos; Health Studies.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:33634849</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC8720374/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data from the New England Case-Control Study (NEC)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000126"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control collection of women aged 18–80 with epithelial ovarian cancer and population controls from eastern Massachusetts and New Hampshire, recruited in four phases from 1984 to 2008 to investigate ovarian-cancer risk factors.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:33634849</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
        <dcterms:contributor>GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
