        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC8720374/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>From the four study phases, 2,465 eligible women with ovarian cancer consented for participation and were subsequently enrolled as cases.</rdfs:comment>
