        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>OCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-22. No study of this name could be identified. Its only hit in an EBI database is a text match of the acronym OCS to EGA study EGAS00001006555 (ovarian carcinosarcoma genomics), where OCS abbreviates ovarian carcinosarcoma; the human EGA review marked the match incorrect, and the GWAS Catalog has no OCS cohort tag. No cohort was identified for the term to be replaced by.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Ovarian Cancer Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
