        <owl:annotatedTarget>A biobank of healthy men and women aged 30–50 years from Oxfordshire, United Kingdom, recruiting from 1999 and permitting recall by genotype or phenotype to investigate mechanisms of type 2 diabetes and cardiovascular disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:29040543</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
