        <rdfs:comment>PEG included 1367 participants (634 PD cases and 733 controls) (Table 1) with a mean (SD) age of 66.7 (11.2) years (623 [45.6%] female and 744 [54.4%] male; 27 [2.0%] African American, 64 [4.7%] American Indian or Alaska Native, 37 [2.7%] Asian, 263 [19.2%] Latino, and 976 [71.4%] White).</rdfs:comment>
