        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2965757/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The validation cohorts were the MONItoring trends and determinants of CArdiovascular diseases (MONICA)/Pressioni Arteriose Monitorate E Loro Associazioni (PAMELA) studies (894 cases/746 controls) from Northern Italy [6], [28],</rdfs:comment>
