        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym PAGE also denotes Placental Abruption Genetic Epidemiology study (COHO:0001268), Parkinson&apos;s, Genes, and Environment Study (COHO:0002232) and Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology Study (COHO:0002752); this term is Psoriasis Association Genetics Extension.</obo:IAO_0000116>
