        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1177/08902070221119782</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Participants were recruited via 230 randomly selected elementary schools from several medium-sized cities in the center of the Netherlands.</rdfs:comment>
