        <rdfs:comment>The dataset includes the VCF files with the list of variants, and their frequency, found in 3,514 Sardinian individuals recruited from the SardiNIA longitudinal study (N=2090) and from a case-control study of autoimmune diseases in Sardinia (N=1424).</rdfs:comment>
