        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomised trial cohort of adults with high-risk stage II or stage III colorectal cancer, recruited at 244 centres during 2008–2013 to compare three versus six months of adjuvant oxaliplatin-containing chemotherapy using disease-free survival as the primary outcome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6088</coho:numberOfParticipants>
