        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28067908</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5289481/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We generated low-coverage whole genome sequences for 4,686 IBD cases and 3,781 population controls from the UK IBD Genetics Consortium (UKIBDGC) and UK10K Consortium, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
