        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control collection of self-identified non-Hispanic White participants with colorectal cancer and comparison participants, contributing the Basque-colon validation sample for evaluation of polygenic prediction of colorectal cancer risk.</obo:IAO_0000115>
