        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10545678/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Basque-colon cohort included 873 participants with colon cancer, biobanked between 20092019. Participants were diagnosed and/or treated according to usual clinical practice in the Donostia University Hospital, San Sebastian, Spain</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
