        <rdfs:comment>Basque-colon cohort included 873 participants with colon cancer, biobanked between 2009- 2019. Participants were diagnosed and/or treated according to usual clinical practice in the Donostia University Hospital, San Sebastian, Spain, including follow-up to this date. Controls (n = 945) came from the blood donor biobank of the same geographical area.</rdfs:comment>
