        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000186"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10349</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals genotyped at the time of the 2022 study</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8817039/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>At the time of this study, a total of 10,349 individuals had been genotyped using the Affymetrix Axiom KORV 1.0–96 Array (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Santa Clara, CA, USA) by DNA Link, Inc.</rdfs:comment>
