        <rdfs:comment>CAS consisted of 1,010 cases of CAD and 3,998 controls. 1,010 cases from the Northern provinces in China were enrolled from Fuwai Hospital, National Center of Cardiovascular Diseases. 83.8% of cases have a family history of CAD.</rdfs:comment>
