        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34518286</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the Uppsala Longitudinal Study of Adult Men study, 2322 men, all aged 50 years, were assessed for CVD risk factors and then followed for four decades regarding incident CVDs.</rdfs:comment>
