        <obo:IAO_0000115>A resource of the African Partnership for Chronic Disease Research that combines approximately 3,000 whole-genome sequences and 600 transcriptomes from African populations into a continent-specific haplotype reference panel, an African transcriptome resource and an informatics centre in Uganda.</obo:IAO_0000115>
