        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of 1,481 individuals from 18 ethno-linguistic groups in sub-Saharan Africa with dense genotype data, and 320 individuals from seven groups with low-coverage whole-genome sequence, assembled by the African Partnership for Chronic Disease Research to characterise population diversity and support the design and interpretation of genomic studies in Africa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1481</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGVP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
