        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001000960</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As part of the AGVP we sequenced 3 African populations; Baganda from Uganda (4x), Zulu from South Africa (4x), Gumuz, Wolayta, Oromo, Somali and Amhara from Ethiopia (8x).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000214"/>
