        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of 1,481 individuals from 18 ethno-linguistic groups in sub-Saharan Africa with dense genotype data, and 320 individuals from seven groups with low-coverage whole-genome sequence, assembled by the African Partnership for Chronic Disease Research to characterise population diversity and support the design and interpretation of genomic studies in Africa.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25470054</obo:IAO_0000119>
