        <rdfs:comment>Within the beatAML cohort 39 , a bone marrow sample and a paired skin sample were taken from 261 AML patients. The somatic mutations identified in these AML cases were downloaded from the Genomics Data Commons 68 (GDC) repository</rdfs:comment>
