        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of patients with idiopathic or trauma-induced subglottic stenosis and controls enrolled prospectively by the Canadian Airways Research Group to investigate the clinical, transcriptional and genetic features of the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CARE also denotes Los Angeles component of The Womens Contraceptive and Reproductive Experiences Study (COHO:0000110), Cholesterol and Recurrent Events (COHO:0001569), Childhood Asthma Research and Education Network (COHO:0001570) and Candidate Gene Association Resource (COHO:0001586); this term is Canadian Airways Research Group.</obo:IAO_0000116>
