        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of men with intermediate-risk prostate cancer whose tumour genomes, including multiple regions from the same gland, were sequenced by the Canadian Prostate Cancer Genome Network to identify genetic signatures of treatment response.</obo:IAO_0000115>
