        <owl:annotatedTarget>EGAS00001005304</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Mapping the human genetic architecture of COVID-19.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34237774</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000238"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A worldwide collaborative initiative that brings together COVID-19 case and population cohorts to identify genetic determinants of SARS-CoV-2 infection susceptibility and COVID-19 severity through meta-analysis and shared individual-level data.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34237774</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000238"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">49562</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cases and controls in the 2021 reported-infection meta-analysis (44 studies)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8674144/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Finally, seven loci reached genome-wide significance in the analysis using data for all available 49,562 reported cases of SARS-CoV-2 infection and 1,770,206 controls, using data from a total of 44 studies (Fig. 2a, bottom).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000238"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1770206</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cases and controls in the 2021 reported-infection meta-analysis (44 studies)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8674144/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Finally, seven loci reached genome-wide significance in the analysis using data for all available 49,562 reported cases of SARS-CoV-2 infection and 1,770,206 controls, using data from a total of 44 studies (Fig. 2a, bottom).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
