        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective observational precision oncology cohort of the German Cancer Consortium that enrols adults with advanced cancer who are younger than 51 and patients with rare tumours regardless of age, and uses whole-genome or exome and transcriptome sequencing to inform their care.</owl:annotatedTarget>
