        <obo:IAO_0000112>EGAS00001004434</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of Egyptian healthy volunteers free of cardiovascular disease, of whom 391 were recruited as a pilot phenotyped control cohort with cardiac MRI and targeted sequencing of inherited cardiac condition genes, to define the genetic landscape of an understudied North African population.</obo:IAO_0000115>
