        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7584615/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here, we report data from an initial cohort of 391 volunteers recruited from December 2015 to June 2018 via national advertisement (brochures, flyers, and public events) and assessed at the Aswan Heart Centre (AHC).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
