        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of adolescent and young adult patients aged 12 to 29 with newly diagnosed or relapsed high-grade glioma recruited across Europe from 2019 in the EORTC SPECTA RP1759 study to bridge the molecular gap between paediatric and adult oncology.</owl:annotatedTarget>
