        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">648</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>UK 1958 Birth Cohort controls whose exomes were deposited as EGAS00001001667</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27329137</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>WES data on the 1,006 CRC cases and 648 controls have been deposited at the European Genome-phenome Archive, which is hosted by the European Bioinformatics Institute, accession numbers EGAS00001001666 and EGAS00001001667, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


