        <obo:IAO_0000116>patients with systemic autoinflammatory disorders and healthy controls enrolled at 30 centres</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41917006</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>450 patients with different systemic autoinflammatory disorders (SAID) and healthy controls were enrolled from 30 clinical centers throughout Europe and Turkey, to assure a broad inclusion of SAID subtypes and a sufficient number of individuals for rare diseases.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


