        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32025007</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here we report the integrative analysis of 2,658 whole-cancer genomes and their matching normal tissues across 38 tumour types from the Pan-Cancer Analysis of Whole Genomes (PCAWG) Consortium of the International Cancer Genome Consortium (ICGC) and The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA).</rdfs:comment>
