        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of 1,000 healthy individuals of western European ancestry recruited in France by the Institut Pasteur&apos;s Milieu Intérieur project to dissect the interplay between genetics, environment and the immune system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
