        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000301"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1000</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>healthy donors aged 20-69 recruited 2012-2013, stratified by sex and decade</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13354573/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To identify the determinants of immune variability, the Milieu Intérieur (MI) population cohort study 14 was established in 2012–2013, consisting of 1000 well-defined healthy donors equally stratified by age and sex (100 male and 100 female donors in each decade of life between 20 and 69 years old).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
