        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001006959</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To better understand the biology of prostate cancer, we performed RNAseq in cancerous (primary and metastatic) and noncancerous tissues in the PELICAN45 cohort.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000315"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An integrated clinical-molecular rapid autopsy study of men who died of lethal prostate cancer at Johns Hopkins, United States, whose primary and metastatic tumours and normal tissues were collected for sequencing.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001006959</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000315"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">33</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>men who died of metastatic prostate cancer 1995-2004 and consented to rapid autopsy (PELICAN33)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34337548</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We analyzed deep longitudinal clinical, neuroendocrine expression, and autopsy data of 33 men who died from mPC between 1995 and 2004 (PELICAN33), and related findings to mPC biomarkers reported in the literature.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


