        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6700149/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of 609 DLBCL belonging to the intention-to-treat population of the PETAL trial, 546 (89.7%) were iPET-negative and 63 (10.3%) were iPET-positive 2 .</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


