        <rdfs:comment>Here we present the most comprehensive intra-patient metastatic melanoma dataset assembled to date as part of the PEACE research autopsy programme, including exome, panel-sequenced, RNA-seq, and single-cell whole-genome sequencing samples from 14 ICI-treated patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
