        <rdfs:comment>The SCOOP cohort (PMID: 23563609) is a UK Caucasian subset of the Genetics of ObesityStudy (GOOS) (PMID: 19966786], comprising of individuals with severe early-onset obesity(BMI standard deviation score (SDS) &gt; 3; onset of obesity before the age of 10 years).</rdfs:comment>
