        <rdfs:comment>The Severe Childhood Onset Obesity Project (SCOOP) cohort (Wheeler et al., 2013), includes ∼4800 British individuals of European ancestry with childhood onset obesity (BMI standard deviation score (SDS) &gt; 3; onset of obesity before the age of 10 years).</rdfs:comment>
