        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of 4,810 Singapore Chinese, Malays and Indians whose whole genomes were sequenced in the pilot phase of the SG10K project, a precursor of PRECISE-SG100K, to characterise Asian genetic diversity and improve imputation in Asian populations.</owl:annotatedTarget>
