        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:31626772</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>By whole-genome sequencing of 4,810 Singapore Chinese, Malays, and Indians, we found 98.3 million SNPs and small insertions or deletions, over half of which are novel.</rdfs:comment>
