        <owl:annotatedTarget>An H3Africa collection of cases, controls and latent infections from seven populations of Uganda, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Ivory Coast, Guinea, Cameroon and Zambia where trypanosomiasis is endemic, sequenced to discover genetic variants associated with responses to sleeping sickness infection.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001002602</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
