        <obo:IAO_0000116>samples (one per individual) used in the 2024 TrypanoGEN GWAS, discovery plus validation</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=TITLE%3A%22Genome-Wide+Association+Study+Reveals+Novel+Genetic+Markers+Associated+with+Human+African+Trypanosomiasis%22&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We have undertaken a genome wide association study (GWAS) using 3813 samples from T. b. gambiense and T.b. rhodesiense HAT foci in Guinea, Côte d’Ivoire, Cameroon, DRC, Malawi and Uganda.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


