        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5034897/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This created a joint data set (after all QC) comprised of 12,940 individuals (6,504 cases; 6,436 controls) drawn from five ancestry groups: 4,541 of European origin, and ~2,000 [range: 1,943-2,217] each of South Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, and African American origin (Extended Data Fig. 1; Extended Data Table 2; Supplementary 4).</rdfs:comment>
