        <obo:IAO_0000115>A project that sequenced the genomes of 4,000 participants of the TwinsUK and ALSPAC cohorts and the exomes of 6,000 individuals selected for extreme phenotypes and rare diseases, to find low-frequency and rare variants contributing to disease in the United Kingdom.</obo:IAO_0000115>
