        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of research volunteers recruited over more than 40 years by the Charles F. and Joanne Knight Alzheimer Disease Research Center at Washington University in St. Louis, United States, largely through its Memory and Aging Project and Memory Diagnostic Clinic, and followed with cognitive, neuropsychological, imaging, fluid biomarker, genomic and multi-omic assessments to study Alzheimer disease and related dementias.</obo:IAO_0000115>
