        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGES-RS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGES-Reykjavik</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Age Gene/Environment Susceptibility</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Age, Gene, Environment and Susceptibility-Reykjavik</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Aging Gene-Environment Susceptibility - Reykjavik Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Age, Gene/Environment Susceptibility-Reykjavik Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Iceland"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17351290+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This cohort of men and women born between 1907 and 1935 has been followed in Iceland since 1967 by the Icelandic Heart Association.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000470"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17351290+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The AGES-Reykjavik sample is drawn from an established population-based cohort, the Reykjavik Study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90086175</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>A genome-wide association study of serum proteins reveals shared loci with common diseases.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35078996</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8789779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We performed a GWAS of 4782 serum proteins encoded by 4135 unique human genes in the population-based AGES cohort of elderly Icelanders (n = 5368, Supplementary Data 1), measured by the slow-off rate modified aptamer (SOMAmer) platform as previously described8,18.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of older men and women born in 1907–1935, drawn from the population-based Reykjavik Study followed in Iceland by the Icelandic Heart Association and re-examined from 2002 with detailed cardiovascular, neurocognitive, musculoskeletal and metabolic phenotypes to study genetic susceptibility and gene–environment interaction in disease and disability in old age.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:17351290</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5764</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Reykjavik Study survivors examined at the AGES-Reykjavik baseline, 2002-2006</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10463542/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between 2002 and 2006, 5,764 individuals randomly selected from survivors of the Reykjavik Study were included.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
