        <dcterms:title>Evaluating the use of blood pressure polygenic risk scores across race/ethnic background groups.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37268629</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000383"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A healthcare-based biobank of more than 140,000 consenting patients of the Mass General Brigham network in the Greater Boston area of Massachusetts, enrolled since 2010 at Massachusetts General Hospital, Brigham and Women’s Hospital and local sites, linking biological samples, genomic data and health records to study genetic and environmental influences on disease in clinical practice.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41298473</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000383"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">142238</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals consented since 2010, as of 11 May 2023</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12749686/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Since 2010, 142,238 individuals within the Mass General Brigham (MGB) network, the largest healthcare system in Massachusetts, have consented to participate in the MGBB as of May 11, 2023 (Fig. 1a, Supplementary Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
