        <rdfs:comment>c, Map with the study sites for the discovery studies in Sweden (SCAPIS, SIMPLER-V, SIMPLER-U and MOS) and the replication cohort in Norway (HUNT), including the sample size and proportion of female participants in each study.</rdfs:comment>
