        <rdfs:comment>METSIM is a study of 10,197 Finnish men from Kuopio in the late-settlement region of northeast Finland designed to investigate factors associated with type 2 diabetes and cardiovascular diseases3 (Supplementary Table 2).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000393"/>
