        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:42753719</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Korean Genome and Epidemiology Study (KoGES) has undergone a strategic transformation towards ageing research with its 245 000 participants, now in their sixties and seventies, providing an invaluable long-term resource for studying healthy ageing and longevity.</rdfs:comment>
