        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004975"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000414"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid3652"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>mild cognitive impairment</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7803963/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The WADRC, previously described92, is a longitudinal cohort study of memory, aging, and AD in middle and older-aged adults who were recruited into one of six subgroups: (1) mild late-onset AD; (2) mild cognitive impairment (MCI); (3) age-matched healthy older controls (age &gt; 65); (4) middle-aged adults with a positive parental history of AD; (5) middle-aged adults with a negative parental history of AD; and (6) middle-aged adults with indeterminate parental history of AD.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000414"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid3654"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Alzheimer&apos;s disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7803963/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The WADRC, previously described92, is a longitudinal cohort study of memory, aging, and AD in middle and older-aged adults who were recruited into one of six subgroups: (1) mild late-onset AD; (2) mild cognitive impairment (MCI); (3) age-matched healthy older controls (age &gt; 65); (4) middle-aged adults with a positive parental history of AD; (5) middle-aged adults with a negative parental history of AD; and (6) middle-aged adults with indeterminate parental history of AD.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000414"/>
