        <rdfs:comment>SOCCS SOCCS study7,8 comprised 2,057 colorectal cancer cases (CRC) (61% male; mean age at diagnosis (65.8 ± 8.4) years) and 2,111 population controls (60% males; mean age 67.9±9.0 years) as ascertained in Scotland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
