        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Charles R Bronfman Institute for Personalized Medicine - IPM / BioBank Genome Wide Association Study of Cardiovascular, Renal and Metabolic Phenotypes</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
