        <rdfs:comment>The longitudinal CARDIA study was initiated in 1985 with the recruitment of young adult participants (aged 18-30 years) equally balanced by female and male sex and black and white race at 4 field centers located in Birmingham, AL, Chicago, IL, Minneapolis, MN, and Oakland, CA.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000425"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90444478</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study meta-analysis of neurofilament light (NfL) levels in blood reveals novel loci related to neurodegeneration.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39251807</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11385583/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Coronary Artery Risk Development in Young Adults Study (CARDIA) is conducted and supported by the National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute (NHLBI) in collaboration with the University of Alabama at Birmingham (HHSN268201800005I &amp; HHSN268201800007I), Northwestern University (HHSN268201800003I), University of Minnesota (HHSN268201800006I), and Kaiser Foundation Research Institute (HHSN268201800004I).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000425"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective cohort of young adults aged 18–30 years, balanced by sex and by Black and White race, recruited in 1985–1986 at four field centres in Birmingham, Alabama, Chicago, Illinois, Minneapolis, Minnesota and Oakland, California, and followed with repeated examinations into midlife to study the development of cardiovascular risk factors and disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32692748</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:36853610</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5419579/supplementaryFiles</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000425"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5115</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants aged 18-30 recruited at baseline, 1985-1986</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC7373261/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CARDIA study began in 1985 with recruitment of 5,115 participants aged 18 to 30 years at field centers located in Birmingham, AL, Chicago, IL, Minneapolis, MN, and Oakland, CA.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000425"/>
