        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective population-based cohort of 10,004 men and women of Chinese, Indian or Malay background aged 30–84, recruited from the Singapore general population in 2018–2022 by Nanyang Technological University, with behavioural, phenotypic and multi-omic measurements and health-record linkage for precision-medicine research in Asian populations.</owl:annotatedTarget>
