        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://healthabc.nia.nih.gov/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study cohort included 3,075 men and women, aged 70-79 at baseline; 45 percent of the women and 33 percent of the men are African American.</rdfs:comment>
