        <owl:annotatedTarget>A biobank cohort of patients of Geisinger Health System, an integrated health system in central and eastern Pennsylvania, United States, who since 2007 have given opt-in consent to link their samples to electronic health record data for broad research use, with genotype and exome sequence data generated in collaboration with the Regeneron Genetics Center.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26866580</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
