        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26866580</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>By the end of September, 2015 more than 90,000 Geisinger patients had enrolled, including more than 3,600 pediatric patients enrolled through parental or guardian consent.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
