        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34131117</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of the 3003 participants in the aspirin trial, 1786 were selected for whole-genome sequencing (WGS) in the Trans-Omics for Precision Medicine (TOPMed) Program based on 1) complete platelet function phenotyping and 2) largest family size.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
