        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of 121,700 female registered nurses in the United States aged 30–55 when enrolled through a baseline questionnaire in 1976, followed by repeated questionnaires and biospecimen collection to study lifestyle and other risk factors for major chronic diseases in women.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym Harvard also denotes Mass General Brigham Biobank (COHO:0000383), Health Professionals Follow-up Study (COHO:0000527) and Nurses&apos; Health Study II (COHO:0000619); this term is Nurses&apos; Health Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
