        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11046907/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The third replication dataset was derived from two prospective cohort studies in the US: the Nurses’ Health Study and the Health Professionals Follow-up Study [13, 55].</rdfs:comment>
