        <obo:IAO_0000116>married female registered nurses enrolled in 1976</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27459450</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We have summarized the evolution of the Nurses&apos; Health Study (NHS), a prospective cohort study of 121 700 married registered nurses launched in 1976; NHS II, which began in 1989 and enrolled 116 430 nurses; and NHS3, which began in 2010 and has ongoing enrollment.</rdfs:comment>
