    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4017"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>rheumatoid arthritis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11065441/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>EIRA, a case–control study established in 1996, currently contains &gt;5000 incident RA cases from the middle and southern regions of Sweden [18].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4019"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cigarette smoking</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC1754669</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To investigate the inﬂuence of environmental factors on the risk of developing RA and the interaction of these factors with genotype we started an extensive case-control study—the Epidemiological Investigation of RA (EIRA) study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4021"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>environmental factors</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC1754669</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To investigate the inﬂuence of environmental factors on the risk of developing RA and the interaction of these factors with genotype we started an extensive case-control study—the Epidemiological Investigation of RA (EIRA) study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sweden"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11065441/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>EIRA, a case–control study established in 1996, currently contains &gt;5000 incident RA cases from the middle and southern regions of Sweden [18].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90281046</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide investigation of persistence with methotrexate treatment in early rheumatoid arthritis.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37326842</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11065441/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Our primary analysis cohort consisted of early-RA patients receiving MTX in DMARD monotherapy as their first RA treatment, identified in the Epidemiological Investigation of RA (EIRA) biobank or the Swedish Rheumatology Quality Register’s (SRQ) biobank (SRQb).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case-control study established in Sweden in 1996, enrolling incident rheumatoid arthritis cases (now more than 5000) from the middle and southern regions of Sweden together with population controls, used to study genetic risk factors for rheumatoid arthritis and its ACPA-defined subsets and environmental factors such as cigarette smoking.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:12922955</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21156761</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:37326842</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3515</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>incident RA cases and population controls recruited 1995-2016; no total stated</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35168998</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This case–control study involved 3515 incident RA cases and 5429 controls recruited to the EIRA study between 1995 and 2016, within 1 year since RA symptom onset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000458"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5429</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>incident RA cases and population controls recruited 1995-2016; no total stated</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35168998</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This case–control study involved 3515 incident RA cases and 5429 controls recruited to the EIRA study between 1995 and 2016, within 1 year since RA symptom onset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
