        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">303</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>type 1 diabetes cases and controls from paediatric centres used for PRS validation</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41795035</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Specifically, in the multi-ancestry All of Us Biobank (AoU, N=89,699; Ncases=1084; Ncontrols=88,635), in a case–control multi-ancestry cohort from the Children&apos;s Hospital of Philadelphia, Center for Applied Genomics (CHOP-CAG, N=6498; Ncases=1094; Ncontrols=5404), in the UK Biobank (UKB, N=427,847; Ncases=778; Ncontrols=427,069) and in a Chinese case–control cohort across multiple paediatric centres named Genetic Risk Assessment for Chinese Eaglet-T1D (GRACE, N=597; Ncases=294; Ncontrols=303).</rdfs:comment>
