        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90102456</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000148</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre randomized cancer screening trial of about 155,000 men and women aged 55–74, enrolled from 1993 to 2001 at ten screening centres across the United States under the National Cancer Institute, testing whether screening reduces mortality from prostate, lung, colorectal and ovarian cancer, with participants followed for cancer incidence and death.</obo:IAO_0000115>
