        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CAG also denotes Chicago Asthma Genetics (COHO:0000036); this term is Center for Applied Genomics Biobank.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CHOP also denotes Philadelphia Cohort (COHO:0002255); this term is Center for Applied Genomics Biobank.</obo:IAO_0000116>
