        <obo:IAO_0000115>A family intervention study of the NHLBI Programs in Gene by Environment Interaction, of 1,048 white participants in 184 three-generation pedigrees previously screened at the Minnesota and Utah centres of the NHLBI Family Heart Study, who took a standardised high-fat meal challenge and three weeks of fenofibrate treatment, to study genetic determinants of the lipid response to diet and lipid-lowering drugs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
