        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1069</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>children assessed (848 parents assessed in addition), 2009-2012</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25012461</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Combined with newly recruited participants the NeuroIMAGE study comprehends an assessment of 1,069 children (751 from ADHD families; 318 from CON families) and 848 parents (582 from ADHD families; 266 from CON families).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
