        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based randomised non-pharmacological lifestyle intervention trial for the prevention of ischaemic heart disease, run in 1999–2006 at the Research Centre for Prevention and Health in Glostrup, Copenhagen, Denmark, on random samples of adults aged 30–60 drawn from a population of 61,301 and followed through questionnaires and central registers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6784</coho:numberOfParticipants>
