        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90134637</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort of a representative sample of healthy adults aged 25-41 in the Principality of Liechtenstein, enrolled from June 2010 without cardiovascular disease, diabetes or severe obesity, with ambulatory blood pressure, Holter ECG, spirometry, sleep oximetry and blood, urine and genetic sampling, and followed up every 3-5 years to study genetic and phenotypic predictors of cardiovascular risk factors in young adults.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2170</coho:numberOfParticipants>
