        <rdfs:comment>GAPP affords an excellent opportunity to assess genetic and phenotypic predictors of cardiovascular risk factors and their progression over time in young and healthy adults from the general population.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000515"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Liechtenstein"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9576575/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Genetic and phenotypic determinants of blood pressure and other cardiovascular risk factors (GAPP) is a population-based prospective cohort study involving a representative sample of healthy adults aged 25–41 years residing in the Principality of Liechtenstein (Conen et al., 2013).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000515"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90134637</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide analyses identify SCN5A as a susceptibility locus for premature atrial contraction frequency.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:36267918</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9576575/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Genetic and phenotypic determinants of blood pressure and other cardiovascular risk factors (GAPP) is a population-based prospective cohort study involving a representative sample of healthy adults aged 25–41 years residing in the Principality of Liechtenstein (Conen et al., 2013).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000515"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based prospective cohort of a representative sample of healthy adults aged 25-41 in the Principality of Liechtenstein, enrolled from June 2010 without cardiovascular disease, diabetes or severe obesity, with ambulatory blood pressure, Holter ECG, spirometry, sleep oximetry and blood, urine and genetic sampling, and followed up every 3-5 years to study genetic and phenotypic predictors of cardiovascular risk factors in young adults.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23299990</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000515"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2170</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>healthy adults enrolled at baseline (2010-2013)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6085127/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, the cohort is composed of a representative population of 2170 healthy adults aged 25–41 with residence in the Principality of Liechtenstein.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000515"/>
