        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective genome-wide association cohort of more than 25,000 initially healthy American female health professionals aged 45 or older from the Women&apos;s Health Study who gave a baseline blood sample, followed since 1992 for incident cardiovascular disease, cancer, diabetes and other outcomes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
