        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:20394692</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>From 2004 through 2007, we recruited 2,000 participants to the CCHC who are residents of Brownsville, Texas, which has 8 international crossing points to Matamoros, Mexico.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
