        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25254375</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We estimated individual ancestry proportions in a sample of 7,342 subjects ascertained in five countries (Brazil, Chile, Colombia, México and Perú).</rdfs:comment>
