        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4589"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>metabolic syndrome</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12677789/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CoLaus study: a population-based study to investigate the epidemiology and genetic determinants of cardiovascular risk factors and metabolic syndrome.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Switzerland"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID:18366642%20AND%20SRC:MED&amp;resultType=core&amp;format=json</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In order to assess the prevalence of cardiovascular risk factors (CVRFs) in the Caucasian population of Lausanne, Switzerland, we conducted a population-based study (Colaus Study).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90672046</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic determinants of zinc homeostasis and its role in cardiometabolic diseases.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41325371</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12677789/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a GWAS of urinary zinc levels in three prospective cohorts - SKIPOGH (Swiss Kidney Project on Genes in Hypertension, N = 896) [29,30], CoLaus|PsyCoLaus (Cohort Lausanne, N = 4,542) [31] and GCKD (German Chronic Kidney Disease study, N = 4,822) [32]</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based cohort of a random sample of 6,188 Caucasian adults aged 35 to 75 living in Lausanne, Switzerland, extensively phenotyped and genotyped genome-wide at baseline to study the prevalence and genetic determinants of cardiovascular risk factors and the metabolic syndrome, and followed up prospectively (with its psychiatric arm PsyCoLaus) from 2003 for cardiovascular events and mortality.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:18366642</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38388190</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6188</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Caucasian adults aged 35-75 examined at baseline (2003-2006)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:18366642</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Single-center, cross-sectional study including a random sample of 6,188 extensively phenotyped Caucasian subjects (3,251 women and 2,937 men) aged 35 to 75 years living in Lausanne, and genotyped using the 500 K Affymetrix chip technology.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>COLAUS</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>CoLaus</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


