        <rdfs:comment>We used data from the Melbourne Collaborative Cohort Study (MCCS), a prospective study that recruited 41,513 middle-aged and older Australians (99 % aged between 40 and 69 years, 59 % females) of white European origin between 1990 and 1994 (baseline) (Milne et al., 2017).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
