        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90244003</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A community-based prospective cohort of 10,030 men and women aged 40–69 from the urban city of Ansan and the rural town of Ansung (Anseong) in Gyeonggi Province, South Korea, recruited in 2001–2002 as the first cohort of the Korean Genome and Epidemiology Study and re-surveyed every two years, to study common chronic diseases and their genetic and environmental risk factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
