        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort of about 9,800 residents aged 30–74 years of Nagahama City, a largely rural city in Shiga Prefecture, central Japan, recruited in 2008–2010 and run from Kyoto University Graduate School of Medicine, with blood samples, questionnaires, health examinations, genotyping and follow-up examinations (the first in 2013–2016) for genomic and clinical research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9809</coho:numberOfParticipants>
