        <rdfs:comment>Genome-wide association study (GWAS) and replication studies were conducted in 9850 individuals from the Nagahama Study (from 2013 to 2016) and 935 individuals from the Hisayama Study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
