        <rdfs:comment>At the end of November 2004, the RISC study had recruited 1504 participants in 14 countries (Austria, Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, Greece, The Netherlands, Ireland, Italy, Sweden, Spain, Switzerland, United Kingdom and Serbia and Montenegro).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
