        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002064"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90502765</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international registry and cohort, funded by the US National Cancer Institute and begun in 1997, of colorectal cancer cases, their unaffected relatives and population-based controls recruited through six centres in Australasia and North America (the Australasian, Mayo Clinic, Ontario, Seattle, University of Hawaii and USC Consortium registries), as a resource for research on familial and sporadic colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">42489</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCFR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCFR-II</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCFRC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Colon CFR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Colon Cancer Family Registry Cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Colorectal Cancer Family Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cooperative Familial Registry for Colorectal Studies</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Colon Cancer Family Registry</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid4816">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005575"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000547"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4816"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>colorectal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3616155/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data for this study were obtained through the Colon CFR, a National Cancer Institute (NCI)–funded registry of CRC cases, unaffected family members, and population-based controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000547"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/New_Zealand"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3288900/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Colon Cancer Family Registry (Colon CFR) has recruited participants from the US, Canada, Australia and New Zealand.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000547"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90502765</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association studies and Mendelian randomization analyses provide insights into the causes of early-onset colorectal cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38408508</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11213623/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a GWAS meta-analysis of 6176 EOCRC cases and 65 829 controls from the Genetics and Epidemiology of Colorectal Cancer Consortium (GECCO), the Colorectal Transdisciplinary Study (CORECT), the Colon Cancer Family Registry (CCFR), and the UK Biobank.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000547"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international registry and cohort, funded by the US National Cancer Institute and begun in 1997, of colorectal cancer cases, their unaffected relatives and population-based controls recruited through six centres in Australasia and North America (the Australasian, Mayo Clinic, Ontario, Seattle, University of Hawaii and USC Consortium registries), as a resource for research on familial and sporadic colorectal cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3616155/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4762074/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000547"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">42489</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants (cases, relatives and controls) from 15,049 families recruited 1998-2012</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC5913593</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 42 489 study participants from 15 049 families were recruited between 1998 and 2012 in the USA, Canada, Australia and New Zealand.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
