        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international multicentre case-control study of risk factors for first acute stroke, which recruited 13,462 stroke cases and 13,488 community or hospital controls matched for age, sex and region from 142 centres in 32 countries between 2007 and 2015, with a genotyped subset of consenting participants used in genetic studies of stroke.</obo:IAO_0000115>
