        <rdfs:comment>we measured HDL‐mediated cholesterol efflux using 2 different cellular models to generate 4 different CEC phenotypes in 996 CAD‐free participants and 1000 patients with myocardial infarction from the MHI Biobank (MHI Biobank phase 1 in Table S1)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
