        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals in the 2022 GIANT height GWAS meta-analysis (281 studies, GIANT and 23andMe)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9605867/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We performed genetic analysis of up to 5,380,080 individuals from 281 studies from the GIANT consortium and 23andMe.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
