    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid4954"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000165"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000870"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000874"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000936"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001567"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001571"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002009"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002020"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002133"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002150"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002165"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002174"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002458"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90455518</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium established in 2004 by research groups leading large molecular epidemiology studies of lung cancer, which pools data from its member case-control and cohort studies to study lung cancer risk and prognosis; its OncoArray project genotyped about 36,000 participants of European descent.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">36000</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ILCCO</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INTEGRAL-ILCCO</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Lung Cancer Consortium (Lung cancer OncoArray project)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Lung and Cancer Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>OncoArray Project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">International Lung Cancer Consortium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid4954">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008903"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid4954"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>lung cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3002160/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We have therefore conducted a pooled analysis of tobacco smoking and risk of BAC within the framework of the International Lung Cancer Consortium (ILCCO), which includes completed and ongoing studies of molecular and genetic epidemiology of lung cancer [15], with the aim of providing a precise measurement of the association between tobacco smoking and BAC.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000165"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4554719/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Four lung cancer GWAS in the International Lung Cancer Consortium were used to identify variants associated with both lung cancer and first-degree family history of lung cancer: the Toronto study [Hung et al., 2008; McKay et al., 2008], the Central Europe study [Hung et al., 2008], the MD Anderson study [Amos et al., 2008], and the Germany study [Landi et al., 2009; Sauter et al., 2008].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000870"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8815061/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The INTEGRAL-ILCCO project includes a total of 1,059 lung cancer cases and 899 controls from four sites: Harvard School of Public Health (HSPH), International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), University of Liverpool, and Mount Sinai Hospital and Princess Margaret Hospital in Toronto (Supplementary Table S1; ref. 17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000874"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9402242/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The imputed genotypes (reference panel: HRC r1.1) from 46,783 individuals from INTEGRAL (Integrative Analysis of Lung Cancer Etiology and Risk)-ILCCO (International Lung Cancer Consortium) lung cancer consortium were analyzed in this study. The subjects came from 9 independent studies: the OncoArray Consortium Lung Study (OncoArray), including 16,845 lung cancer cases and 13,057 controls, was used as the discovery. Individuals from another 8 smaller independent studies: Affymetrix Axiom Array Study (AFFY), the Genetic Epidemiology of Lung Cancer (GELCC) Consortium, the Environment and Genetics in Lung cancer Etiology study (EAGLE), the International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), MD Anderson Cancer Center Study (MDACC)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000936"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8815061/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The INTEGRAL-ILCCO project includes a total of 1,059 lung cancer cases and 899 controls from four sites: Harvard School of Public Health (HSPH), International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), University of Liverpool, and Mount Sinai Hospital and Princess Margaret Hospital in Toronto (Supplementary Table S1; ref. 17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001567"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5560148/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In 2010 the CAPUA Study was included in the ILCCO (International Lung Cancer Consortium, http://ilcco.iarc.fr) and SYNERGY group (http://SYNERGY.iarc.fr) from the International Agency for Research on Cancer 29, 30.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001571"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5824613/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Four ILCCO studies are included in this pooled analysis. The collaborating cohorts have been described in detail previously [45–51]. These are the Carotene and Retinol Efficacy Trial (CARET), European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition Study (EPIC), Shanghai Cohort Study (SCS), and Singapore Chinese Health Study (SCHS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Copenhagen Copenhagen lung cancer study Copenhagen S. E. Bojesen Denmark Hosp.CC 2004 (controls) 2012-2013 (cases)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002009"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>LLP Liverpool Lung Cancer Project U. Liverpool J.K. Field UK Cohort 1999-2007, 1999-2011</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002020"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.downstate.edu/research/centers-departments/henri-begleiter-neurodynamics-laboratory/_documents/2012-Hartz-IncreasedgeneticvulnerabilitytosmokingatCHRNA5inearly-onsetsmokers-Supplement.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>LUCY is a member of the International Lung Cancer COnsortium (ILCCO), which aims sharing comparable data from ongoing lung cancer case-control and cohort studies to achieve greater power, especially for subgroup analyses.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002133"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>NELCS New England Lung Cancer Study Dartmouth College A. Andrew USA Pop. CC 2005-2007</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002150"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>NICCC-LCA Clalit National Israeli Cancer Control Center- lung cancer study Carmel Medical Center &amp; Technion G. Rennert Israel/ Europe Pop.CC 2005-ongoing</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002165"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Nijmegen The Nijmegen Lung Cancer Study Radboud University Medical Centre L. A. Kiemeney The Netherlands Pop. CC 2002-2008</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002174"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Norway Norway Lung Cancer Study NIOH A. Haugen Norway Pop. CC 1986-2005</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002458"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>TLC Total Lung Cancer: Molecular Epidemiology of Lung Cancer Survival Moffitt Cancer Center, Tampa, FL M.B. Schabath USA case only 2012--present</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90455518</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Multi-ancestry GWAS meta-analyses of lung cancer reveal susceptibility loci and elucidate smoking-independent genetic risk.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39366959</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11452618/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>followed by a meta-analysis with the EA International Lung Cancer Consortium OncoArray study (ILCCO)7, for a total of 39,781 cases and 119,158 controls</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium established in 2004 by research groups leading large molecular epidemiology studies of lung cancer, which pools data from its member case-control and cohort studies to study lung cancer risk and prognosis; its OncoArray project genotyped about 36,000 participants of European descent.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3002160/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
