        <obo:IAO_0000116>European-descent subjects genotyped in the ILCCO OncoArray project (2017)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5619832/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In this study, we analyzed OncoArray genotypic data of 36,000 subjects of European descent in ILCCO; among them, 17,037 provided individual epidemiological data and were of European descent.</rdfs:comment>
