        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC10785925</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As of March 20, 2023, 174,595 participants have enrolled in the study (from all 50 US states) and 165,119 samples have been shipped to deCODE or to IPG for analysis.</rdfs:comment>
