        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11617231/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The HVH study is a population-based case-control study that includes individuals who experienced cardiovascular events, including a first VTE, and also included genetic analyses and performed a follow-up of the VTE cases for VTE recurrence.</rdfs:comment>
