        <obo:IAO_0000115>A clinic-based cohort of patients of European origin attending the only public sleep clinic in Western Australia, in Perth, most of them referred for sleep-disordered breathing, with questionnaires, biochemistry, DNA and in-laboratory polysomnography collected for over 3,000 patients by 2010 towards a target of 4,000 and linkage to Western Australian health data, to study the epidemiology and genetics of obstructive sleep apnoea and its comorbidities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
