    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid5226"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000610"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90301397</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000734</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Spanish colorectal cancer study combining two case-control studies: incident colorectal cancer cases and hospital controls recruited at the University Hospital of Bellvitge, L&apos;Hospitalet de Llobregat (Barcelona), in 1996–1998, and cases and population controls recruited at Bellvitge and the Hospital of León in 2007–2015, genotyped to study the genetics and genomics of colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Colorectal Cancer Genetics Study also denotes Colorectal Cancer Genetic Susceptibility Study (COHO:0001603); this term is Colorectal Cancer Genetics &amp; Genomics.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1801</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CRC Genetics Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CRCGEN</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Colorectal Cancer Genetics &amp; Genomics, Spanish study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Colorectal Cancer Genetics Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Spain</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>The Spanish study (University Hospital of Bellvitge, Hospital of Leon)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Colorectal Cancer Genetics &amp; Genomics</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid5226">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005575"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid5226"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>colorectal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8574048/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The second study was conducted in parallel in the University Hospital of Bellvitge and in the Hospital of León, León, during 2007–2015 and recruited a total of 633 incident CRC cases (313 Bellvitge and 320 León) and 571 population controls (free of CRC, 164 Bellvitge and 407 León).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8574048/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>CRCGEN combines data of two Spanish case-control studies.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90301397</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Germline genetic regulation of the colorectal tumor immune microenvironment.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38664626</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11046907/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The second replication data set (Colorectal Cancer Genetics Study; CRCGEN) included FFPE and frozen samples from 162 stage II microsatellite stable colon cancer patients with immunoSEQ data [54].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000585"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000734</owl:annotatedTarget>
