        <rdfs:comment>This study population consisted of 3619 participants from 2 observational studies for whom genetic data were available: Colorectal Cancer Genetics &amp; Genomics (CRCGEN; n = 1801) and Colorectal Cancer Screening (COLSCREEN; n = 1818).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
