        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
