        <rdfs:comment>This case-cohort study aims to investigate how genetic and potentially modifiable lifestyle and behavioural factors, particularly diet and physical activity, interact in their influence on the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
