        <rdfs:comment>cases of incident type 2 diabetes occurring in eight of the 10 EPIC countries (Denmark, France, Germany, Italy, Netherlands, Spain, Sweden, and UK) between 1991 and 2007 were ascertained and verified by the InterAct consortium across 26 study centres</rdfs:comment>
