        <rdfs:comment>The North Carolina Colon Cancer Studies I and II (NCCCS I and NCCCS II) were population-based case-control studies conducted in 33 counties of North Carolina.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000597"/>
