        <dcterms:title>Genetic influences on circulating retinol and its relationship to human health.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38374065</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10876955/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In this study, we used three input datasets – INTERVAL, METSIM, and ATBC/PLCO.</rdfs:comment>
