        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1068</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>probands with combined-type ADHD (IMAGE I), besides siblings and parents (2007)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21473745</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Behavioural data were collected from 1068 probands with the combined type of attention deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD-CT) and 1446 &apos;unselected&apos; siblings.</rdfs:comment>
