        <rdfs:comment>The PROGReSS study is founded by grants from the Spanish Ministry of Health (INT15/00070; INT16/00154; FIS PI10/00164, FIS PI13/02030; FIS PI16/00046); the Spanish Ministry of Economy and Competitiveness (PTA2014-10228-I) and Fondo Europeo de Desarrollo Regional (FEDER 2007-2013).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000611"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
