        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4924371/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data were not available for grade in two (MEC/UTAH), or stage in three (CPCS1/CPCS2/QLD), of the PRACTICAL studies, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
