        <owl:annotatedTarget>A longitudinal hospital-based cohort and biobank of patients of the Montreal Heart Institute, a cardiology hospital enriched for cardiovascular disease, who consented to give a baseline blood sample with medical, nutritional, psychosocial, sociodemographic and lifestyle data, updated through hospital record linkage and four-yearly follow-up interviews, and who are genotyped for genetic and pharmacogenomic studies.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12480102/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
