        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym Harvard also denotes Mass General Brigham Biobank (COHO:0000383), Nurses&apos; Health Study (COHO:0000456) and Health Professionals Follow-up Study (COHO:0000527); this term is Nurses&apos; Health Study II.</obo:IAO_0000116>
