        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8243879/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>National Institute on Alcohol Abuse and Alcoholism (NIAAA) cohort Cohort description The sample consisted of 119 European American (EA) and 82 African American (AA) healthy controls that were recruited at the National Institute on Alcohol Abuse and Alcoholism (NIAAA) at the National Institutes of Health (NIH), USA.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
