        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of DNA samples and lymphoblastoid cell lines from Utah residents with ancestry from northern and western Europe, originally collected by the Centre d&apos;Etude du Polymorphisme Humain (CEPH), that forms one of the four founding population samples of the International HapMap Project and is used as a reference for human genetic variation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
