        <rdfs:comment>We combined case-control data from the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium (WTCCC), Diabetes Genetics Initiative (DGI) and Finland-US Investigation of NIDDM genetics (FUSION) scans (the subjects of a previous joint analysis), with those from scans performed by deCODE genetics, the Diabetes Gene Discovery Group, the Cooperative Health Research in the Region of Augsburg group (KORAgen), the Rotterdam study and the European Special Population Research Network (EUROSPAN).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
