        <rdfs:comment>To inform our hypothesis we used two independent cohorts for our study, Determining the Influence of Susceptibility COnveying Variants Related to one-Year mortality after BMT (DISCOVeRY-BMT) composed of acute myeloid leukemia (AML), MDS and acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL) patients and their ≥8/8 HLA-matched unrelated donors.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000642"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
