        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8548922/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The DISCOVeRY-BMT study population was contributed by 151 centers in the United States to the Center for International Blood and Marrow Transplant Research (CIBMTR) and consists of two cohorts of ALL, AML and MDS patients and their healthy ≥8/8 HLA-matched URDs described previously [5], [6], [7], [8], [9], [10], [11].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
