        <rdfs:comment>We also considered 2661 samples with cognitive impairment from three population-based longitudinal studies: AgeCode [53], SNAC-K [54] (both included in EADB-core) and 3C [55] (included in EADI) (Supplementary Table S3).</rdfs:comment>
