        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000685"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90162599</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium led from Cardiff University that brought together Alzheimer&apos;s disease cases and screened elderly controls recruited by institutions in the United Kingdom, Germany and the United States, with population controls from existing British and German cohorts, into a genome-wide association dataset of Alzheimer&apos;s disease; one of the four datasets meta-analysed by the International Genomics of Alzheimer&apos;s Project.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3941</coho:numberOfCases>
