        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10242187/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Two thousand and ninety‐eight participants were genotyped on Illumina Infinium® Global Screening Array as a membership service from 23andMe Inc; imputation was performed using the Michigan Imputation Server.</rdfs:comment>
