        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90454523</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A six-week multicentre randomised open-label pharmacogenetic trial cohort of about 3,000 Han Chinese inpatients with schizophrenia in an acute phase, recruited through the Chinese Antipsychotics Pharmacogenomics Consortium of five research centres and their affiliated psychiatric hospitals in China, established in 2010, and randomly assigned to one of six antipsychotic treatments, to identify predictors of antipsychotic efficacy and adverse reactions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3067</coho:numberOfParticipants>
