        <rdfs:comment>The discovery cohort consisted of 3067 patients (2016 participants were reserved after quality control) with schizophrenia in the acute phase and was derived from the Chinese Antipsychotics Pharmacogenomics Consortium (CAPOC) [14].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000662"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/China"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12362978/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We would like to thank the Chinese Antipsychotics Pharmacogenomics Consortium for assisting in the recruitment of participants (including 5 research centers: Peking University Sixth Hospital, West China Hospital of Sichuan University, the Second Xiangya Hospital of Central South University, Beijing Anding Hospital Affiliated to Capital Medical University, and Beijing Huilongguan Hospital; the Consortium leads 32 psychiatric hospitals in China in total).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000662"/>
