        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38336841</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41380-024-02447-2</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also thank the assistance from the Chinese Antipsychotics Pharmacogenomics Consortium and the research assistant from Peking University Sixth Hospital (Xuan Lu).</rdfs:comment>
