        <owl:annotatedTarget>A French case-control and family-based cohort of asthma cases recruited in chest clinics in Grenoble, Lyon, Marseille, Montpellier and Paris, their first-degree relatives and population-based controls, enrolled in 1991–1995 and followed up in 2003–2007 and later, to study the genetic and environmental causes of asthma, bronchial hyperresponsiveness and atopy.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35624665</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:8590334</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
