        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Northern California Breast Cancer Family Registry (NC-BCFR) was initiated in 1995 and enrolled ~4000 women with incident breast cancer and family members (John et al., 2019).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
