    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid6084"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>irritable bowel syndrome</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8571093/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Our discovery cohort combined cases of IBS identified in UKB with cases from the Bellygenes initiative.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90860773</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Large-scale meta- and cross-trait analyses uncover shared genetic risk factors for IBS and psychiatric disorders.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:42221328</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13216503/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This dataset was derived from a prior meta-analysis (12) that integrated two independent cohorts: the UK Biobank (UKB; 40,548 cases and 293,220) and the Bellygenes initiative (12,852 cases and 139,981 controls).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international collaborative initiative that pooled individual-level and aggregate genetic data on 12,852 people with irritable bowel syndrome and 139,981 controls from multiple studies for genome-wide association studies of irritable bowel syndrome.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34741163</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12852</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>IBS cases and controls in the 2021 GWAS meta-analysis (no total stated)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8571093/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This resulted from pooling IBS cases across all case definitions to maximize power, in a meta-analysis of data from UKB (40,548 cases and 293,220 controls; Supplementary Tables 1 and 2) and the international collaborative Bellygenes initiative (12,852 cases and 139,981 controls; Methods and Supplementary Table 9).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">139981</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>IBS cases and controls in the 2021 GWAS meta-analysis (no total stated)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8571093/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This resulted from pooling IBS cases across all case definitions to maximize power, in a meta-analysis of data from UKB (40,548 cases and 293,220 controls; Supplementary Tables 1 and 2) and the international collaborative Bellygenes initiative (12,852 cases and 139,981 controls; Methods and Supplementary Table 9).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000674"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Bellygenes</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000675 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000675">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid6091"/>
