        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7614755/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also annotated loci with eQTLs in skeletal muscle identified in FUSION (P &lt; 0.05)80.</rdfs:comment>
