        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomized, placebo-controlled trial of Ginkgo biloba for preventing incident dementia in 3069 adults aged 75 and over, 2587 cognitively normal and 482 with mild cognitive impairment, conducted from 2000 to 2008 at five academic centers in the United States.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym GEM also denotes Genetic Epidemiology of Migraine Study (COHO:0001770) and Genes in Myopia Study (COHO:0001806); this term is Ginkgo Evaluation of Memory Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3069</coho:numberOfParticipants>
