        <rdfs:comment>Seven cohorts are included in the GWAS phase of the GUARDIAN study: five family-based studies (IRAS Family, BetaGene, MACAD, HTN-IR, NIDDM-Athero; total 3925 individuals) and two non-family based studies (IRAS, TRIPOD; total 411 individuals).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001036"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3968231/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Seven cohorts are included in the GWAS phase of the GUARDIAN study: five family-based studies (IRAS Family, BetaGene, MACAD, HTN-IR, NIDDM-Athero; total 3925 individuals) and two non-family based studies (IRAS, TRIPOD; total 411 individuals).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001045"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3968231/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Seven cohorts are included in the GWAS phase of the GUARDIAN study: five family-based studies (IRAS Family, BetaGene, MACAD, HTN-IR, NIDDM-Athero; total 3925 individuals) and two non-family based studies (IRAS, TRIPOD; total 411 individuals).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3968231/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Individuals of self-reported Mexican-American ethnicity were recruited in San Antonio, TX and San Luis Valley, CO.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:24124113</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Insulin sensitivity and insulin clearance are heritable and have strong genetic correlation in Mexican Americans.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24124113</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3968231/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study described herein, Genetics UndeRlying Diabetes In hispANics, or GUARDIAN, was formed to eventually conduct a GWAS in seven Mexican-American cohorts of insulin sensitivity and insulin clearance directly quantified by the euglycemic clamp and FSIGT.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A consortium of seven Mexican-American cohorts in the United States (the IRAS Family Study, BetaGene, MACAD, HTN-IR, NIDDM-Athero, IRAS and TRIPOD; 4,336 individuals in 1,346 pedigrees) formed to conduct genome-wide association studies of insulin sensitivity and insulin clearance measured by euglycemic clamp or frequently sampled intravenous glucose tolerance test.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24124113</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4336</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Mexican-American individuals in 1,346 pedigrees across seven member cohorts (2014)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24124113</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>GUARDIAN is comprised of seven cohorts, consisting of 4,336 Mexican-American individuals in 1,346 pedigrees.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000687"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GUARDIAN</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


