        <rdfs:comment>COMPASS Consortium, EPIC-CVD Consortium, EPIC-InterAct Consortium, ISGC, METASTROKE Consortium, Neurology Working Group of the CHARGE Consortium, NINDS-SiGN, UK Young Lacunar DNA Study, and MEGASTROKE Consortium.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
