        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collaboration that meta-analyses genome-wide association datasets from ischaemic stroke case-control cohorts of European ancestry (initially 15 cohorts with 12,389 cases and 62,004 controls) to validate previously reported associations and identify new genetic associations with ischaemic stroke and its subtypes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23041239</obo:IAO_0000119>
