        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6124629/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>participants of both Surveys, mostly living in Edinburgh and the surrounding area (the Lothians) in older age, were invited to participate in the Lothian Birth Cohort (LBC) studies.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000699"/>
