        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of 1,068 young men aged 18–20, randomly identified in the greater Gothenburg area of Sweden from national population registers, initiated to determine environmental and genetic factors involved in the regulation of bone and fat mass, with a five-year follow-up examination.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1068</coho:numberOfParticipants>
