        <rdfs:comment>The Genomics of overweight in Young Adults (GOYA) study is a nested study within the DNBC, and conducted in collaboration with the MRC Integrative Epidemiology Unit at the University of Bristol (MC_UU_12013/1-9).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000710"/>
