        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of African American lung cancer cases and controls drawn from eight US lung cancer studies, among them the Southern Community Cohort Study, the NCI-MD Lung Cancer Case-Control Study, the MD Anderson Lung Cancer Epidemiology Study and the Northern California Lung Cancer Study, genotyped for a genome-wide association study of lung cancer and smoking phenotypes in African Americans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1737</coho:numberOfCases>
