        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants in the NIDDK Central Repository IBDGC collection (cases, controls and family members)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://repository.niddk.nih.gov/study/26</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>11,265 Participants</rdfs:comment>
