        <rdfs:comment>DNA samples from 1,775 unrelated healthy subjects of European ancestry were taken from the Phenomics and Genomics Sample (PAGES), which is comprised of ~3,000 controls, 1,000 schizophrenia patients and 300 individuals with other diagnoses.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
