        <obo:IAO_0000115>A study of children and adolescents aged 2–16 years with physician-diagnosed asthma recruited through 15 secondary-care asthma clinics across Scotland from 2008 to 2011, with questionnaire and DNA data to study genetic and environmental influences on asthma and its treatment response.</obo:IAO_0000115>
