        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90482704</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>The genetic architecture of hip shape and its role in the development of hip osteoarthritis and fracture.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39574169</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11792254/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In this study, we aimed to conduct a GWAS meta-analysis of the top 10 HSMs, in UKB and Shanghai Changfeng (SC) cohorts, where these HSM have been derived using our novel automated point placement method [1].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
