        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of Mediterranean (southern European) pregnant women attending the Diabetes and Pregnancy Unit of Hospital Universitario Virgen de la Victoria in Málaga, Spain, after a positive glucose screening test, recruited from 2019 with and without gestational diabetes and followed with their offspring to one year after birth, to study the effect of gestational diabetes on the epigenome of mother and child during the first 1000 days.</obo:IAO_0000115>
