        <rdfs:comment>The study population consisted of 1,062 newly diagnosed colon cancer cases (rectal cases excluded) identified and referred by the Kentucky Cancer Registry, a participant in the National Cancer Institute’s Surveillance, Epidemiology, and End Results (SEER) Program as well as the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention’s National Program of Cancer Registries.</rdfs:comment>
