        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3917605/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 4,400 Mexican hypertriglyceridemic cases and normotriglyceridemic controls were included in stage 1 and 2 (see Supplementary Table 1 for clinical characteristics).</rdfs:comment>
