        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5943543/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of those selected, 2258 (88%) completed an in‐person interview, including 1119 (89%) Hispanic, 543 (87%) African American, and 596 (86%) NHW cases.</rdfs:comment>
