        <rdfs:comment>The GWAS SIGMA project used Mexican and Latin American populations described in Section 2: the Diabetes in Mexico Study (DMS), the Mexico City Diabetes Study (MCDS), the Multiethnic Cohort (MEC), and the UNAM/INCMNSZ Diabetes Study (UIDS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000736"/>
