        <rdfs:comment>deCODE CAD 6640/ 27611 54.7 36.3/ 61.9 74.8 (11.8)/ 53.7 (21.5) 27.7 (4.7)/ 27.0 (5.4)† MI: MONICA criteria (&lt;75 yrs) or discharge diagnosis of MI; CAD: PCI or participation in CVD genetics program with self-report of CABG or PCI, or discharge diagnosis of angina pectoris, MI or chronic ischaemic heart disease Population sample</rdfs:comment>
