        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST012556</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The participants of BioVU, the Vanderbilt University Medical Center biorepository, studied by the Epidemiologic Architecture for Genes Linked to Environment (EAGLE) site of the NHGRI Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology (PAGE) program in trans-ethnic genetic studies of complex traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym EAGLE also denotes Environment And Genetics in Lung cancer Etiology study (COHO:0000749) and EArly Genetics and Lifecourse Epidemiology consortium (COHO:0000750); this term is EAGLE BioVU.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">15863</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EAGLE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Epidemiologic Architecture for Genes Linked to Environment BioVU</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EAGLE BioVU</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000751"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6059436/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology (PAGE) Study, a consortium of ancestrally diverse genetic studies from the US, is well-positioned to investigate the genetics of complex traits within a trans-ethnic context [34].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000751"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000417"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6059436/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Epidemiologic Architecture for Genes Linked to Environment (EAGLE)-accessing the Vanderbilt University Medical Center’s biorepository (BioVU);</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000751"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST012556</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>The genetic underpinnings of variation in ages at menarche and natural menopause among women from the multi-ethnic Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology (PAGE) Study: A trans-ethnic meta-analysis.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:30044860</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6059436/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All studies in this analysis obtained Institutional Review Board approval and written informed consent from all participants, with the exception of EAGLE BioVU, which obtained Institutional Review Board approval to follow an opt-out consent process, described in detail separately [36,37].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000751"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The participants of BioVU, the Vanderbilt University Medical Center biorepository, studied by the Epidemiologic Architecture for Genes Linked to Environment (EAGLE) site of the NHGRI Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology (PAGE) program in trans-ethnic genetic studies of complex traits.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:30044860</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000751"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">15863</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>non-European-American BioVU subjects genotyped on Metabochip by EAGLE (2011)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5543359/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study population consists of 15,863 mostly non-European American subjects from BioVU, the Vanderbilt University Medical Center (VUMC) biorepository linked to de-identified EHRs.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
