        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international prostate cancer genetics consortium, linked to the PRACTICAL consortium, that meta-analyses existing genome-wide association data and generates new GWAS, exome-array, iCOGS and OncoArray genotype data from prostate cancer case-control studies to discover prostate cancer risk loci.</obo:IAO_0000115>
