        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90652533</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of lung cancer in African American and non-Hispanic White adults from the Detroit metropolitan area, in which patients were enrolled within 12 months of diagnosis at the Karmanos Cancer Institute or Henry Ford Health System between 2012 and 2018, together with controls without lung cancer, to study inflammation, ancestry and other risk factors for lung cancer and racial disparities in the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1662</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3040</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INHALE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INHALE study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inflammation, Health, Ancestry, and Lung Epidemiology study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INflammation, Health, Ancestry and Lung Epidemiology study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid6842">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008903"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid6842"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>lung cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A35024781+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This study included 912 patients with lung cancer and 1457 controls without lung cancer enrolled in an epidemiology study (INHALE [Inflammation, Health, Ancestry, and Lung Epidemiology]) in the Detroit metropolitan area between May 15, 2012, and March 31, 2018.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A35024781+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This study included 912 patients with lung cancer and 1457 controls without lung cancer enrolled in an epidemiology study (INHALE [Inflammation, Health, Ancestry, and Lung Epidemiology]) in the Detroit metropolitan area between May 15, 2012, and March 31, 2018.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90652533</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study for lung cancer in 6531 African Americans reveals new susceptibility loci.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40341939</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12407114/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>ONCO, OncoArray consortium of lung study; AA-NCI, lung cancer and smoking phenotypes in African American cases and controls; INHALE, inflammation, health, ancestry and lung epidemiology study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study of lung cancer in African American and non-Hispanic White adults from the Detroit metropolitan area, in which patients were enrolled within 12 months of diagnosis at the Karmanos Cancer Institute or Henry Ford Health System between 2012 and 2018, together with controls without lung cancer, to study inflammation, ancestry and other risk factors for lung cancer and racial disparities in the disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35024781</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:39854657</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9307937/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1662</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>genotyped lung cancer cases and controls (analysed subset, NHW and AA), 2018</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC11771983</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These P/LP variants were genotyped in a sample of 3,040 lung cancer cases and controls from the INHALE study (non-Hispanic White: n=1,915; African American: n=1,125) and were tested for their association with lung cancer using multivariate logistic regression adjusting for age, sex, pack-years, and race.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3040</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>genotyped lung cancer cases and controls (analysed subset, NHW and AA), 2018</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC11771983</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These P/LP variants were genotyped in a sample of 3,040 lung cancer cases and controls from the INHALE study (non-Hispanic White: n=1,915; African American: n=1,125) and were tested for their association with lung cancer using multivariate logistic regression adjusting for age, sex, pack-years, and race.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000757"/>
