    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000763"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:38025163</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Six-Year Incidence of Visual Impairment in a Multiethnic Asian Population: The Singapore Epidemiology of Eye Diseases Study.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38025163</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10630666/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a multiethnic population-based cohort study using subjects recruited from the Singapore Epidemiology of Eye Diseases (SEED) study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000763"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multiethnic population-based cohort of Malay, Indian and Chinese adults in Singapore, recruited at baseline through the Singapore Malay Eye Study (2004–2006), the Singapore Indian Eye Study (2007–2009) and the Singapore Chinese Eye Study (2009–2011) and re-examined about six years later (SEED-2), to study the incidence and risk factors of eye diseases and visual impairment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38025163</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000763"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10033</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Malay, Indian and Chinese adults aged 40-80 who took part at baseline (2004-2011)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10630666/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All subjects provided written informed consent.In brief, an age-stratified random sampling method was used to select 13 271 subjects (4168 Malays, 4497 Indians, and 4606 Chinese) aged 40–80 years, from which a total of 10 033 subjects (3280 Malays, 3400 Indians, and 3353 Chinese) participated in the study, thereby achieving a response rate of 75.6%.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000763"/>
