        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4794124/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The TAICHI Consortium is a collaborative study in Taiwan, with the aims to genotype a large number of Taiwanese Chinese subjects with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip and to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits [13–20].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90267569</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study and functional characterization identifies candidate genes for insulin-stimulated glucose uptake.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37291194</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7614755/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Two of these studies included participants of Hispanic American ancestry (MACAD and HTN-IR; N ISI = 1095, N IFC = 1099) and 1 included participants of East Asian ancestry (TAICHI; N ISI = 730 N IFC = 739); the remaining 25 studies included individuals of European ancestry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collaborative consortium in Taiwan, with Taichung Veterans General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital, National Taiwan University Hospital and the National Health Research Institutes ascertaining subjects, that genotyped Taiwanese Chinese participants of several studies with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26982883</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3133</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>subjects genotyped with the CardioMetaboChip for the TAICHI CAD analysis (CAD cases and controls), 2016</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26982883</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As part of the TAICHI Consortium, we have collected and genotyped 8556 subjects from Taiwan, comprising 5423 controls and 3133 cases with coronary artery disease, for 9087 CAD SNPs using the CardioMetaboChip.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
