    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid6969"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cleft lip and/or palate</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11227803/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Cleft Collective (https://www.bristol.ac.uk/cleft-collective/) is a prospective longitudinal cohort study of children born with CL/P and their families.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A38969383+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Recruitment occurs across the UK and started in November 2013.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90709864</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic heterogeneity and homogeneity among orofacial cleft subtypes: genome-wide association studies in the cleft collective.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41075272</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12627943/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Children born with an orofacial cleft and their families who were registered at one of 17 cleft centres across the UK were recruited to the Cleft Collective Cohort study between November 2013 and June 2020.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A national longitudinal prospective cohort of children born with cleft lip and/or palate and their families, recruited across the UK from November 2013 through NHS cleft centres, with biological samples, questionnaires, surgical data and record linkage to study the causes, treatments and long-term outcomes of orofacial clefts.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38969383</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11298</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants recruited to date (4020 children with cleft plus mothers, fathers, partners and siblings), 2024</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11227803/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>At the time of writing this protocol, 4020 children born with CL/P had been recruited (a total of 11 298 participants including study child, mothers, fathers, mother’s partner and siblings).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000770"/>
