    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <coho:isSubCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000448"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90025866</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collaboration between the Regeneron Genetics Center and Geisinger Health System in which adult participants of Geisinger&apos;s MyCode Community Health Initiative are exome-sequenced and genotyped and linked to longitudinal electronic health records, for genomics-guided precision medicine and therapeutic discovery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">50726</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DiscovEHR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DiscovEHR cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DiscovEHR collaboration</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Geisinger DiscovEHR-MyCode cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>discovEHR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">DiscovEHR study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11929344/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>For external validation, we obtained summary statistics from six different data sources based on a pre-defined protocol: the TransOmics and Precision Medicine Program supported by NHLBI (TOPMed) Program including multiple studies and a trans-ancestry population in the USA (n = 51,732), [40] the population-based deCODE dataset in Iceland (n = 345,992), [41] the hospital-based Penn Medicine Biobank (PMBB, n = 43,721), [42] the Million Veteran Program (MVP, n = 438,905), [43] the Geisinger DiscovEHR-MyCode cohort in central and northeastern Pennsylvania (n = 145,826), [44] as well as the hospital-based Mass General Brigham Biobank (MGBB, n = 36,419) [45].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000448"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8457092/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In short, the DiscovEHR cohort is a subset of individuals enrolled in the Geisinger Healthcare system who consented to participate in Geisinger&apos;s MyCode Community Health Initiative.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90025866</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association analysis of serum alanine and aspartate aminotransferase, and the modifying effects of BMI in 388k European individuals.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34184762</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8457092/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here we report a GWAS of serum ALT and AST levels in 388k unrelated individuals of European ancestry from UKB and DiscovEHR.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collaboration between the Regeneron Genetics Center and Geisinger Health System in which adult participants of Geisinger&apos;s MyCode Community Health Initiative are exome-sequenced and genotyped and linked to longitudinal electronic health records, for genomics-guided precision medicine and therapeutic discovery.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28008009</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">50726</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>adult MyCode participants exome-sequenced in the first DiscovEHR release (2016)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28008009</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We sequenced the exomes of 50,726 adult participants in the DiscovEHR study to identify ~4.2 million rare single-nucleotide variants and insertion/deletion events, of which ~176,000 are predicted to result in a loss of gene function.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>DiscovEHR</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000776"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>discovEHR</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


