        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genome-wide association study dataset that aggregates common measures from three large substance-abuse studies, the Collaborative Study on the Genetics of Alcoholism, the Family Study of Cocaine Dependence and the Collaborative Genetic Study of Nicotine Dependence, funded as part of the NIH Gene Environment Association Studies (GENEVA) initiative.</obo:IAO_0000115>
