        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Wisconsin Epidemiologic Study of Diabetic Retinopathy</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid7317">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005015"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid7319">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005266"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7317"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>diabetes</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3898749/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In brief, 10,135 patients with diabetes who were receiving primary care in an 11-county area in southern Wisconsin during 1979–1980 were classified as “older” and “younger” onset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7319"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>diabetic retinopathy</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3898749/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In brief, 10,135 patients with diabetes who were receiving primary care in an 11-county area in southern Wisconsin during 1979–1980 were classified as “older” and “younger” onset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3898749/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In brief, 10,135 patients with diabetes who were receiving primary care in an 11-county area in southern Wisconsin during 1979–1980 were classified as “older” and “younger” onset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90662913</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetics of C-Peptide and Age at Diagnosis in Type 1 Diabetes.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39556808</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11755686/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We performed a meta-GWAS of C-peptide that including four T1D studies: the Scottish Diabetes Research Network Type 1 Bioresource (SDRNT1BIO) (4,16), Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) (17,18), Coronary Artery Calcification in T1D (CACTI) (19,20), and Wisconsin Epidemiologic Study of Diabetic Retinopathy (WESDR) (21).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based cohort of people with diabetes receiving primary care in an 11-county area of southern Wisconsin, United States, in 1979–1980, followed for decades to study the incidence and progression of diabetic retinopathy and other diabetes complications.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24026564</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2366</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>people with diabetes examined at baseline 1980-82 (younger-onset and older-onset), 1982</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:9422925</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In an 11 county area in southern Wisconsin, a cohort of people with diabetes mellitus was identified and characterised by history, physical examination, fundus photographs, and laboratory evaluation in 1980-2 (n = 2366).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000806"/>
