        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of sporadic colorectal cancer in the Pays de la Loire region of France, which recruited about 1,000 patients diagnosed at age 40 or over in regional hospitals and clinics and about 1,100 age- and sex-matched controls at regional health examination centres in 2002–2006, to study genetic susceptibility to colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
