        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90296729</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based case-control study of bladder cancer among men resident in the province of Brescia, northern Italy, with newly diagnosed cases admitted to the urology departments of the two main Brescia hospitals in 1997–2000 and controls with non-neoplastic urological diseases, used to study occupational, environmental and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym BBCS also denotes Baltimore Breast Cancer Study (COHO:0001288) and British Breast Cancer Study (COHO:0001510); this term is Brescia Bladder Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
