        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">201</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>male bladder cancer cases and urological controls enrolled 1997-2000</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3983188/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the present study, complete individual data were available for 199 (out of 201) cases and 213 (out of 214) controls, totaling 412 (instead of 415) subjects.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
