        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:22271044</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based case-control collection of urological cancers in France, run by the Centre de Recherche pour les Pathologies Prostatiques (CeRePP) at Hôpital Tenon, Paris, whose prostate cancer cases are patients with histologically confirmed prostate cancer treated in French urology departments and whose controls are men found unaffected in a systematic health screening programme, and which has also supplied pathologically confirmed bladder cancer and renal cell carcinoma cases to genome-wide association studies of those cancers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CeRePP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CeRePP French Prostate Case-Control Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
