        <rdfs:comment>In late fall 1997, 48,850 men (49% response rate) and 39,227 women (70% response rate) completed a 96-item food frequency questionnaire (FFQ) and answered questions about lifestyle factors (the questionnaires are available: https://www.simpler4health.se/researchers/questionnaires/).</rdfs:comment>
