        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90296729</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A National Cancer Institute Clinical Genetics Branch study (protocol 02-C-0178) that enrolls families with at least two cases of testicular germ cell tumour, identified through physician and self-referral, together with controls, to study the genetic and clinical features of familial testicular cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym FTC also denotes Finnish Twin Cohort Study (COHO:0000070) and Older Finnish Twin Cohort (COHO:0001728); this term is NCI Familial Testicular Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">749</coho:numberOfParticipants>
