        <owl:annotatedTarget>A National Cancer Institute Clinical Genetics Branch study (protocol 02-C-0178) that enrolls families with at least two cases of testicular germ cell tumour, identified through physician and self-referral, together with controls, to study the genetic and clinical features of familial testicular cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25882629</obo:IAO_0000119>
