        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6144482/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The aim of the Human Early Life Exposome (HELIX) study was to measure and describe multiple environmental exposures during early life (pregnancy and childhood) in a prospective cohort and associate these exposures with molecular omics signatures and child health outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
