        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of bladder cancer in Los Angeles County, United States, with cases aged 25–64 diagnosed in 1987–1996 identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program and matched neighbourhood controls, used to study lifestyle and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
