    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid7555">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0001187"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000830"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7555"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>bladder cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A19174821+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We investigated the association between urinary tract infections (UTIs) and transitional cell carcinoma of the bladder in a population-based case-control study in Los Angeles covering 1586 cases and age-, gender-, and race-matched neighbourhood controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000830"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2653778/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We collected detailed information on UTIs in a large population-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Los Angeles County, where we have identified risk factors including cigarette smoking (Castelao et al, 2001) and use of permanent hair dyes among women (Gago-Dominguez et al, 2001, 2003), and protective factors including use of non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs) (Castelao et al, 2000) and consumption of carotenoids and vitamin C (Castelao et al, 2004).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000830"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90296729</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide Association Study of Bladder Cancer Reveals New Biological and Translational Insights.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37210288</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S030228382302780X-mmc3.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Los Angeles Bladder Cancer Study (LABCS)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000830"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case-control study of bladder cancer in Los Angeles County, United States, with cases aged 25–64 diagnosed in 1987–1996 identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program and matched neighbourhood controls, used to study lifestyle and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:19174821</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
