        <rdfs:comment>Replication study leukocyte genomic DNA samples were largely from Olmsted County, MN, USA residents with objectively-diagnosed incident VTE over the 45-year period, 1966-2010, and previously-matched Olmsted County resident controls, as previously described.</rdfs:comment>
