        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study at the Mayo Clinic, Rochester, Minnesota, of adults with objectively diagnosed venous thromboembolism and age- and sex-matched controls, supplemented by Olmsted County residents with incident venous thromboembolism and matched controls, used for candidate-gene, genome-wide and whole-genome sequencing studies of venous thromboembolism risk.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22672568</obo:IAO_0000119>
