        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of Parkinson&apos;s disease patients and neurologically normal controls whose samples are held in the NINDS repository at the Coriell Institute and were genotyped genome-wide and publicly released through dbGaP (phs001172, including phs000089) for studies of genetic risk of Parkinson&apos;s disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
