        <rdfs:comment>We did genome-wide, single-nucleotide-polymorphism (SNP) genotyping of publicly available samples from a cohort of Parkinson&apos;s disease patients (n=267) and neurologically normal controls (n=270).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
