        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4923737/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PD patients diagnosed within the past 3.5 years were prospectively recruited as part of the Oxford Parkinson’s Disease Centre (OPDC) cohort study from 11 hospitals across the Thames Valley covering a population of approximately 2.1 million (PD-Discovery, website: http://opdc.medsci.ox.ac.uk).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000840"/>
