        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4923737/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PD patients diagnosed within the past 3.5 years were prospectively recruited as part of the Oxford Parkinson’s Disease Centre (OPDC) cohort study from 11 hospitals across the Thames Valley covering a population of approximately 2.1 million (PD-Discovery, website: http://opdc.medsci.ox.ac.uk).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000840"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90428054</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic meta-analysis of levodopa induced dyskinesia in Parkinson&apos;s disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37652906</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10471743/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We then validated the proposed SNP set on the OPDC cohort by measuring the ability to distinguish LiD PD patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000840"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based incidence cohort of people diagnosed with Parkinson&apos;s disease within the previous 3.5 years, recruited by the Oxford Parkinson&apos;s Disease Centre from 11 hospitals across the Thames Valley, England, between 2010 and 2014, and followed with motor, cognitive and non-motor assessments to study Parkinson&apos;s disease progression and subtypes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26405788</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000840"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">924</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Parkinson&apos;s disease patients recruited by the time of analysis (recruitment Sept 2010 to Sept 2014)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4923737/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>At the time of this analysis, OPDC had recruited 924 patients (see Fig. 1) but we excluded 154 subjects either because of disease duration (41), they had a prior PD probability of &lt;90% clinically (112), or because of a concomitant neurological disorder leading to significant disability in addition to PD, such that assessment of motor function was invalid (1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
