        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7664"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>heaviness of drinking</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3210694/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Index cases from these families, their full siblings and parents were recruited for three coordinated studies: (i) the NAG (Nicotine Addiction Genetics) Study which ascertained heavy smoking index cases; (ii) the OZALC-EDAC study, which ascertained index cases with a history of alcohol dependence or scoring above the 85th centile for heaviness of drinking factor score</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
