        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association meta-analysis of nicotine metabolism and cigarette consumption measures in smokers of European descent.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32157176</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41380-020-0702-z/MediaObjects/41380_2020_702_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cohort 5: OZALC-NAG (Australia) The Australian samples were women and men (aged between 20–90 years) ascertained through more than 12,000 families with information about history of cigarette smoking</rdfs:comment>
