        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21529783</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Genome-wide single nucleotide polymorphism (SNP) genotyping was performed with 8754 individuals (2062 alcohol-dependent cases) selected for informativeness for alcohol use disorder and associated quantitative traits.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
