        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90321081</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A longitudinal multi-project collection of clinical data and biosamples from people with Parkinson&apos;s disease at different stages, other parkinsonism, essential tremor and controls, established in 2012 by the US National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke as a consortium of biomarker discovery projects with standardized procedures and a shared data management resource.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">338</coho:numberOfControls>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1082</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NINDS Parkinson&apos;s Disease Biomarkers Program</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PDBP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Parkinson Disease Biomarkers Program</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Parkinson&apos;s Disease Biomarker Program</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Parkinson&apos;s Disease Biomarkers Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Parkinson&apos;s Disease Biomarkers Program</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid7684">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005180"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7684"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Parkinson&apos;s disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4824671/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PDBP is building a resource of longitudinally collected data and biosamples from well-characterized patients with PD of different stages and duration, parkinsonism, and control participants, and includes hypothesis-driven biomarker discovery projects.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4824671/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Parkinson Disease Biomarkers Program (PDBP) is a consortium of laboratory and clinical biomarker discovery projects funded by the National Institute of Neurological Diseases and Stroke (NINDS, National Institutes of Health (NIH), United States).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90321081</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide Analysis of Motor Progression in Parkinson Disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37560120</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10409573/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Clinical data and biosamples used in preparation of this article were obtained from the Parkinson&apos;s Progression Markers Initiative (PPMI) and the Parkinson&apos;s Disease Biomarkers Program (PDBP).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A longitudinal multi-project collection of clinical data and biosamples from people with Parkinson&apos;s disease at different stages, other parkinsonism, essential tremor and controls, established in 2012 by the US National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke as a consortium of biomarker discovery projects with standardized procedures and a shared data management resource.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26442452</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">338</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants enrolled as of October 2014 (72% of planned enrolment)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4824671/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PDBP has enrolled 1082 individuals, including 620 with PD, 101 with parkinsonism (46 PSP, 36 MSA, 19 parkinsonism with currently undetermined diagnosis), 23 with essential tremor, and 338 controls (72% of planned enrollment) as of 10/21/2014 (enrollment ends 8/31/2015).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1082</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants enrolled as of October 2014 (72% of planned enrolment)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4824671/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PDBP has enrolled 1082 individuals, including 620 with PD, 101 with parkinsonism (46 PSP, 36 MSA, 19 parkinsonism with currently undetermined diagnosis), 23 with essential tremor, and 338 controls (72% of planned enrollment) as of 10/21/2014 (enrollment ends 8/31/2015).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000842"/>
