        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9238600/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The STANISLAS study cohort is a single‐center longitudinal cohort recruited between 1993 and 1995 at the Center for Preventive Medicine in Nancy, France, composed of 1006 families with 4295 subjects.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
