        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4549</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>American Indian adults aged 45+ recruited 1989-1991</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11904716/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This genetic association study used data from the SHS, a large, well-characterized cohort of 4549 self-identified American Indian adults aged 45 years or older, who were recruited from tribal communities in Arizona, Oklahoma, North Dakota, and South Dakota (1989-1991).</rdfs:comment>
