        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2725236/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This nuclear-family cohort was collected from five sites across the UK (The Newcomen Centre at Guy&apos;s Hospital, London; the Cambridge Language and Speech Project (CLASP)13; the Child Life and Health Department at the University of Edinburgh14; the Department of Child Health at the University of Aberdeen; and the Manchester Language Study15,16) and included the families in whom the SLI1 linkage was originally identified.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000850"/>
