        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of nuclear families, each ascertained through a proband with receptive and/or expressive language skills more than 1.5 SD below the age norm, gathered by the SLI Consortium from five clinical and epidemiological sites across the United Kingdom for linkage and association studies of specific language impairment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
