    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7751"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>testicular germ cell tumours</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3314781/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Men who developed TGCT while on active duty were eligible to participate as cases, whereas men who did not develop TGCT were eligible to participate as controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid7753"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>environmental determinants of testicular germ cell tumours</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22343618+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>using existing data from the US Servicemen&apos;s Testicular Tumor Environmental and Endocrine Determinants (STEED) case-control study</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3314781/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, men between 18 and 45 years of age who had at least one serum sample stored in the US Department of Defense Serum Repository (DoDSR, Silver Spring, MD, USA) were eligible for the study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90296729</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide Association Study of Bladder Cancer Reveals New Biological and Translational Insights.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37210288</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S030228382302780X-mmc3.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The US Servicemen&apos;s Testicular Tumor Environmental and Endocrine Determinants Study (STEED)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study of testicular germ cell tumours among US military servicemen aged 18–45 with serum stored in the Department of Defense Serum Repository, comparing men diagnosed on active duty in 2002–2005 with matched controls to study environmental, endocrine and genetic risk factors.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22343618</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">767</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>TGCT cases and matched controls enrolled 2002-2005 (no total stated)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3314781/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Eligible controls (n=928) were individually matched to cases (n=767) based on age at diagnosis (within 1 year), ethnicity (white, black and other) and date when serum was donated (within 30 days).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">928</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>TGCT cases and matched controls enrolled 2002-2005 (no total stated)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3314781/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Eligible controls (n=928) were individually matched to cases (n=767) based on age at diagnosis (within 1 year), ethnicity (white, black and other) and date when serum was donated (within 30 days).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000851"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
