        <rdfs:comment>Cases (n = 497) and controls (n = 957) in the Texas Bladder Cancer Study (TXBCS) who had been genotyped using a Genome-Wide Association panel were derived from an ongoing hospital-based bladder cancer case-control study [21].</rdfs:comment>
