        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1220</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>SARS-CoV-2-positive individuals with WGS after quality control</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11706450/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These analyses comprehensively characterize the joint contribution of variants of the entire allelic spectrum to severe COVID-19.ResultsThe DeCOI cohortFollowing quality control (see Methods), the DeCOI cohort comprised 1,220 individuals from across the entire phenotypic spectrum of SARS-CoV-2 infections (Figs 1A–1C and S1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
