        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of first-time colorectal adenoma among Caucasian, Japanese and Native Hawaiian adults on Oahu, Hawaii, United States, with cases from the Hawaii site of the PLCO screening trial and Kaiser Permanente Hawaii clinics (1995–2006) and controls with normal endoscopy, used to study risk factors for colorectal neoplasia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
