        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:18385676</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the discovery phase, we analyzed 315,450 tagging SNPs in 1,154 current and former (ever) smoking cases of European ancestry and 1,137 frequency-matched, ever-smoking controls from Houston, Texas.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
