        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90103971</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based case–control study of cutaneous melanoma at The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center, with non-Hispanic white patients and cancer-free controls (friends or acquaintances accompanying patients) recruited between 1998 and 2008, genotyped genome-wide to find melanoma susceptibility loci.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym MDACC also denotes MD Anderson Cancer Center lung cancer study (COHO:0000874); this term is MD Anderson Cancer Center melanoma study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym MDACCS also denotes MD Anderson Cancer Center lung cancer study (COHO:0000874), Prostate Cancer Case-Control Studies at MD Anderson (COHO:0002044), MD Anderson Ovarian Cancer Study (COHO:0002047) and MD Anderson Renal Cell Cancer Study (COHO:0002048); this term is MD Anderson Cancer Center melanoma study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name MD Anderson Cancer Center Study also denotes MD Anderson Cancer Center lung cancer study (COHO:0000874); this term is MD Anderson Cancer Center melanoma study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1804</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1026</coho:numberOfControls>
