        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case-control study in East Anglia, UK, run from Cambridge with Cancer Research UK funding, in which people with cancer registered with the Eastern Cancer Registration and Information Centre and controls attending general practice in East Anglia provide data and DNA to study genetic susceptibility to cancers including breast and prostate cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
