        <rdfs:comment>U.S. population) with wide ethnic and socioeconomic representation from four geographically defined populations and two health plans.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000882"/>
