        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample aged 55–84 and refreshed with further cohorts in 2002, 2012 and 2024, to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of changes in physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3107</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>LASA</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
