        <rdfs:comment>The Longitudinal Aging Study Amsterdam (LASA) is an ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, with data on multiple domains of functioning available over a period of more than 30 years of follow-up.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
