        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7844411/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Longitudinal Aging Study Amsterdam (LASA) is an ongoing, population-based cohort of individuals 55 years and older living in the Netherlands.</rdfs:comment>
