    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000895"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90105058</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association meta-analysis identifies 48 risk variants and highlights the role of the stria vascularis in hearing loss.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35580588</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9247887/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Age, Genes/Environment Susceptibility - Reykjavik (AGES; n = 3,134), the Danish Twin Registry (DTR; n = 1,314), the Estonian Genome Center at the University of Tartu (EGCUT; n = 55,523), FinnGen (n = 212,544), Framingham Heart Study (FHS; n = 2,536), Health Aging and Body Composition (HABC; n = 1,288), Italian Network of Genetic Isolates - Friuli Venezia Giulia (INGI-FVG; n = 339), the Rotterdam Study (RS, cohorts 1–3; n = 6,157), the Salus in Apulia study (SA; n = 1,780; formerly known as Great Age study), Screening Across the Lifespan Twin (SALT; n = 9,565, and SALTY - young; n = 5,133), Screening Twin Adults:</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000895"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based cohort of older adults aged 65 and over, recruited from the electoral rolls of Castellana Grotte, Bari, in Apulia, southern Italy, by the National Institute of Gastroenterology &apos;Saverio de Bellis&apos; Research Hospital as a public health initiative funded by the Italian Ministry of Health and the Apulia Regional Government, to study ageing, frailty, cognitive decline and related conditions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9313038/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000895"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2192</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals aged 65 or older in the cohort (MICOL plus GreatAGE), 2021</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8700814/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The present study included individuals from the Salus in Apulia Study (MICOL Study plus GreatAGE Study), an ongoing population-based prospective cohort comprising 2192 individuals aged 65 years or older and resident in Castellana Grotte, a town located near Bari, Puglia, in the southeast of Italy.</rdfs:comment>
