        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CBCS also denotes Carolina Breast Cancer Study (COHO:0001210) and Copenhagen Breast Cancer Study (COHO:0001623); this term is Canadian Breast Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
