        <owl:annotatedTarget>A Swedish population-based case-control study of multiple sclerosis in which prevalent cases fulfilling the McDonald criteria were identified from the Swedish MS registry and controls were randomly selected from the national population register, with lifestyle and environmental questionnaires and blood samples for genetic analyses.</owl:annotatedTarget>
