        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90133316</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international research alliance founded in 2009 of more than 100 scientists who pool genetic, clinical and functional data from Parkinson&apos;s disease case-control cohorts worldwide for collaborative genetics research on Parkinson&apos;s disease, with recent efforts in East Asia and Africa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
