        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000020"/>
        <coho:isSubCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000668"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90129576</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Ontario site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry, which enrolled women with invasive breast cancer diagnosed in 1996–1998 identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry (all those aged 20–54 at high genetic risk and random samples of others, with high-risk cases diagnosed in 2001–2002 added), together with their relatives and population controls, to study the genetic epidemiology of breast cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4766</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BCFR-CA</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BCFR-ON</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BCFR-ONT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>OFBCR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ontario Breast Cancer Family Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ontario site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ontario Familial Breast Cancer Registry</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid8470">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0007254"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000928"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid8470"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>breast cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A15217505+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Epidemiology questionnaire data are available for 6779 affected probands (with a personal history of breast cancer), 4116 unaffected probands, and 16,526 relatives with or without a personal history of breast or ovarian cancer.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000928"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC468645/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Population-based families were recruited from the Greater San Francisco Bay area, California, USA, by the Northern California Cancer Center; from the province of Ontario, Canada, by Cancer Care Ontario; and from the metropolitan areas of Melbourne and Sydney, Australia, by the University of Melbourne and the New South Wales Cancer Council.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000928"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000668"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC468645/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Population-based families were recruited from the Greater San Francisco Bay area, California, USA, by the Northern California Cancer Center; from the province of Ontario, Canada, by Cancer Care Ontario; and from the metropolitan areas of Melbourne and Sydney, Australia, by the University of Melbourne and the New South Wales Cancer Council.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000928"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90129576</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide interaction analysis of menopausal hormone therapy use and breast cancer risk among 62,370 women.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35418701</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9007944/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The OFBCR thanks Teresa Selander, Nayana Weerasooriya and Steve Gallinger.</rdfs:comment>
