        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomised, double-blind trial in which 371 adults with a first unprovoked pulmonary embolism, after six months of vitamin K antagonist treatment, were randomised to a further 18 months of warfarin or placebo and followed between 2007 and 2014 at 14 French centres, comparing recurrent venous thromboembolism and major bleeding.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">371</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PADIS-PE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
