        <obo:IAO_0000116>women of European descent from 57 studies in the 2014 age-at-menarche meta-analysis (stated as up to)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25231870</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here, using genome-wide and custom-genotyping arrays in up to 182,416 women of European descent from 57 studies, we found robust evidence (P &lt; 5 × 10(-8)) for 123 signals at 106 genomic loci associated with age at menarche.</rdfs:comment>
