        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">74116</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>persons in the &apos;fetus&apos; origin cohort (pregnant women, fetuses and family members), recruited 2013-2017</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7124511/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the TMM BirThree Cohort Study, 74 116 persons participated as the ‘fetus’ origin cohort, and 73 529 persons participated as the ‘newborn’ origin cohort (Figure 3).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
