        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Danish clinical research programme, the Copenhagen Prospective Studies on Asthma in Childhood, made up of mother-child birth cohorts: COPSAC2000, a high-risk cohort of 411 children of mothers with a doctor&apos;s diagnosis of asthma, enrolled in the first month of life, and COPSAC2010, a cohort of 700 children born to unselected mothers from Denmark.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym COPSAC also denotes Copenhagen Prospective Study on Asthma in Childhood (COHO:0000639); this term is Copenhagen Prospective Studies on Asthma in Childhood.</obo:IAO_0000116>
