        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11509949/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between 1995 and 2010, a total of 9449 southern Chinese women and men were recruited from the community.</rdfs:comment>
