        <rdfs:comment>OXVASC: The Oxford Vascular Study was supported by the Wellcome Trust, Wolfson Foundation, Stroke Association, Medical Research Council, Dunhill Medical Trust, NIH Research (NIHR), and NIHR Oxford Biomedical Research Centre based at Oxford University Hospitals NHS Trust and University of Oxford.</rdfs:comment>
