        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90270122</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of adults at high risk of cardiovascular disease, enrolled from November 2013 at Severance Hospital in Seoul, South Korea, to develop preventive strategies for high-risk patients. Participants qualify through high-risk hypertension, diabetes with albuminuria, end-stage renal disease on dialysis, asymptomatic atherosclerotic disease, rheumatoid arthritis treated with methotrexate and steroids, atrial fibrillation, a kidney transplant, or being a relative of a patient with early acute myocardial infarction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3470</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CMERC-HI</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
