        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of middle-aged and older residents of Ehime Prefecture, Japan, who since 2006 have attended the health check-up programme of the Anti-aging Center at Ehime University Hospital, designed to evaluate ageing-related disorders such as atherosclerosis, cardiovascular disease, physical function and mild cognitive impairment, and who are followed in the Japan Shimanami Health Promoting Program (J-SHIPP), a longitudinal study of factors related to cardiovascular disease, dementia and death.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2244</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AASC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Anti-aging study cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
