        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of middle-aged and older residents of Ehime Prefecture, Japan, who since 2006 have attended the health check-up programme of the Anti-aging Center at Ehime University Hospital, designed to evaluate ageing-related disorders such as atherosclerosis, cardiovascular disease, physical function and mild cognitive impairment, and who are followed in the Japan Shimanami Health Promoting Program (J-SHIPP), a longitudinal study of factors related to cardiovascular disease, dementia and death.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28371474</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28406166</obo:IAO_0000119>
