        <obo:IAO_0000116>enrolled participants with quality-controlled data, April 2020 to March 2021</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8133500/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>However, quality controlled data is currently available for a total of 2,300 enrolled participants (2,256 adults and 44 children recruited between April 2020 and March 2021).</rdfs:comment>
