        <obo:IAO_0000116>smoking status</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5972779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We harmonised exposure data across participating countries on alcohol consumption, smoking status, and other lifestyle characteristics, and studied validated CVD outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid9160"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>dietary fatty acids and their food sources</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5972779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We harmonised exposure data across participating countries on alcohol consumption, smoking status, and other lifestyle characteristics, and studied validated CVD outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9729111/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The EPIC cohort consists of 366,521 women and 153,457 men, aged between 35 and 70years at baseline, recruited from the population at 23 centres across 10 European countries (Denmark, France, Germany, Greece, Italy, The Netherlands, Norway, Spain, Sweden and the UK) between 1992 and 2000.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000065"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9729111/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>EPIC-CVD is a case-cohort study nested within the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition (EPIC) cohort (1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90132314</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Discovery and systematic characterization of risk variants and genes for coronary artery disease in over a million participants.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:36474045</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9729111/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>EPIC-CVD is a case-cohort study nested within the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition (EPIC) cohort (1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-cohort study nested within the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, designed to investigate the determinants of cardiovascular disease. EPIC participants with incident coronary heart disease or stroke, identified from 1991 to 2010, are compared with a centre-stratified random subcohort of EPIC participants with stored blood samples, in which molecular factors, including genotypes, are measured.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:29844013</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34796724</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:40099743</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">32549</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>case-cohort participants (incident CVD cases plus subcohort) in the 2018 alcohol analysis, after exclusions (analysed subset), 2010</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5972779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>After exclusion of participants with missing values for smoking variables (n=505), baseline alcohol consumption (51), body mass index (273), physical activity (333), and history of hypertension (1112), 32 549 participants (52% women, 17 015/32 549), remained in the analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001004"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>EPIC CAD</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
