        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3448/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3448_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Rotterdam-Clinic study was supported by ZoNMW project number: 170885606, MDfonds, Landelijke Stichting voor Blinden en Slechtzienden (LSBS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
