        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11156861/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 2016 study of the IAMDGC included an Israeli cohort.</rdfs:comment>
