        <obo:IAO_0000116>suicide attempt cases and controls from 18 cohorts in the first ISGC GWAS meta-analysis (2022)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC8851871/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The primary SA GWAS included 29,782 cases and 519,961 controls from 18 cohorts (Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
