        <rdfs:comment>Human tissue samples were provided by the Cardiovascular Research Centre Biobank at the Royal Brompton and Harefield NHS Foundation Trust, UK (NRES ethics number for biobank samples: 09/H0504/104 + 5; Biobank approval number: NP001-06-2015 and MED_CT_17_079).</rdfs:comment>
