        <owl:annotatedTarget>An unselected birth cohort established in 1997 in Aberdeen, United Kingdom, recruiting pregnant women through an antenatal clinic and following their children prospectively from birth, to investigate how antenatal dietary exposures relate to asthma, wheeze and eczema in childhood.</owl:annotatedTarget>
