        <owl:annotatedTarget>A study run by Sano Genetics in the United Kingdom in which participants recruited between 2020 and 2022 gave saliva samples for an at-home DNA test and completed a questionnaire on the Sano Genetics platform about their acute COVID-19 and long COVID symptoms, demographics and other chronic conditions, to study genetic factors influencing long COVID risk and severity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
