        <rdfs:comment>The Blue Mountains Eye Study (BMES) was supported by the Australian National Health &amp; Medical Research Council (NHMRC), Canberra Australia (NHMRC project grant IDs 974159, 211069, 302068, and Centre for Clinical Research Excellence in Translational Clinical Research in Eye Diseases, CCRE in TCR-Eye, grant ID 529923).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
