        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1524813/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The baseline examinations (BMES cross-section I) were conducted during 1992–1994 and included 3654 (82.4%) of 4433 eligible residents.</rdfs:comment>
