        <obo:IAO_0000116>screen-positive participants who consented to phase II (clinical, neuropsychological and MRI assessment)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7021682/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Screen positives who provided consent (n = 957) participated in the second phase of the study, which included comprehensive clinical and neuropsychological evaluations, together with neuroimaging at the same session.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
