        <obo:IAO_0000115>A study of women aged 20–79 attending the Family History Risk and Prevention Clinic in Manchester, United Kingdom, recruited in 2010–2012, who completed risk-factor questionnaires and consented to DNA testing for SNP analysis and to breast density measurement, set up to validate and improve the breast cancer risk prediction models used in family history clinics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">320</coho:numberOfCases>
