        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Austria"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5570675/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of those sites, 7 are European centers (BASICMAR—Spain, BRAINS—United Kingdom, GRAZ—Austria, KRAKOW—Poland, LEUVEN—Belgium, LUND STROKE REGISTER—Sweden, and SAHLSIS—Sweden) and 5 are based in the United States (GASROS, GCNKSS, GEOS, ISGS, and MIAMISR).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001085"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90301368</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Evidence of survival bias in the association between APOE-Є4 and age at ischemic stroke onset.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39286457</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11403718/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Medical University of Graz supports the databases of the Graz Stroke Study and the Austrian Stroke Prevention Study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001085"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A hospital-based series of patients with ischaemic stroke admitted to the stroke unit of the Department of Neurology of the Medical University of Graz, Austria, investigated with brain imaging and a standardised diagnostic protocol and subtyped by stroke neurologists, whose cases are compared in genetic studies of ischaemic stroke with participants of the Austrian Stroke Prevention Study from the same catchment area as controls.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23041239</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24021684</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
