        <rdfs:comment>Based in Australia, the primary aim of kConFab is to facilitate high-quality research by amassing a large and comprehensive resource of epidemiological and clinical data with biospecimens from individuals at high risk of breast and/or ovarian cancer, and from their close relatives.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
