        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90128530</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A historical cohort of multigenerational families in Minnesota, United States, ascertained through a consecutive, family-history-unselected series of breast cancer probands diagnosed from 1944 to 1952 at the University of Minnesota, followed up by telephone interview and mailed questionnaire to measure cancer incidence and risk factors in their relatives (sisters, daughters, granddaughters, nieces and marry-ins).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9073</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MBCFS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Minnesota Breast Cancer Family Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid10075">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_participants_at_risk_of"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0007254"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001099"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid10075"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>breast cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A10613336+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Minnesota Breast Cancer Family Study is a historical cohort study of relatives of a consecutive series of 426 breast cancer cases (probands) identified between 1944 and 1952.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001099"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In total, 426 multigenerational families were ascertained through a breast cancer proband diagnosed from 1944 to 1952 at the University of Minnesota.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001099"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90128530</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide and transcriptome-wide association studies of mammographic density phenotypes reveal novel loci.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35414113</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The families included in Minnesota Breast Cancer Family Study have been described earlier (Sellers et al., 1999, Vachon et al., 2007).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001099"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A historical cohort of multigenerational families in Minnesota, United States, ascertained through a consecutive, family-history-unselected series of breast cancer probands diagnosed from 1944 to 1952 at the University of Minnesota, followed up by telephone interview and mailed questionnaire to measure cancer incidence and risk factors in their relatives (sisters, daughters, granddaughters, nieces and marry-ins).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:10613336</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35414113</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001099"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9073</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>at-risk women (relatives and marry-ins) of 426 probands, followed through 1996</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:10613336</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 9073 at-risk women were studied: 56% were biological relatives of the case probands, whereas the others were related through marriage.</rdfs:comment>
