        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5762</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>genotyped melanoma patients analysed for melanoma-specific survival (2022)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9446843/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>First, we conducted two GWAS of MSS in the MIA cohort (5762 patients with melanoma and 800 melanoma-specific deaths) and in UKB cohort (5220 melanoma patients and 241 melanoma-specific deaths).</rdfs:comment>
