        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26466845</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In 2009-2011, 1153 participants from the 3 Cities Study, aged 75 years or more, had an initial eye examination and were scheduled for eye examinations.</rdfs:comment>
