        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2939779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The case cohort was composed of 1786 consecutive CRC patients of Swedish origin recruited through the Swedish Low-Risk CRC Study Group from 14 different hospitals from central Sweden during 2004–2006.</rdfs:comment>
