        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multicentre study in central Sweden of consecutive patients newly diagnosed with colorectal cancer of any stage, recruited between 2004 and 2009 at 14 hospitals by the Swedish Low-Risk Colorectal Cancer Study Group and interviewed on their family history of cancer, with a lifestyle questionnaire for those recruited in 2004–2006 and cancer-free spouses of participants serving as controls; its cases and controls are used in genetic studies of colorectal cancer risk.</owl:annotatedTarget>
