        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control cohort from Universitatsklinikum Saarlandes, Germany, consisting of individuals clinically diagnosed with sporadic Alzheimer&apos;s disease together with cognitively healthy, age-, gender- and ethnicity-matched population-based controls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">596</coho:numberOfCases>
