        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13263136/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The UKS cohort is a thoroughly diagnosed case-control cohort from Universitatsklinikum Saarlandes, consisting of individuals clinically diagnosed with sporadic Alzheimer’s disease (N = 596; age-at-onset [mean ± SD]: 72.2 ± 6.6 years) and cognitively healthy, age-, gender-, and ethnicity-matched population-based controls (N = 170; age-at-exam: 64.1 ± 3.0 years).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001128"/>
