        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control cohort from Universitatsklinikum Saarlandes, Germany, consisting of individuals clinically diagnosed with sporadic Alzheimer&apos;s disease together with cognitively healthy, age-, gender- and ethnicity-matched population-based controls.</owl:annotatedTarget>
