        <obo:IAO_0000116>children whose families agreed to participate (of 5,019 invited), 2012</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25734425</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All school children (n = 5,019) without special needs in grades 2 through 4 (7–10 y of age) were invited to participate, and families of 2,897 (59%) children agreed.</rdfs:comment>
