        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Johns Hopkins University study that enrolled people with cystic fibrosis both with and without cystic fibrosis-related diabetes; its participants are among those whose genomes were sequenced by the Cystic Fibrosis Genome Project.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CF-Related Diabetes Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CF-related Diabetes Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
