        <rdfs:comment>All subjects were part of the CF Twin-Sibling Study (n = 1038 individuals in 575 families) and were recruited from CF centers in the United States (n = 952), Australia (n = 48), Israel (n = 24), and United Kingdom (Scotland)(n = 14) between 2000 and 2013 on the basis of having CF and having a twin or sibling with CF.</rdfs:comment>
