        <obo:IAO_0000116>Alzheimer&apos;s disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://dss.niagads.org/cohorts/genetic-and-environmental-risk-factors-for-alzheimers-disease-among-african-americans-generaations/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cases met NINCDS-ADRDA criteria for possible or probable AD, determined in a consensus conference which included a behavioral neurologist, psychiatrist, neuropsychologist, and a behavioral neurology nurse practitioner.</rdfs:comment>
