        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based study of the Research Centre for Prevention and Health in Glostrup, Denmark, begun in 2010, which examined a random sample of adults aged 18–69, drawn from the Danish Central Personal Register, living in the western part of the Capital Region of Denmark, with questionnaires, a clinical examination and blood samples, focusing on cardiovascular disease, diabetes, asthma and allergy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
