        <rdfs:comment>GWAS of prostate cancer in Latinos (LAPC GWAS) and Japanese (JAPC GWAS) in the Multiethnic Cohort Study (MEC)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
