        <obo:IAO_0000116>patients with early Parkinson&apos;s disease included (randomised) 2011-2016</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8842530/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 446 patients were included (average 7.8 patients per month), which is 6.8% of the estimated eligible patients.</rdfs:comment>
