        <rdfs:comment>Since 2015, over 800 individuals with PD and atypical parkinsonism along with more than 800 control subjects have been recruited in the frame of the observational, monocentric, nation-wide, longitudinal-prospective Luxembourg Parkinson&apos;s study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
