        <obo:IAO_0000116>consecutive patients undergoing cardiac catheterisation recruited 1998-2003</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21239051</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, between July 1, 1998, and March 31, 2003, PennCath recruited 3815 consecutive patients undergoing cardiac catheterisation.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
