        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4628902/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This sample consists of 1,493 participants (780 males) for whom acceptable imaging, genomics, and/or cognition assessments were obtained; acceptable imaging data were acquired for 1,239 of these participants (645 males); acceptable cognition data for 1,453 participants (752 males), and acceptable genotyping is available for 1391 (719 males).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
