        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based registry of identical and non-identical twins and triplets of all ages living in Australia, established in 2006 at the QIMR Berghofer Medical Research Institute in Brisbane, whose members are invited into twin research projects on health and disease; genetic studies drawing on QIMR Berghofer&apos;s genotyped twin and family samples report them under the registry&apos;s name.</owl:annotatedTarget>
