        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3609892/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of 1894 putative twin pairs, 1412 families (75%, 2775 children) participated and were included in the first wave of data collection.</rdfs:comment>
