        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9907754/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PASTURE study is a prospective birth cohort study started in 2002 and is conducted in children from rural areas of 5 European countries (Austria, Finland, France, Germany, and Switzerland).17 The study was designed to evaluate risk and preventive factors for atopic diseases.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001253"/>
