        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2341</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>eligible pregnant women enrolled 1999-2002</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC4339753</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>After recruitment we found 329 of them to be ineligible (Figure 1), leaving a total of 2341 eligible enrollees, of whom 2128 were still enrolled at the time of delivery and had live births.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
