        <rdfs:comment>The East Asian type 2 diabetes (T2D) meta-analyses were performed with studies participating in the Asian Genetic Epidemiology Network (AGEN), a consortium of genetic epidemiology studies of T2D and related traits conducted in individuals of East Asian ancestry</rdfs:comment>
