        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, CCPS is a local registry of diverse high‐risk families at a hospital‐based preventive oncology clinic that has registered 5685 participants as of September 2024 since its establishment in 1992.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001297"/>
