    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid11909"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90662914</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort study of people with childhood-onset type 1 diabetes (onset before age 17) who were diagnosed, or seen within a year of diagnosis, at Children&apos;s Hospital of Pittsburgh between 1950 and 1980, followed since a baseline examination in 1986–1988 with biennial examinations and questionnaires for ten years and later questionnaires and examinations, to ascertain the incidence of and risk factors for complications of type 1 diabetes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">658</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EDC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Epidemiology of Diabetes Complications study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pittsburgh Epidemiology of Diabetes Complications Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid11909">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005147"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid11909"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>type 1 diabetes</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22851572+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The EDC study is a prospective cohort study of 933 participants with childhood-onset (aged &lt;17 years) type 1 diabetes diagnosed at Children&apos;s Hospital of Pittsburgh from 1950 to 1980.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3478551/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Pittsburgh Epidemiology of Diabetes Complications (EDC) study cohort provides a unique opportunity to examine mortality and life-expectancy changes over time in a U.S. cohort with long-term (&gt;30 years) follow-up, because the participants were all diagnosed with childhood-onset type 1 diabetes between 1950 and 1980.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90662914</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetics of C-Peptide and Age at Diagnosis in Type 1 Diabetes.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39556808</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11755686/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A meta-GWAS of AAD was performed that comprised all studies included in the C-peptide meta-GWAS plus the Pittsburgh Epidemiology of Diabetes Complications (EDC) study (22).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective cohort study of people with childhood-onset type 1 diabetes (onset before age 17) who were diagnosed, or seen within a year of diagnosis, at Children&apos;s Hospital of Pittsburgh between 1950 and 1980, followed since a baseline examination in 1986–1988 with biennial examinations and questionnaires for ten years and later questionnaires and examinations, to ascertain the incidence of and risk factors for complications of type 1 diabetes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22851572</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:37533055</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:39932735</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">658</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants examined at the 1986-1988 baseline</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11932817/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All participants (n = 658) were diagnosed with type 1 diabetes, or seen within 1 year of their diagnosis, at Children’s Hospital of Pittsburgh between 1950 and 1980.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001318"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>EDC</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001319 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001319">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid11916"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001016"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST003219</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A clinic-based case-control study of age-related macular degeneration in Scotland, collected by a group in Edinburgh with funding from the Chief Scientist Office (Scotland), whose cases with advanced or intermediate AMD and controls were ascertained by fundus examination or photography; its cases and controls replicated the association of complement C3 with AMD and were contributed to the International AMD Genomics Consortium&apos;s genome-wide association study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">244</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">351</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Edinburgh</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Scottish AMD study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid11916">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005150"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001319"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid11916"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>age-related macular degeneration</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17634448+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The common functional polymorphism rs2230199 (Arg80Gly) in the C3 gene, corresponding to the electrophoretic variants C3S (slow) and C3F (fast), was strongly associated with age-related macular degeneration in both the English group (603 cases and 350 controls, P=5.9x10(-5)) and the Scottish group (244 cases and 351 controls, P=5.0x10(-5)).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001319"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3448/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3448_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Edinburgh group using the Scottish AMD study was funded by the Chief scientists Office (Scotland) CSO reference number: CZB/4/79</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001319"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
