    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001320"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid11924"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cardiovascular disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4339754/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Thus, the Brazilian Longitudinal Study of Adult Health (in Portuguese, ‘Estudo Longitudinal de Saúde do Adulto’, ELSA-Brasil) aims to investigate the development of chronic diseases, primarily diabetes and cardiovascular diseases, over a long-term follow-up.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001320"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid11926"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>diabetes</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4339754/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Thus, the Brazilian Longitudinal Study of Adult Health (in Portuguese, ‘Estudo Longitudinal de Saúde do Adulto’, ELSA-Brasil) aims to investigate the development of chronic diseases, primarily diabetes and cardiovascular diseases, over a long-term follow-up.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001320"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
