        <rdfs:comment>1,218 melanoma cases were genotyped using 848 HumanCytoSNP-12v1-0_D arrays [Illumina] with 300,000 SNPs and 1,223 healthy controls from Germany were genotyped using HumanOmniExpress12_v1_C arrays [Illumina] with 731,000 SNPs.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
