        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:19967159</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a case-control study involving 1,454 adults enrolled in 11 French centers between 2003 and 2007, comprising 727 consecutive cases with a first documented episode of VTE and 727 age- and sex-matched controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
