        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5612337/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The analyses included 66,450 samples from seven genotyping projects: 40,941 controls, 22,406 invasive cases and 3,103 borderline cases.</rdfs:comment>
