        <rdfs:comment>Study Cases (N) Controls (N) Total λGC Kiel1 474 1,146 1,620 1.09 CASP2 1,359 1,400 2,759 1.06 WTCCC23 2,178 5,175 7,353 1.04 PAGE 3,580 5,902 9,482 0.992 GAPC 2,997 9,183 12,180 0.963</rdfs:comment>
