        <rdfs:comment>INCIPE is a general, Caucasian-only population cohort that was enrolled in 2006 to determine the prevalence of chronic kidney disease (CKD) in North-Eastern Italy [10].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
