        <obo:IAO_0000116>pulmonary TB cases and healthy controls in the 12 GWAS of the 2024 multi-ancestry meta-analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38224499</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ITHGC includes 12 case–control GWAS from nine countries in Europe, Africa, and Asia (total of 14,153 pulmonary TB cases and 19,536 healthy controls).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
