        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7902036/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Of these initial 1,727 participants who were enrolled in this study, 56 individuals with an incomplete semiquantitative food frequency questionnaire (SQFFQ) and 15 individuals with an implausible total energy intake (&lt; 500 or &gt; 4,000 kcal/day) were excluded.</rdfs:comment>
