        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9509464/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data from the Korean-National Cancer Center CRC Study (Korea validation set: a case-control study including 622 cases and 832 controls)</rdfs:comment>
