        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7171</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants whose buccal DNA samples passed quality criteria (2016)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32390825</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The MxGDAR/Encodat database included 7171 of the 13,228 buccal epithelial samples collected (54.21%) that met the following quality criteria: i) 230/260 and 260/230 ratios &gt; 1.8, ii) concentration &gt; 50 ng/µL, and iii) no signs of DNA degradation.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
