        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002486"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90027859</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of research groups worldwide, established to increase sample sizes for genome-wide association meta-analysis of asthma, that pooled asthma genome-wide association studies of European, African, Japanese and Latino ancestry, among them studies of the GABRIEL, EVE, EAGLE, APCAT, CARe and Australian Asthma Genetics consortia, into a multi-ancestry meta-analysis, with a separate analysis of childhood-onset asthma, to identify asthma risk loci.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">23948</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">118538</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TAGC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Trans-National Asthma Genetic Consortium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid12861">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004979"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid12861"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>asthma</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5901974/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To generate larger sample sizes for GWAS meta-analysis of asthma enabling the discovery of common novel risk loci, we established the Trans-National Asthma Genetic Consortium (TAGC) across worldwide groups of investigators with genome-wide data available in &gt;142,000 individuals of diverse ancestries.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001344"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Genomic Research on Asthma in the African Diaspora GRAAD</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001456"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Australian Asthma Genetics Consortium (AAGC) Australian Asthma Genetics Consortium AAGC European Australia Population-based and case-control studies</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001592"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Children&apos;Health Study (CHS) Hispanic White CHS-LAT</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001643"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Dutch Asthma Genetics Consortium (DAGC) Dutch Asthma GWAS 1 Family-Based DAG1 Dutch Asthma GWAS 2 Case-Control DAG2</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001920"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The GABRIEL Consortium includes 19 studies that contributed to TAGC. Seven of the 19 studies were split into two datasets according to age of onset of asthma (before or after 16 years of age); the INDUSTRIAL subgroup included four studies and the German MAS and MAGICS studies were combined.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001981"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>GABRIEL Kursk State Medical University  study  (childhood-onset asthma) KSMU-ch European Russia Case-control study</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
