        <rdfs:comment>GABRIEL German Multicentre Asthma Genetics in Childhood Study (MAGICS) and Multicentre Allergy Study (MAS) MAGICS-MAS European Germany Case-control study</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
