        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002486"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>GABRIEL UFA region study (childhood-onset asthma) UFA-ch European Russia Case-control study</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90027859</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>A polygenic risk score for asthma in a large racially diverse population.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34459047</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC8551047/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We computed a PRS for asthma for subjects across all racial/ethnic groups, using genome wide significant polymorphisms identified from the Trans-National Asthma Genetic Consortium (TAGC) from Demenais et al.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A consortium of research groups worldwide, established to increase sample sizes for genome-wide association meta-analysis of asthma, that pooled asthma genome-wide association studies of European, African, Japanese and Latino ancestry, among them studies of the GABRIEL, EVE, EAGLE, APCAT, CARe and Australian Asthma Genetics consortia, into a multi-ancestry meta-analysis, with a separate analysis of childhood-onset asthma, to identify asthma risk loci.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:29273806</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">23948</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>asthma cases and controls in the 2018 multi-ancestry meta-analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:29273806</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These studies included 56 studies of European-ancestry (19,954 cases, 107,715 controls), seven studies of African-ancestry (2,149 cases, 6,055 controls), two Japanese studies (1,239 cases, 3,976 controls) and one Latino study (606 cases, 792 controls), making a total of 23,948 cases and 118,538 controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">118538</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>asthma cases and controls in the 2018 multi-ancestry meta-analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:29273806</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These studies included 56 studies of European-ancestry (19,954 cases, 107,715 controls), seven studies of African-ancestry (2,149 cases, 6,055 controls), two Japanese studies (1,239 cases, 3,976 controls) and one Latino study (606 cases, 792 controls), making a total of 23,948 cases and 118,538 controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>TAGC</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


