        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of uveal melanoma run at the University of Pennsylvania for a genome-wide association study of the cancer and of differences between tumours with monosomy and disomy of chromosome 3, whose cases were patients treated at Wills Eye Hospital in Philadelphia, recruited through the UPenn Genetic Diagnostic Laboratory with blood samples and clinical and tumour data, and whose controls were selected from participants of the Penn Medicine Biobank.</obo:IAO_0000115>
