        <owl:annotatedTarget>An ongoing multicentre genetic study led by the University of Leicester, United Kingdom, with support from the NIHR Leicester Biomedical Research Centre, that recruits patients with bicuspid aortic valve disease, identified from clinic and discharge letters and confirmed by cardiac imaging, together with relatives of patients with a family history of the disease, who are offered cascade echocardiographic screening, and collects clinical questionnaire data and blood for DNA to study the genetic causes of bicuspid aortic valve disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32720365</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35288444</obo:IAO_0000119>
