        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38665804</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Women&apos;s Health Study: From Adolescence to Adulthood (A2A) is a longitudinal observational cohort study that enrolled 1,549 participants [n = 787 surgically confirmed women with endometriosis (cases) and n = 762 controls] from November 2012–June 2018, enrolling 85% of those who were eligible to participate in the study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
