        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:32424353</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A breast cancer biobank, headquartered at the Westmead Institute for Medical Research of the University of Sydney, that since 2005 has collected tumour tissue, blood and linked clinical and follow-up data from consenting patients with breast cancer at collection sites across Australia and provides them for research. It contributes breast cancer cases to the Breast Cancer Association Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6225</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ABCTB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
