        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3213391</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A genome-wide discovery study was performed by comparing data from 1866 cases with AAA and 5435 unscreened controls from the WTCCC2 study consisting of samples from the 1958 British Birth Cohort and from the UK National Blood Service.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
