        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9924904/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We used plasma samples collected from 1439 early and late onset sporadic AD cases and 508 screened elderly controls. Information on age at assessment, sex, APOE genotype and genome-wide array genotyping was available for all 1947 samples.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
