    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001478"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The Danish part of the European Rational Approach for the Genetics of Diabetic Complications (EURAGEDIC) study: a case–control sample of adults with type 1 diabetes attending the outpatient clinic of the Steno Diabetes Center, Denmark, recruited from 1993 to 2000, with diabetic nephropathy (cases) or with persistent normoalbuminuria after more than 15 years of diabetes (controls), whose blood samples and clinical data were collected to study genetic risk factors for diabetic nephropathy and who were followed prospectively for mortality and cardiovascular and renal outcomes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:17704113</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:20357380</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:31152163</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001478"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">451</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>type 1 diabetic patients: nephropathy cases and normoalbuminuric controls, recruited 1993-2000</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2890360/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study population included two groups: 451 patients with type 1 diabetes and diabetic nephropathy and 440 control subjects with type 1 diabetes for &gt;15 years and persistent normoalbuminuria. Baseline clinical and laboratory characteristics of the 891 patients are shown in Table 1.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001478"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
