        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8118723/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between March 23rd and May 26th 2020, 416 patients with COVID-19 were included in the Amsterdam UMC COVID-19 Biobank (online appendix eFig. 1).</rdfs:comment>
