        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4798184/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 3268 MS cases and 3579 healthy controls genotyped for the fine-mapping component of this study formed part of a larger ANZgene MS loci fine-mapping study, and were phenotyped according to established criteria.</rdfs:comment>
