        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3100</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>prostate cancer patients in the bioresource (2018)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5923293/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The validation cohort of prostate cancer patients (N = 40) were recruited as part of the Australian Prostate Cancer BioResource (APCB) consisting of 3,100 patients including 350 men recruited via collaborations with urologists, 2,000 men from the QLD node of APCB, and 750 men recruited in collaboration with The Cancer Council Queensland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
