        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2243</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>young male conscripts examined</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2572614/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, the Athens Study of Psychosis Proneness and Incidence of Schizophrenia (ASPIS) examined 2243 randomly selected young male conscripts aged 18 to 24 years from the Greek Air Force in their first 2 weeks of admission to the National Basic Air Force Training Center.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
