        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5731703/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The New York site enrolled 4004 individuals, of which 1139 women were affected with breast cancer at baseline and eligible for this analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
