        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.medrxiv.org/content/medrxiv/early/2021/10/07/2021.10.06.21264631.full.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here we present the results from the BRACOVID study 89 enrolling 5,233 participants with distinct COVID-19 clinical presentations and from a 90 diverse population in Brazil.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
