        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24068962</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A repeated cross-sectional population-based health examination survey of adults living in the canton of Geneva, Switzerland, which since 1992 has examined in a mobile unit, each year, a new random sample of residents drawn from the cantonal residents list and stratified by age and sex, collecting questionnaires, physical measurements and blood samples on risk factors for cardiovascular and other lifestyle-related chronic diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">20000</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Bus Sante</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
