        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24068962</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3778004/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We replicated findings using de novo genotyping in the Bus Santé Study and in silico data in all other cohorts.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
