        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14064"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>coronary heart disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5295119/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CaPS was set up to study the influence of CVD risk factors in the development of coronary heart disease (CHD) [12], and recruited an initial 2512 men, aged 45 to 59 years living in the town of Caerphilly and five adjacent villages, South Wales, UK (response rate 89%).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
