        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6085630/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the present case-control study, we examined the association between serum concentrations of thyroid hormones and BC in 2074 Mexican women who participated in the Cáncer de Mama (CAMA) study.</rdfs:comment>
