    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid14120"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid14122"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:32393777</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">267</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">463</coho:numberOfControls>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">730</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CanSS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Canadian Screening Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Canadian screening study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid14120">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_participants_with_exposure"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_6000029"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid14122">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008903"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>smoking (ever smokers of more than 10 pack-years)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>It includes the nested case-control samples from 3 screening programs: IELCAP- Toronto: Ever smokers of more than 10 pack-years age 50 and above were eligible for the I-ELCAP screening program since 2003, and a total of 4782 individuals have been enrolled in the Greater Toronto Area.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14122"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>lung cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>It includes the nested case-control samples from 3 screening programs: IELCAP- Toronto: Ever smokers of more than 10 pack-years age 50 and above were eligible for the I-ELCAP screening program since 2003, and a total of 4782 individuals have been enrolled in the Greater Toronto Area.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 9759 individuals participated in the CT screening program in Canada from these 3 programs.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:32393777</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Protein-altering germline mutations implicate novel genes related to lung cancer development.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32393777</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7214407/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 25 studies in the current discovery dataset included the Alpha-Tocopherol Beta-Carotene Cancer Prevention Study (ATBC), Canadian screening study (CANADA), Cancer de Pulmon en Asturias (CAPUA), Copenhagen lung cancer study (COPENHAGEN), Environment and Genetics in Lung Cancer Study Etiology (EAGLE), The Carotene and Retinol Efficacy Trial (FHCRC), Liverpool Lung Cancer Project (FIELD), German lung cancer study (GERMANY), Harvard Lung Cancer Study (HSPH), The IARC L2 Study (IARC), Israel study (ISRAEL), The Kentucky Lung Cancer Research (KENTUCKY), MD Anderson Cancer Center Study (MDACC), The Malmö Diet and Cancer Study (MDCS), Multiethnic Cohort Study (MEC), New England Lung Cancer Study (NELCS), The Nijmegen Lung Cancer Study (NIJMEGEN), Norway Lung Cancer Study (NORWAY), Northern Sweden Health and Disease Study (NSHDC), The Prostate, Lung, Colorectal and Ovarian Cancer Screening Trial (PLCO), RESOLUCENT study (RESOLUCENT), Tampa Lung Cancer Study (TAMPA), Total Lung Cancer: Molecular Epidemiology of Lung Cancer Survival (TLC), The Mount-Sinai Hospital-Princess Margaret Study (TORONTO), The Vanderbilt Lung Cancer Study (VANDERBILT), whose details were shown in Supplementary Table 22.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28604730</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">267</owl:annotatedTarget>
