        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000029"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:39603580</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A single-centre prospective cohort and sample repository of consecutive adults undergoing elective diagnostic coronary angiography or elective cardiac computed tomographic angiography at the Cleveland Clinic, Cleveland, Ohio, United States, enrolled from 2001 to 2007 with blood samples, extensive clinical and laboratory characterisation and adjudicated follow-up for death, myocardial infarction and stroke, set up to study the genetic and molecular determinants of coronary artery disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CCGB also denotes Cleveland Clinic FMD Biorepository (COHO:0001577); this term is Cleveland Clinic GeneBank Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym GATC also denotes Canadian Pharmacogenomics Network for Drug Safety (COHO:0001631); this term is Cleveland Clinic GeneBank Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9880</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCGB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCGB_2</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cleveland Clinic Gene Bank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cleveland Clinic GeneBank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cleveland Clinic GeneBank study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cleveland Clinic Genebank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GATC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GeneBank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GeneBank Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GeneBank at the Cleveland Clinic: Molecular Determinants of Coronary Artery Disease</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cleveland Clinic GeneBank Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid14238">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005010"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14238"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>coronary artery disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5015312/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Cleveland Clinic GeneBank study is a single‐site sample repository generated from consecutive patients undergoing elective diagnostic coronary angiography or elective cardiac computed tomographic angiography with extensive clinical and laboratory characterization and longitudinal observation.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5015312/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>GeneBank participants who reported their residential ZIP codes as being located in Ohio were clustered in metropolitan regions, particularly in the area surrounding Cleveland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:39603580</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Abbreviated Duke Activity Status Index for Risk Stratification in Heart Failure.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39603580</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A39603580+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Leveraging the Cleveland Clinic GeneBank Study, we developed an abbreviated DASI questionnaire (aDASI) with the machine learning XGBoost algorithm, with the goal of maintaining the accuracy and reliability of the original DASI.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A single-centre prospective cohort and sample repository of consecutive adults undergoing elective diagnostic coronary angiography or elective cardiac computed tomographic angiography at the Cleveland Clinic, Cleveland, Ohio, United States, enrolled from 2001 to 2007 with blood samples, extensive clinical and laboratory characterisation and adjudicated follow-up for death, myocardial infarction and stroke, set up to study the genetic and molecular determinants of coronary artery disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26822151</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27468926</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34419046</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT00590200</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9880</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>GeneBank participants included in the example analysis</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39603580</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The present analysis included a total of 9,880 GeneBank participants in the score derivation using the XGBoost algorithm, 8,987 of which had DASI score calculated.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>CCGB</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
