        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based study of cardiovascular disease and its risk factors in Chinese adults, carried out by the Department of Epidemiology of Fuwai Hospital (National Center for Cardiovascular Diseases, Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences and Peking Union Medical College), Beijing, with field centres in several provinces, including Jiangsu, Shandong and Henan, and funded by the Ministry of Science and Technology of China.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CCHS also denotes Copenhagen City Heart Study (COHO:0001296); this term is China Cardiovascular Health Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
