        <rdfs:comment>For replication 3, cases from the northern China were enrolled from Fuwai Hospital, Beijing and other medical centers, and controls were selected from northern field centers of China Cardiovascular Health Study (CCHS) project. CCHS has been a population-based investigation of risk factors for cardiovascular diseases in China since 2006.</rdfs:comment>
