        <obo:IAO_0000116>early-onset cases and controls genotyped for the Scotland1 GWAS (analysed subset)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22634755</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Scotland1 GWAS consisted of genotyping 1,012 early-onset Scottish CRC cases and 1,012 controls using the Illumina HumanHap300 and HumanHap240S arrays (COGS Study).</rdfs:comment>
