        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41212533</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The COLON study is a prospective cohort study among 2107 adults newly diagnosed with stage I-IV CRC, recruited between 2010 and 2020 via 11 hospitals throughout the Netherlands.</rdfs:comment>
