        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1257</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>colorectal cancer cases and matched controls from the Ontario Familial Colorectal Cancer Registry</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:20437058</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, the ARCTIC study involved 1,257 CRC cases and 1,336 matched community controls from the Ontario Familial Colorectal Cancer Registry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
