        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000901"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:34320204</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An Italian consortium of cancer genetics services and research groups studying hereditary breast cancer, among them the Fondazione IRCCS Istituto Nazionale dei Tumori and the Istituto Europeo di Oncologia in Milan and centres in Aviano, Bari, Florence, Genoa, Rome and Varese, with genetic testing by the Cogentech Cancer Genetic Test Laboratory in Milan. It contributes carriers of BRCA1 and BRCA2 pathogenic variants, most of them ascertained through cancer genetics clinics, as one study to the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1 and BRCA2 (CIMBA) for research on genetic modifiers of cancer risk in carriers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1482</coho:numberOfParticipants>
