    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14623"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>emphysema</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>COPACETIC aims to unravel the genetic determinants of the susceptibility to develop chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) in (ex-)smokers at high risk.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14625"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>chronic obstructive pulmonary disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>COPACETIC aims to unravel the genetic determinants of the susceptibility to develop chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) in (ex-)smokers at high risk.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14627"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>heavy smoking (at least 20 pack-years)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>First, COPACETIC only recruited heavy smokers and we could therefore not assess the effects of the 15q24/25 locus in subjects being exposed to less nicotine.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Netherlands"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The COPACETIC cohort included 1,226 Dutch participants from the NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000058"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The COPACETIC cohort included 1,226 Dutch participants from the NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:23349703</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Variants in the 15q24/25 locus associate with lung function decline in active smokers.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:23349703</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The rs1051730 and rs8034191 variants were genotyped in a population-based cohort of 1,226 heavy smokers (COPACETIC) and in an independent cohort of 883 heavy smokers, of which 653 with COPD of varying severity (LEUVEN).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23349703</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3784</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>NELSON participants in the COPACETIC discovery pulmonary function database (UMC Utrecht and Groningen), 2011</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>After closure, the pulmonary function databases of the UMCU / UMCG were merged into one single pulmonary function database, which contains 6136 pulmonary function records and obtained in 3784 subjects.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>COPACETIC</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


