        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3137628/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The sample for the initial genome-wide CNV analysis consisted of 1,627 unrelated Chinese Han adults including 825 women and 802 men.</rdfs:comment>
