        <rdfs:comment>The STAMPEED asthma project includes subjects from the Chicago Asthma Genetics Study (C.A.G.) as well as from SARP and CSGA.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001634"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multicentre family study of the genetics of asthma supported by the US National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute, in which African American, European American and Hispanic families were ascertained through two siblings with asthma at centres at Johns Hopkins University, the University of Chicago, the University of Minnesota and the University of Maryland, to identify loci contributing to asthma and asthma-associated phenotypes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
