        <obo:IAO_0000115>A clinic-based case–control collection for genetic studies of age-related macular degeneration in Cleveland, Ohio, whose cases, graded by the Age-Related Eye Disease Study criteria, and controls without signs of macular degeneration or a family history of retinal disease, mostly of European descent, gave blood samples at the Cole Eye Institute of the Cleveland Clinic and at the Veterans Affairs eye clinic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CWRU also denotes Genetic Modifier Study (COHO:0001179); this term is Cleveland Clinic Foundation/Veteran Affairs Medical Center Cohort.</obo:IAO_0000116>
