        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:23164817</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case–control study of recurrent major depressive disorder in the United Kingdom, funded by the Medical Research Council, that recruited unrelated patients who had had at least two episodes of major depression of at least moderate severity, diagnosed with the Schedules for Clinical Assessment in Neuropsychiatry (SCAN) interview, at three UK sites (London, Cardiff and Birmingham), together with healthy controls; it is one of the three studies making up the RADIANT depression sample.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1420</coho:numberOfCases>
