        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24092820</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">463</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">459</coho:numberOfControls>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">922</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DGN</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DepGenesNetworks</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Depression Genes Networks study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Depression Genes and Networks cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Depression Genes and Networks study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Depression Genes and Networks</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid14912">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0002009"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid14912"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>major depressive disorder</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The recruitment procedure of the Depression Genes and Networks study (National Institute of Mental Health Grant 5RC2MH089916) was designed to collect samples of individuals with and without major depressive disorder, ages 21–60, from a survey research panel that was broadly representative of the United States population (Supplemental Material).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Depression Genes and Networks cohort is comprised of individuals of European ancestry within the United States.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:24092820</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Characterizing the genetic basis of transcriptome diversity through RNA-sequencing of 922 individuals.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24092820</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We have sequenced RNA from whole blood of 922 genotyped individuals from the Depression Genes and Networks cohort (Methods), all of European ancestry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24092820</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24296977</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">463</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>analysed participants after ancestry, medical and genotyping/RNA quality exclusions</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5404932/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>After exclusions for genotypically non-European ancestry, unusual medical comorbidities and RNA-seq and GWAS quality control (QC) analyses, 922 individuals were included in further analyses (463 cases and 459 controls).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658"/>
