        <obo:IAO_0000115>A French prospective cohort of men and women aged 30 to 64 years, volunteers insured by the French social security system who attended ten of its health examination centres in west-central France, followed for nine years to clarify the development of the insulin resistance syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5153</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>D.E.S.I.R.</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
