        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.</owl:annotatedTarget>
