        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetic study population of long-lived Danes, nonagenarians and centenarians drawn from the Longitudinal Study of Danish Centenarians, the Danish 1905 and 1911–12 Birth Cohort Studies, the Study of Danish Old Sibs and the Longitudinal Study of Ageing Danish Twins, used as the long-lived cases of studies of the genetics of human longevity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
