        <rdfs:comment>We analyzed data from a prospective cohort study of 1,315 individuals who carried a HeFH variant and 1,315 matched family noncarriers derived from a nationwide screening program in the Netherlands, with subsequent replication in 151,009 participants of the UK Biobank.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
