        <obo:IAO_0000115>A family study of Caribbean Hispanics from families multiply affected by late-onset Alzheimer&apos;s disease, recruited at the Taub Institute for Research on Alzheimer&apos;s Disease and the Aging Brain in New York and from clinics in the Dominican Republic, with follow-up of unaffected family members, to study the genetics of familial late-onset Alzheimer&apos;s disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
