        <rdfs:comment>Individuals are eligible for inclusion in EMBRACE if they (i) carry a pathogenic mutation in BRCA1 or BRCA2, (ii) are noncarriers in families with a pathogenic BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation, or (iii) are potential carriers but opt not to undergo a predictive genetic test.</rdfs:comment>
