        <rdfs:comment>The Australian cases were ascertained from three studies28–30: (i) a population-based series of PrCa cases identified from the Victorian Cancer Registry since 1999, diagnosed at &lt;56 years (Early Onset Prostate Cancer Study, EOPCFS; n=631); (ii) a population-based case-control study consisting of cases diagnosed in Melbourne and Perth (Risk Factors for Prostate Cancer Study, RFPCS; n=702).</rdfs:comment>
