        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case-control study of prostate cancer in the Hérault département in the south of France, whose cases are men under 75 newly diagnosed with prostate cancer in 2012-2013 while living in Hérault, identified in all of its public and private cancer centres, and whose controls are men without prostate cancer randomly selected from Hérault&apos;s general population with quotas on age and socioeconomic status, set up to study environmental and genetic risk factors for prostate cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38174802</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
