        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre case-control study of incident lymphoma conducted in 1998–2004 in the Czech Republic, France, Germany, Ireland, Italy and Spain, whose controls were frequency-matched to cases on age, sex and country and drawn at random from population registers in Germany and Italy and from patients of the cases&apos; hospitals elsewhere, and whose participants were interviewed in person about their medical and family history and environmental exposures, to investigate risk factors for lymphoma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
