        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. In the only paper the PGS Catalog records the id EPOS in (PMID:35654975), it is the EPoS Consortium&apos;s liver-biopsy cohort from the European NAFLD Registry, not an osteoporosis study. The Catalog&apos;s expansion, European Prospective Osteoporosis Study, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0001420 (LITMUS Metacohort), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete European Prospective Osteoporosis Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


