        <owl:annotatedTarget>A national retrospective study of children aged 1 to 18 years diagnosed with acute lymphoblastic leukaemia or lymphoblastic lymphoma between 1998 and 2013 at six tertiary paediatric oncology centres in Australia and treated on Berlin-Frankfurt-Münster- or Children&apos;s Oncology Group-based protocols, with annotation of treatment, survival and treatment-related toxicities and a germline genome-wide association study, to find clinical and genetic risk factors for side-effects of treatment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32438682</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:33567813</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41163570</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
