        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000742</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33623038</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre randomised trial of prostate-specific antigen (PSA) screening, begun in 1993 in the Netherlands and Belgium and joined by centres in Sweden, Finland, Italy, Spain, Switzerland and France, in which men aged 50 to 74 identified from population registers were randomly assigned to screening, generally every four years, or to no intervention, and followed for prostate cancer incidence and mortality.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">162388</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ERSPC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
