        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. ESTHER_VERDI is the GECCO colorectal cancer study ESTHER/VERDI (PMID:38561434), which COHO holds on the ESTHER term with the synonyms ESTHER/VERDI and ESTHER II/VERDI. Replaced by COHO:0000665 (Epidemiologische Studie zu Chancen der Verhütung, Früherkennung und optimierten Therapie chronischer Erkrankungen in der älteren Bevölkerung), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
