        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of men and women aged 60 to 75 years with established type 2 diabetes living in the Lothian region of central Scotland, randomly selected by sex and age band from the Lothian Diabetes Register and recruited in 2006–2007, established to investigate risk factors for, and mechanisms of, the development and progression of micro- and macrovascular complications of type 2 diabetes and of its less well-characterised complications, with follow-up examinations and linkage to hospital records.</obo:IAO_0000115>
