        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ewha Woman’s University Hospital PCOS GWAS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ewha Woman’s University Hospital PCOS study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
