        <obo:IAO_0000116>polycystic ovary syndrome</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7670174/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Subjects for the PCOS GWAS consisting of 1000 PCOS cases and 1000 controls were recruited from the endocrinology and gynecology clinics at Ewha Woman’s University Hospital for the Mendelian randomization analysis between obesity traits and PCOS.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
