        <rdfs:comment>This study was a cross-sectional analysis of existing data from the Fels Longitudinal Study (FLS), a family-based study of growth, development, and body composition that began in 1929 in Yellow Spring, Ohio.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001723"/>
