        <rdfs:comment>The Framingham Eye Study16 (FES) was nested within the Framingham Heart Study (FHS, http://www.framinghamheartstudy.org), which began its first round of extensive physical examinations in 1948 by recruiting 5,209 men and women from the town of Framingham, MA, USA.</rdfs:comment>
