        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:22982992</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective case-control study run from the University of Oulu that since 1998 has collected medical records and medicolegal autopsy data from consecutive victims of out-of-hospital sudden cardiac death in the Oulu University Hospital District, northern Finland, with survivors of an acute coronary event treated at Oulu University Hospital as controls, to study the characteristics and genetic background of sudden cardiac death.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5869</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5869</coho:numberOfParticipants>
