        <rdfs:comment>The study population is derived from The Finnish Genetic Study of Arrhythmic Events (Fingesture) which has gathered medical records and medicolegal autopsy data from 5869 consecutive SCD victims since 1998 from the Oulu University Hospital District (defined geographical area in northern Finland, population ≈600 000).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001726"/>
