        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1017/thg.2019.106</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>FT16 was initiated in 1991 to identify the genetic and environmental precursors of alcoholism, but later the scope of the project expanded to studying the determinants of various health-related behaviors and diseases in different stages of life.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
