    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid15491"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Austria"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:40141198</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An open-label, randomised phase 3 trial, led from the Ludwig-Maximilians-University of Munich, that from January 2007 to September 2012 recruited patients aged 18–75 with KRAS (exon 2) wild-type metastatic colorectal cancer at centres in Germany and Austria and assigned them to first-line FOLFIRI plus cetuximab or FOLFIRI plus bevacizumab.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">592</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>FIRE-3 trial</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>FIRE3</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Multicenter Randomized Trial Evaluating FOLFIRI Plus Cetuximab Versus FOLFIRI Plus Bevacizumab in First Line Treatment of Metastatic Colorectal Cancer.</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Phase 3 Randomized Clinical Trial (FOLFIRI + cetuximab, FOLFIRI + bevacizumab</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">FIRE-3</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid15491">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005575"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid15491"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>metastatic colorectal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A25088940+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In this open-label, randomised, phase 3 trial, we recruited patients aged 18-75 years with stage IV, histologically confirmed colorectal cancer</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Austria"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A25088940+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>from centres in Germany and Austria</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:40141198</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic Polymorphisms in MHC Classes I and II Predict Outcomes in Metastatic Colorectal Cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40141198</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11942614/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Genomic DNA from the blood samples of 775 patients enrolled in three independent, randomized, first-line trials, namely TRIBE (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 215), FIRE-3 (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 107; FOLFIRI-cetuximab, N = 129), and MAVERICC (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 163; FOLFOX6-bevacizumab, N = 161), was genotyped through OncoArray, a custom array manufactured by Illumina including approximately 530K SNP markers.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An open-label, randomised phase 3 trial, led from the Ludwig-Maximilians-University of Munich, that from January 2007 to September 2012 recruited patients aged 18–75 with KRAS (exon 2) wild-type metastatic colorectal cancer at centres in Germany and Austria and assigned them to first-line FOLFIRI plus cetuximab or FOLFIRI plus bevacizumab.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25088940</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT00433927</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">592</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>patients with KRAS exon 2 wild-type tumours randomised and treated (2012)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25088940</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between Jan 23, 2007, and Sept 19, 2012, 592 patients with KRAS exon 2 wild-type tumours were randomly assigned and received treatment (297 in the FOLFIRI plus cetuximab group and 295 in the FOLFIRI plus bevacizumab group).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001732"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>FIRE3</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid15498"/>
