        <dcterms:title>Common variants at ABCA7, MS4A6A/MS4A4E, EPHA1, CD33 and CD2AP are associated with Alzheimer&apos;s disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21460840</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
