        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000788</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:26868379</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A public-private partnership of the Foundation for the US National Institutes of Health that, through a series of collaborative genome-wide association studies, genotyped samples from case-control studies of bipolar disorder, diabetic nephropathy, major depressive disorder, psoriasis and schizophrenia and a trio study of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder, and made the resulting individual genotype and phenotype data available to researchers through dbGaP.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym GAIN also denotes Genetics of Asthma International Network (COHO:0001750); this term is Genetic Association Information Network.</obo:IAO_0000116>
