        <obo:IAO_0000115>A colon cancer study in Galicia, Spain, carried out with the University Hospital of Santiago de Compostela (its surgery and pathology departments and biobank) and health research institutes in Santiago de Compostela and Vigo, whose participants were included in genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer that pooled the studies of the CORECT, CCFR and GECCO consortia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
