        <rdfs:comment>The participants include 1,824 type 2 diabetic cases (955 male and 869 female) and 1,719 nondiabetic controls (828 male and 891 female) aged 30 to 80 years, with at least 10 years residence in Bijie city.</rdfs:comment>
