        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000344</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33372680</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The research collection of the German Consortium for Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer, a nationwide consortium of university centres for familial breast and ovarian cancer in Germany, made up of index patients and relatives from families at high risk of hereditary breast and ovarian cancer who met the consortium&apos;s criteria for germline testing and were counselled and tested at its centres from the late 1990s on, with clinical and family-history data held in a central registry at the University of Leipzig; its BRCA1/2-mutation-negative familial breast cancer index cases are studied within the Breast Cancer Association Consortium and its data are also part of the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1/2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
