        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8246885/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 760 female CHEK2 mutation carriers were included; 561 women were affected with BC, of whom 74 developed metachronous contralateral BC (mCBC).</rdfs:comment>
