        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. GCI is Genomics Collaborative, Inc., a company that held a DNA repository and supplied case-control sets to other researchers; the rheumatoid arthritis papers&apos; &apos;Genomics Collaborative Initiative&apos; is a misreading of its name. A company, not a cohort. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
