        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:18986508</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international multicentre study of the genetics of familial Parkinson&apos;s disease, designed for genetic linkage analysis of affected relative pairs, that recruits families with at least two members with Parkinson&apos;s disease meeting diagnostic criteria, ascertained through a proband with an affected sibling, parent, offspring or more distant relative, at academic centres and clinics in the United States, Canada, Australia, Germany, Italy, the United Kingdom and Denmark.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GenePD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GenePD study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
