        <obo:IAO_0000115>A South Korean case–control study of host genetic influences on the severity of COVID-19, contributed to the COVID-19 Host Genetics Initiative, that compares patients hospitalised with COVID-19 with controls, all of East Asian ancestry, under the review of eight Korean institutional review boards, among them those of Chungnam National University Hospital, Keimyung University Dongsan Hospital, Myongji Hospital and Pusan National University Hospital; its cases were genotyped on version 1.1 and its controls on version 1.0 of the Korea Biobank Array (KoreanChip).</obo:IAO_0000115>
