        <rdfs:comment>Atopic dermatitis patients were recruited from tertiary dermatology clinics based at three centers (Technische Universität München, as part of the GENEVA study, University of Kiel, University of Bonn) and diagnosed on the basis of skin examination by experienced dermatologists according to standard criteria 31 .</rdfs:comment>
