        <rdfs:comment>The Dental Caries: GENEVA Genome Wide Association Study (Caries GENEVA Study) is a multi-site collaboration that is part of the GENEVA consortium (www.genevastudy.org).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001784"/>
