        <rdfs:comment>Subjects were recruited from Pennsylvania, West Virginia and Iowa through three on-going population-based family cohort studies of factors related to oral health: the Center for Oral Health Research in Appalachia (COHRA; Polk et al 2008, Wang et al, 2010), the Iowa Fluoride Study (IFS; Marshall et al 2007) and the Iowa Bone Development Study (IBDS; Marshall et al 2008).</rdfs:comment>
