        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000814</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:20686565</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A European Community-funded research project that joined eight large twin registers (the national twin cohorts of Denmark, Finland, Italy, the Netherlands, Norway and Sweden, the UK TwinsUK cohort and an Australian twin cohort) with the multinational MORGAM population cohort, to identify genetic and lifestyle contributors to common diseases by linkage and association studies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
