        <rdfs:comment>Cases were recruited from the outpatient rheumatology clinics of the VU university medical center, the Jan van Breemen institute, and the AMC/University of Amsterdam, all situated in the Amsterdam region in the Netherlands.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
