        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Korean case-control study of coronary artery disease whose cases are patients with angiographically confirmed coronary artery disease (myocardial infarction, stable or unstable angina) from three teaching hospitals in Seoul (Samsung Medical Center, Seoul National University Hospital and Yonsei University College of Medicine), and whose controls come from the Health Examinees (HEXA) population cohort of the Korean Genome Epidemiology Study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2099</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2690</coho:numberOfControls>
