        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000344</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:32424353</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control family study of breast cancer in women diagnosed before age 50 in Germany, whose cases were all incident breast cancers diagnosed in 1992–1995 in two regions, Rhein-Neckar-Odenwald and Freiburg, identified by surveying the clinics serving those regions, and whose controls were residents of the study regions selected at random from population registries and matched to cases by age and region.</obo:IAO_0000115>
