        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001813"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:28346443</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study of glioma subtypes identifies specific differences in genetic susceptibility to glioblastoma and non-glioblastoma tumors.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28346443</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5558246/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The UK, French, German, MDA, SFAGS and GliomaScan GWAS of non-overlapping case–control series of Northern European ancestry have been the subject of previous studies.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001813"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A genome-wide association study of glioma led by the US National Cancer Institute, genotyped at the NCI Core Genotyping Facility, that pooled incident glioma cases and matched or previously genotyped controls from 19 studies, mostly prospective cohorts of the United States, Europe and Australia (among them ATBC, CPS-II, the Nurses&apos; Health Study, the Health Professionals Follow-up Study, PLCO, NSHDS and the Melbourne Collaborative Cohort Study), together with case-control studies (among them the Sweden and Denmark arm of INTERPHONE) and the case-only Gliogene study.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22886559</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3761216/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001813"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1856</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>GliomaScan case-control sample after quality control in its 2012 report</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3761216/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Studies participating in GliomaScan are described in Table 1, and comprise 1,856 glioma cases and 4,955 controls from 14 cohort studies, 3 case-control studies, and 1 community-based case-only study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001813"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4955</owl:annotatedTarget>
