        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of germline whole-genome sequencing data, assembled by Genentech&apos;s Human Genetics Initiative, from patients in seven Roche/Genentech phase 3 trials of the anti-PD-L1 antibody atezolizumab, alone or combined with chemotherapy or bevacizumab, and their standard-of-care control arms in six cancers (IMvigor211, IMpower150, IMpower130, IMpower131, IMpower133, IMmotion151 and IMpassion130), sequenced from blood samples given under the trials&apos; optional research biosample consent.</obo:IAO_0000115>
