        <rdfs:comment>Patients from the GRADE study, a prospective multicenter observational study that recruited 1808 subjects who received a new ICD implant or had an ICD generator change within the past 5 years, were retrospectively analyzed.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
