        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28623238</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cross-sectional data collection of patients with schizophrenia or schizoaffective disorder in Germany, recruited from 2005 by a single travelling team of investigators at 23 collaborating psychiatric hospitals, among them inpatients, outpatients, residents of sheltered homes and forensic patients, and phenotyped with more than 3,000 data points per patient, with healthy blood-donor controls recruited in Göttingen for genetic analyses, built as the basis for phenotype-based genetic association studies of schizophrenia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1085</coho:numberOfParticipants>
