        <rdfs:comment>GRMIC | Greek Recurrent Myocardial Infarction Cohort  | Greece | EUR | 173 | 0.82658959537572252 | 60.208791208791197 | Fasting | 22 individuals | 34.693641618497097 | 108.456647398844 | Measured | 149.306358381503 | 172.96531791907501 | Illumina Human Core Exome  | Minimac | HRC and 1KGP3 | rvtests</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
