        <obo:IAO_0000116>type 2 diabetes cases and controls of the study in the AGEN-T2D stage 2 replication (2012 report)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.1019/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng1019_MOESM23_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>KNIH H2T2DS Korean 1183 1305 2488 Population-based</rdfs:comment>
