        <obo:IAO_0000115>A longitudinal biomarker cohort study run jointly by Brigham and Women&apos;s Hospital and Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston, following patients with Parkinson&apos;s disease, patients with other neurodegenerative diseases and healthy controls at structured in-person study visits with biobanked samples, to accelerate the discovery and validation of molecular diagnostic and progression markers of early-stage Parkinson&apos;s disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
