        <obo:IAO_0000115>The colorectal cancer arm of the Hwasun Cancer Epidemiology Study, a hospital-based case-control study of multiple cancers in South Korea. Its cases are patients newly diagnosed with colorectal cancer at Chonnam National University Hwasun Hospital, a cancer hospital in Jeollanam-do province, between April 2004 and February 2013, excluding secondary or recurrent cancers, and its controls are participants in the Korean Community Health Survey in Jindo and Bosung counties of Jeollanam-do in 2010 to 2012.</obo:IAO_0000115>
