        <rdfs:comment>The final replication stage (Stage 3b) included 5,936 cases and 8,166 controls from the Bavarian Endometrial Cancer Study (BECS), Connecticut Endometrial Cancer Study (CECS), Hannover-Almaty Endometrial Cancer Study (HAECS), Hawaii Endometrial Cancer Study (HECS)</rdfs:comment>
