        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3528</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>adolescents aged 12.5-17.5 selected by multi-stage random cluster sampling in ten European cities, October 2006 to December 2007 (2006-2007)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A multi-stage random cluster sampling procedure was used to select 3528 adolescents, stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status (SES).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
