        <obo:IAO_0000115>A breast cancer case-control study in Belarus whose cases were recruited in 2002-2008 at the N.N. Alexandrov Institute for Oncology and Medical Radiology in Minsk or at five regional oncology centres (Gomel, Mogilev, Grodno, Brest and Vitebsk), and whose controls were women attending general medical examinations at gynaecology clinics in those regions, women attending the Institute for Inherited Diseases in Minsk, female blood donors in Minsk and healthy relatives of cases; one of the member studies of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">285</coho:numberOfCases>
