        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population health study of adult volunteers in Nevada, established in 2016 by Renown Health and the Desert Research Institute in Reno with targeted recruitment in rural and socioeconomically deprived areas of northern Nevada, that links participants&apos; genetic data (genotyping from 2016, Helix Exome+ sequencing from 2018) with their Renown Health electronic health records.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">30000</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HNP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Healthy Nevada</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
