        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">30000</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>sequenced Phase II participants with linked electronic health records, December 2020 (approximate)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7982958/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As of December 2020, approximately 30,000 sequenced Phase II participants in the HNP have cross-referenced electronic medical records.</rdfs:comment>
