        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:36826816</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of ovarian cancer in Hawaii, USA, whose cases were identified by rapid case ascertainment through the Hawaii Tumor Registry from 1993 to 2008 and whose controls were randomly selected from the Hawaii Department of Health&apos;s annual survey of representative households and matched to cases on age and ethnicity, with data collected by interview; one of the member studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym HAW also denotes Hawaii Endometrial Cancer Study (COHO:0001851); this term is Hawaii Ovarian Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym HOCS also denotes Helsinki Ovarian Cancer Study (COHO:0001854); this term is Hawaii Ovarian Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">895</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1103</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HAW</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HAWAII</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HOCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Hawaii Ovarian Cancer Case-Control Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
