        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of epithelial ovarian cancer run from the University of Pittsburgh, which enrolled women with primary epithelial ovarian, fallopian tube or peritoneal cancer diagnosed from 2003 who lived in western Pennsylvania, eastern Ohio and western New York State, identified from hospital tumour registries, clinical practices and pathology databases, and interviewed participants at home.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym HOPE also denotes Healthy Zhejiang One Million People Cohort (COHO:0001354); this term is Hormones and Ovarian Cancer Prediction Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
