        <dcterms:title>Association of Frequent Aspirin Use With Ovarian Cancer Risk According to Genetic Susceptibility.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:36826816</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9958519/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>we pooled data from the following 8 population-based case-control studies from the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium (OCAC): the Australian Ovarian Cancer Study,8 the Diseases of the Ovary and Their Evaluation Study,9,10 the Hawaii Ovarian Cancer Study,11,12 the Hormones and Ovarian Cancer Prediction Study,13</rdfs:comment>
