        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS002296</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:35252394</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A European Union Seventh Framework Programme project on the genetics of essential hypertension, coordinated from the University of Milan, that assembled hypertensive cases, normotensive controls and population samples from extensively characterised cohorts in different European regions (northern Europe, continental Italy and Sardinia), among them the FLEMENGHO/EPOGH cohort, the Wandsworth Heart and Stroke Study, the Milano-Sassari cohort and the SOPHIA cohort, for a two-stage genome-wide association study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6206</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>European Network for Genetic-Epidemiological Studies</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HYPERGENES</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HYPERGENES–European Network for Genetic-Epidemiological Studies: building a method to dissect complex genetic traits, using essential hypertension as a disease model</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Hypergenes</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Hypergenes - European Network for Genetic-Epidemiological Studies</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Hypergenes - European Network for Genetic-Epidemological Studies</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HYPERGENES–European Network for Genetic-Epidemiological Studies</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid16711">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0001134"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid16711"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>essential hypertension</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3272453/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The HYPERGENES Project investigated associations between genetic variants and essential hypertension pursuing a two-stage study by recruiting cases and controls from extensively characterized cohorts recruited over many years in different European regions.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001734"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature11401/MediaObjects/41586_2012_BFnature11401_MOESM14_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Regarding the present work, cases and controls were recruited within specific cohorts/networks: FLEMENGHO/EPOGH cohort</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8888857/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As target sample, 1,292 samples from Italy cohorts were selected, divided into 561 hypertensives (43.4%) and 731 normotensives (56.6%) (Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS002296</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Dissecting the Polygenic Basis of Primary Hypertension: Identification of Key Pathway-Specific Components.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35252394</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:35252394</owl:annotatedTarget>
