        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8888857/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data originate from the multicenter international study “HYPERGENES–European Network for Genetic-Epidemiological Studies: building a method to dissect complex genetic traits, using essential hypertension as a disease model,” funded by the European Union 7th Framework Programme (grant HEALTH-2007-201550) (18).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
