        <owl:annotatedTarget>A European Union Seventh Framework Programme project on the genetics of essential hypertension, coordinated from the University of Milan, that assembled hypertensive cases, normotensive controls and population samples from extensively characterised cohorts in different European regions (northern Europe, continental Italy and Sardinia), among them the FLEMENGHO/EPOGH cohort, the Wandsworth Heart and Stroke Study, the Milano-Sassari cohort and the SOPHIA cohort, for a two-stage genome-wide association study.</owl:annotatedTarget>
