        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective, nationwide case-control study of early-onset myocardial infarction involving 125 coronary care units in Italy, whose cases were patients hospitalised for a first myocardial infarction before the age of 45 who underwent coronary angiography and whose controls were healthy, unrelated blood donors or staff of the same hospitals, matched by age, sex and geographical origin, recruited between 1994 and 2007.</obo:IAO_0000115>
