        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS004241</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:26732427</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control sample of Icelanders assembled by deCODE genetics for genome-wide association studies of urinary bladder cancer, with cases identified through the Icelandic Cancer Registry and recruited from 2001 by trained nurses through special recruitment clinics, donating a blood sample and answering a lifestyle questionnaire, and controls drawn from other ongoing genome-wide studies at deCODE.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">603</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">37781</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IBCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IBCS-GWAS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Iceland Bladder Cancer Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid16773">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0001187"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid16773"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>bladder cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Recruitment of UBC cases was initiated in 2001 and included all prevalent cases as well as newly diagnosed cases from that time.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Iceland"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4817084/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also obtained genotype data from existing GWAS data for 1724 cases and 265 722 controls from Iceland and 1996 cases and 2853 controls from the Netherlands (9,22) (see the Material and Methods section).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000428"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 37 781 controls (41% males; mean age 61 years; SD = 21) used in this study consisted of individuals from other ongoing GWAS at deCODE and represent &gt;15% of the adult population of Iceland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS004241</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Potential utility of risk stratification for multicancer screening with liquid biopsy tests.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37087533</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:26732427</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Identification of a novel susceptibility locus at 13q34 and refinement of the 20p12.2 region as a multi-signal locus associated with bladder cancer risk in individuals of European ancestry.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26732427</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4817084/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The combined data for NCI-GWAS1, NCI-GWAS2, TXBCS-GWAS, IBCS-GWAS, NBCS-GWAS and TaqMan study data for the 13q34 locus marked by SNP rs4907479, are shown in red.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control sample of Icelanders assembled by deCODE genetics for genome-wide association studies of urinary bladder cancer, with cases identified through the Icelandic Cancer Registry and recruited from 2001 by trained nurses through special recruitment clinics, donating a blood sample and answering a lifestyle questionnaire, and controls drawn from other ongoing genome-wide studies at deCODE.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21750109</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26732427</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">603</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Directly genotyped Icelandic bladder cases and paired deCODE controls in the 2011 GWAS</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 603 patients (77% males; diagnosed from December 1964 to December 2009) were included in a genome-wide SNP genotyping effort, using the Infinium II assay method and either the Sentrix HumanHap 300 or HumanCNV370-duo BeadChip (Illumina).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">37781</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Directly genotyped Icelandic bladder cases and paired deCODE controls in the 2011 GWAS</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The 37 781 controls (41% males; mean age 61 years; SD = 21) used in this study consisted of individuals from other ongoing GWAS at deCODE and represent &gt;15% of the adult population of Iceland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001890"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>IBCS</owl:annotatedTarget>
