    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid16802"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001616"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000004</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:38672660</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An umbrella repository of collaborative cancer-specific registries, among them the Pancreatic Cancer Collaborative Registry, the Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry and the Thyroid Cancer and Tumor Collaborative Registry, developed and maintained by the Fred &amp; Pamela Buffett Cancer Center at the University of Nebraska Medical Center in Omaha, through which participating hospitals in the Midwestern United States enrol cancer patients, high-risk individuals and controls and collect questionnaire data on a common core of demographic, lifestyle, family history and quality-of-life items, clinical and follow-up data and biospecimens for cancer research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>iCaRe2</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>integrated Cancer Data Repository for Cancer research</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid16802">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004992"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid16802"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4856228/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These data should be longitudinal, have broad geographical coverage, and be collected from patients diagnosed with different types of cancer, high-risk individuals, and normal controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001616"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6611482/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The BCCR, which is a part of the integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research (iCaRe2), was developed in collaboration with breast cancer experts and research questions were standardized to satisfy the needs of all the centers</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11048743/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The US-based BC-positive cases (n = 321) were sourced from the integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research (iCaRe2) and the Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry (BCCR), situated in the Midwestern United States [19].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000004</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Breast Cancer Polygenic Risk Score Validation and Effects of Variable Imputation.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38672660</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
