        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11048743/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The US-based BC-positive cases (n = 321) were sourced from the integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research (iCaRe2) and the Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry (BCCR), situated in the Midwestern United States [19].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001893"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An umbrella repository of collaborative cancer-specific registries, among them the Pancreatic Cancer Collaborative Registry, the Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry and the Thyroid Cancer and Tumor Collaborative Registry, developed and maintained by the Fred &amp; Pamela Buffett Cancer Center at the University of Nebraska Medical Center in Omaha, through which participating hospitals in the Midwestern United States enrol cancer patients, high-risk individuals and controls and collect questionnaire data on a common core of demographic, lifestyle, family history and quality-of-life items, clinical and follow-up data and biospecimens for cancer research.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27168721</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:31303884</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38672660</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
