    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid16841"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28170284</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A family-based study of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease funded by GlaxoSmithKline, whose pedigrees of probands with COPD and their siblings, characterised by spirometry, serve as a replication and testing cohort in COPD genome-wide association studies and genetic risk-score meta-analyses (1,103 pedigrees in the 2017 meta-analysis of 16,707 subjects).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3117</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ICGN</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">International COPD Genetics Network</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid16841">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005002"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid16841"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>chronic obstructive pulmonary disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2650282/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the multi-center ICGN study [22],[23] subjects with known COPD were recruited as probands, and siblings and available parents were ascertained through the probands.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:28170284</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic Association and Risk Scores in a Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease Meta-analysis of 16,707 Subjects.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28170284</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC5516277</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We genotyped 3,346 SNPs (see the online supplement) in 5,358 subjects from 4 cohorts: the Transcontinental COPD Genetics Study (TCGS)–Korea and TCGS-Poland (26), the International COPD Genetics Network (ICGN) (27, 28), and the Boston Early- Onset COPD Study (29).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A family-based study of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease funded by GlaxoSmithKline, whose pedigrees of probands with COPD and their siblings, characterised by spirometry, serve as a replication and testing cohort in COPD genome-wide association studies and genetic risk-score meta-analyses (1,103 pedigrees in the 2017 meta-analysis of 16,707 subjects).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:19300482</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28170284</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34855941</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3117</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>subjects (COPD probands and siblings) genotyped (2009)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:19800047</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We demonstrated replication of association for these seven IREB2 SNPs (all p values &lt; or = 0.02) in a family-based study of 3117 subjects from the International COPD Genetics Network</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>ICGN</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid16847"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000020"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000004</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:26884359</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3136</coho:numberOfCases>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>A study to Investigate the genetiCs of In situ Carcinoma of the ductaL subtypE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ICICLE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ICICLE study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Study to Investigate the Genetics on In Situ Carcinoma of the Ductal</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>study to Investigate the genetics of In situ Carcinoma of the ductaL subtype</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Study to investigate the genetics of in situ carcinoma of the ductal subtype</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid16847">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005023"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid16847"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>ductal carcinoma in situ</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12580823/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ICICLE study was a case–control study recruiting DCIS cases and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer between 2007 and 2012 (ethically approved by the Southampton and South West Hampshire Research Ethics Committee A under MREC reference: 08/H0502/4).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12580823/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cases and controls were recruited from more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and 3,136 DCIS cases were recruited to ICICLE, whereas 340 pure LCIS cases were recruited to GLACIER.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000004</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Breast Cancer Polygenic Risk Score and Contralateral Breast Cancer Risk.</dcterms:title>
