        <rdfs:comment>The study population comprised patients from the “Hospital Clinic Primary HIV-1 Infection Cohort” consecutively evaluated within 180 days after HIV infection at the Hospital Clínic, Barcelona, Spain, between January 1, 1997 and December 31, 2012.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
