        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective single-centre cohort that has enrolled, since 1997, all patients with acute or recent HIV-1 infection (within 180 days of infection) evaluated at the Hospital Clínic in Barcelona, Spain, identified by detectable viraemia with a negative HIV serology or by documented seroconversion within the previous six months.</owl:annotatedTarget>
