    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001904 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001904">
        <obo:IAO_0100001 rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000428"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic ECG sample is deCODE genetics&apos; set of genotyped Icelanders with stored electrocardiograms from Landspitali University Hospital, listed as &apos;Study cohort: deCODE&apos; in PMID:30012220: it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog&apos;s name describes only that subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Icelandic ECG study sample</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001905 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001905">
        <obo:IAO_0100001 rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000099"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. IFS is the Indiana Fragility Study (PMID:24064335), premenopausal white sister pairs from Indiana: the sample COHO holds as the Indiana Sisters Study. The Catalog&apos;s name for it, Irish Family Study, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000099 (Indiana Sisters Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Irish Family Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


