        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Indiana Genetics of Bone Fragility Study is the full name a bone mineral density consortium table (PMID:22504420) gives the Indiana sister-pair study whose GWAS (PMID:20164292) is the Indiana Sisters Study&apos;s example. Replaced by COHO:0000099 (Indiana Sisters Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
