        <obo:IAO_0000116>animal allergens</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>fungal alpha amylase</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The populations come from industries with exposure to known major allergens and irritants; high molecular weight sensitizers (wheat flour, fungal alpha amylase, animal allergens), low molecular weight sensitizers (isocyanate monomers and oligomers) and irritants and inflammatory agents (isocyanates, organic dust, endotoxins, wood).</rdfs:comment>
