    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3060072/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>IARC - oral cancer (ORC) Europe - Multicentre IARC IARC Franceschi Oral Hospital-based 611 643</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/France"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13340975/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These studies were conducted in the USA (6), Italy (5), Germany (2), Brazil (1), France (1), Central Europe (1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS012586</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Polygenic risk score-based phenome-wide association study of head and neck cancer across two large biobanks.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38486201</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:27749845</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association analyses identify new susceptibility loci for oral cavity and pharyngeal cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27749845</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5131845/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study population comprised 6,034 cases and 6,585 controls derived from 12 epidemiological studies, the majority of case-control design and part of the International Head and Neck Cancer Epidemiology Consortium (INHANCE).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium of research groups leading epidemiological studies of head and neck cancer, mostly case–control studies in North and South America, Europe and Asia, which pools their individual-level data in a common database to share comparable data, study rare subgroups such as never smokers and coordinate laboratory analyses of the causes of head and neck cancer, including genome-wide association studies of cancers of the upper aerodigestive tract.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:16023150</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27749845</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13340975/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5834132/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">25865</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>INHANCE database cases, controls and total reported in 2026</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13340975/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The INHANCE database included 63,113 participants, comprising 25,865 HNSCC cases and 37,248 controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
