        <owl:annotatedTarget>A research programme based at the Centre Hospitalier Universitaire de Québec and Laval University, Canada, that has recruited high-risk French-Canadian families with breast and/or ovarian cancer (several affected close relatives, or a known BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation) through a network of referring clinicians across Quebec since 1996, for BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutation testing and studies of inherited susceptibility to breast and ovarian cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1413985/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
