        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2702391/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All 97 non-BRCA1/2 individuals from high-risk French Canadian breast and ovarian cancer families participating in this study were part of a larger interdisciplinary program termed INHERIT BRCAs [21].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
