        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research partnership funded by the UK National Institute for Health Research between the University of Dundee, Scotland, and Dr Mohan&apos;s Diabetes Specialities Centre and Madras Diabetes Research Foundation, Chennai, India, that brings together diabetes data resources from India and Scotland, chiefly a cohort of Asian Indians with type 2 diabetes from the electronic medical records of Dr Mohan&apos;s Diabetes Specialities Centre (DMDSC) and the East Scotland Diabetes Cohort (ESDC) of white Europeans with type 2 diabetes from Tayside and Fife, for precision-medicine studies comparing type 2 diabetes in Asian Indians and white Europeans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INSPIRED</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INSPIRED project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
