        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000781</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28346443</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multinational case-control study of glioma, meningioma, acoustic neurinoma and parotid gland tumours in residents aged 30 to 59, carried out with a common core protocol by sixteen centres in thirteen countries (Australia, Canada, Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, Israel, Italy, Japan, New Zealand, Norway, Sweden and the United Kingdom) with cases diagnosed during 2000–2004, set up to investigate whether mobile phone use and the radiofrequency fields it emits increase the risk of these tumours, and also collecting information on other potential risk factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6311</coho:numberOfCases>
