        <rdfs:comment>The Interphone study recruited 6311 cases with intracerebral tumours and 7658 controls from 13 countries (Denmark, Finland, Norway, Sweden, Germany, United Kingdom, France, Italy, Israel, Japan, Canada, Australia and New Zealand).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
