        <rdfs:comment>At both Mayo Clinic Rochester and the University of Iowa, all consecutive cases of lymphoma, including Hodgkin lymphoma (HL) and chronic lymphocytic leukaemia (CLL), who were within 9 months of their initial diagnosis at presentation, a US resident and age 18 years and older, were eligible for enrolment into the MER from 1 September 2002 to 30 June 2015.</rdfs:comment>
