        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic pacemaker sample is deCODE genetics&apos; pacemaker population sample set (PMID:30271950, PMID:29050564): it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog&apos;s name describes only that subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Icelandic Pacemaker Population Sample</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
