        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3808698/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Japanese Centenarian Study (JCS) included 513 long lived individuals (median survival 106 years; age range 100-114) and 561 geographically matched controls (median age 75 years; range: 26-89).</rdfs:comment>
