        <obo:IAO_0000116>atrial fibrillation</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0133-9/MediaObjects/41588_2018_133_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Johns Hopkins University School of Medicine Atrial Fibrillation Genetics Cohort started collecting data in September 2008 on patients &gt;18 years of age that were referred for catheter ablation of symptomatic drug refractory atrial fibrillation.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
