        <dcterms:title>Meta-analysis of genome-wide association data identifies novel susceptibility loci for obesity.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24064335</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3888264/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The three in-house samples included those from the Omaha Osteoporosis Study (OOS, with 998 unrelated Caucasian subjects), Kansas-City Osteoporosis Study (KCOS, with 2283 unrelated Caucasian subjects) and China Osteoporosis Study (COS, with 1624 unrelated Chinese Han subjects).</rdfs:comment>
