        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24124411</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An open prospective cohort of Korean children, conducted by the Korea National Institute of Health, that enrolled children on entry to elementary school at age 7 (from 2005, at four elementary schools in Gwacheon) or in the fourth grade at age 10 in Seoul and Gyeonggi Province, and followed them annually from 2005 to 2020 to identify early risk factors for obesity and associated metabolic diseases; genotyped subsets were used in genome-wide association studies of childhood obesity and of liver enzyme levels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1392</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>KoCAS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
