        <rdfs:comment>Genotyping for the Shanghai-3 and HCES-CRC samples in Stage 2 was completed using the Illumina OncoArray14, and genotyping for samples from Shanghai-4, Aichi-2, Korea-NCC, Korea-Seoul and HCES2-CRC was completed using the expanded Illumina MEGA.</rdfs:comment>
