        <rdfs:comment>KSMU: is a population‐based case‐control study of adult cases of asthma and controls matched for age and sex.74,75 A total of 429 unrelated subjects were recruited in this study, (215 patients with asthma and 214 controls).The studysubjects were of Russian origin from Central Russia.</rdfs:comment>
