        <rdfs:comment>Eligible cases (n = 320) were Latinos of any age diagnosed with primary prostate cancer. Controls (n = 331) were Latino men without PrCa diagnosis and were frequency matched with cases on age (±5 years), who were identified via a neighborhood walk algorithm.18</rdfs:comment>
