        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10604159/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This study is a part of the longitudinal LatDiane study, initiated in 2013 (and participating in the international InterDiane consortium).</rdfs:comment>
