        <obo:IAO_0000116>Leeds hospital study after ancestry exclusions in its 2011 cohort description</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Also, controls were excluded if they had symptoms suggestive of bladder cancer, such as hematuria; 2.8% of the controls were non-Caucasian, leaving 530 Caucasian controls for the study, and 71% of the controls were male.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
