        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium of prospective cohort studies in North America, Europe, Asia and Australia, established in 2010 within the US National Cancer Institute Cohort Consortium, that pools harmonized risk-factor and lung cancer outcome data on the cohorts&apos; participants, and prediagnostic blood samples of lung cancer cases and matched controls for biomarker studies, for research on lung cancer aetiology, risk prediction and early detection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
