        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24880342</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based case–control study of lung cancer in Estonia, whose cases were lung cancer patients enrolled in Estonian hospitals between 2002 and 2006 and whose controls were randomly selected from the population-based cohort of the Estonian Genome Project; genotyped genome-wide with support from the University of Tartu, it was one of the five case–control studies of the IARC lung cancer genome-wide association study and was pooled in the lung cancer meta-analyses of the TRICL consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">109</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">874</coho:numberOfControls>
