        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000906</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:30642433</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of population studies, mainly from Europe, Australia and North America and of European or African ancestry, that ran a common protocol relating their genotyped participants&apos; genomes to the survival of those participants&apos; parents, and meta-analysed the results with UK Biobank in a genome-wide association study of human longevity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
