        <rdfs:comment>It was a prospective, cross-sectional study that included 200 unselected patients with T1D over the age of 18 years with diabetes duration at least 1 year; patients were men and women with regular menstrual cycle (without signs of pregnancy or menopause stage).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
