        <obo:IAO_0000116>unrelated Caucasians: 125 severe, 172 moderate and 386 mild asthmatics and 200 non-asthmatics</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:24691493</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The LIWA cohort included a total of 883 unrelated Caucasians (125 severe, 172 moderate, 386 mild and 200 non-asthmatics) aged between 18 and 85.</rdfs:comment>
