        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Leuven Multidisciplinary Breast Centre (LMBC) is an institution: the PGS Catalog cohort id is the Breast Cancer Association Consortium study labelled after the centre whose patients it draws on, not a cohort with a name of its own. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.</rdfs:comment>
