        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS004706</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:42086565</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Danish randomised clinical trial, Atrial Fibrillation Detected by Continuous ECG Monitoring Using Implantable Loop Recorder to Prevent Stroke in High-Risk Individuals, which randomised 6,004 individuals aged 70 years or older without atrial fibrillation but with risk factors for atrial fibrillation and stroke to screening with an implantable loop recorder, with anticoagulation upon detection of atrial fibrillation, or usual care; its participants’ genetic data are used to evaluate polygenic scores for atrial fibrillation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6004</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Atrial Fibrillation Detected by Continuous ECG Monitoring Using Implantable Loop Recorder to Prevent Stroke in High-Risk Individuals</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
