        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MAFEGWAS is the Mexican American family EBNA-1 GWAS of the San Antonio Family Heart Study, replicated in the San Antonio Family Diabetes/Gallbladder Study: the two studies of the San Antonio Family Study. The Catalog&apos;s name describes that analysis and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000649 (San Antonio Family Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
