        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:20860503</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An observational study of children with physician-diagnosed asthma recruited from secondary and tertiary care centres in Germany and Austria for the genetics of childhood asthma, whose cases have been compared in genome-wide association studies with controls from the German arm of the International Study of Asthma and Allergies in Childhood Phase II, and whose participants were re-examined as adolescents and young adults in a follow-up stage, followMAGICS.</obo:IAO_0000115>
