        <rdfs:comment>The followMAGICS study is the follow-up study of the observational Multicenter Asthma Genetics in Childhood Study (MAGICS), which includes physician-diagnosed asthmatic children and young adults (age: 7–25 years)15 recruited from secondary and tertiary centers in Germany and Austria.</rdfs:comment>
