        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MaOCS, the Malignant Ovarian Cancer Study, is the Danish MALOVA study, as the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium&apos;s study tables expand it (PMID:23339562). Replaced by COHO:0002031 (Danish Malignant Ovarian Tumor Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
