        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Manchester Cancer Research Centre (MCRC), the PGS Catalog cohort id for the 1,202-participant validation cohort of Lebrett et al. 2023 (PMID:37154150; 652 surgical lung cancer patients and 550 Manchester Lung Health Check participants), is an institution, and the GWAS Catalog tags the same study as the Manchester Cancer Research Centre Biobank (GCST90315948, the example of COHO:0001371). Replaced by COHO:0001371, which carries the names MCRC and Manchester Cancer Research Centre. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.</rdfs:comment>
