    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002045 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002045">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id MDACCS (MD Anderson Cancer Center Study) stands for a different MD Anderson study in each GWAS it is recorded in: the lung cancer study (COHO:0000874), the melanoma study (COHO:0000875), the ovarian, prostate and renal cell cancer studies (COHO:0002047, COHO:0002044, COHO:0002048), and pancreatic cancer, glioma and colorectal cancer series COHO does not have. It is not one cohort; the id is an acronym of each of those terms. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete MD Anderson Cancer Center Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


