        <dcterms:title>Cross-cancer evaluation of polygenic risk scores for 16 cancer types in two large cohorts.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:33579919</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002048"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:28598434</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study identifies multiple risk loci for renal cell carcinoma.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28598434</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5472706/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The statistical analysis included summary data from four previously published scans conducted at the NCI (NCI-1)9, IARC (IARC-1)9, the University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center (MDA)10, and the Institute of Cancer Research, UK (UK)11, as well as the two new scans from NCI (NCI-2) and IARC (IARC-2).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
