        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of coronary artery disease conducted by MedGenome in India, whose cases and controls were recruited from outpatient clinics and hospitals in five Indian cities (Kochi, Jaipur, Coimbatore, Chennai and Bangalore) and genotyped to test a framework for assessing a genome-wide polygenic score for coronary artery disease in South Asians.</obo:IAO_0000115>
