        <rdfs:comment>We performed a prospective observational cohort study including Mexican adults living in large urban settings of central Mexico including Mexico City, Cuernavaca, Leon, Toluca and Aguascalientes to evaluate incidence of T2D, arterial hypertension and cardiovascular disease, We aimed to identify risk factors associated to ID in order to develop a predictive model for ID in our population.</rdfs:comment>
