        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS005203</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28986454</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of outpatients at Massachusetts General Hospital with recorded demographic data, medical and medication history and a resting electrocardiogram, many of whom also underwent an oral glucose tolerance test, genotyped genome-wide for genetic studies of cardiometabolic traits such as the QT interval, insulin secretion and body mass index.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym CAMP also denotes Childhood Asthma Management Program (COHO:0000998); this term is MGH Cardiology and Metabolic Patient Cohort.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3756</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CAMP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CAMP MGH</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CAMP-MGH</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cardiology and Metabolic Patient Cohort study at Massachusetts General Hospital</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cardiovascular and Metabolic Patient cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MGH Cardiology and Metabolic Patient cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MGH-CMPC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Massachusetts General Hospital Cardiology and Metabolic Patient cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">MGH Cardiology and Metabolic Patient Cohort</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002061"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5937525/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data from the Cardiology and Metabolic Patient Cohort study at Massachusetts General Hospital (n=1,675) were used to validate genetic associations with insulin secretion as well as test the observational association of insulin secretion and BMI.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
