        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genome-wide association study of colorectal cancer in people of Japanese ancestry that pooled cases and controls from the Multiethnic Cohort Study, the Colorectal Cancer Family Registry, the Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective Study and case-control studies in Hawaii and in Fukuoka and Nagano, Japan, first analysed in a trans-ethnic meta-analysis with a parallel African American study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
