        <rdfs:comment>In the first GWAS, Japanese samples (n = 6,424) were identified from the Multiethnic Cohort study (MEC), the Colorectal Cancer Family Registry (CCFR), the Japan Public Health Center cohort study (JPHC) and three case-control studies in Hawaii (CR2&amp;3) and in Fukuoka and Nagano, Japan (Supplementary Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
