        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002702"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.327/MediaObjects/41588_2009_BFng327_MOESM15_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The six studies were: i) Italian Atherosclerosis Thrombosis and Vascular Biology (IATVB); ii) Heart Attack Risk in Puget Sound (HARPS); iii) Registre Gironi del COR (Gerona Heart Registry or REGICOR); iv) Massachusetts General Hospital Premature Coronary Artery Disease (MGH PCAD); v) FINRISK; and vi) Malmo Diet and Cancer Study (MDC).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC2681011/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Stage 1 consisted of the Myocardial Infarction Genetics Consortium (MIGen), a collection of 2,967 cases of early-onset MI (in men ≤50 years old or women ≤60 years old) and 3,075 age- and sex-matched controls free of MI from six international sites: Boston and Seattle in the United States as well as Sweden, Finland, Spain, and Italy (Table 1 and Supplementary Methods).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000012</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genomic prediction of coronary heart disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27655226</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:27655226</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genomic prediction of coronary heart disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27655226</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5146693/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The MI Genetics (MIGen) Consortium Study was funded by the National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute of the United States National Institutes of Health (R01 HL087676).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium of myocardial infarction and coronary artery disease case-control studies, formed for a genome-wide association study of early-onset myocardial infarction (men aged 50 or younger, women 60 or younger) and age- and sex-matched controls from sites in Boston and Seattle in the United States, Sweden, Finland, Spain and Italy, and later extended with further case-control cohorts for exome and gene sequencing studies of coronary artery disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:19198609</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28267856</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10138</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>MIGen ten-cohort LPL sequencing sample in 2017</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5664181/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Gene sequencing of LPL was performed in 22,533 participants of the Myocardial Infarction Genetics Consortium, including 12,395 controls and 10,138 cases with CAD (Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12395</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>MIGen ten-cohort LPL sequencing sample in 2017</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5664181/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Gene sequencing of LPL was performed in 22,533 participants of the Myocardial Infarction Genetics Consortium, including 12,395 controls and 10,138 cases with CAD (Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">22533</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>MIGen ten-cohort LPL sequencing sample in 2017</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5664181/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Gene sequencing of LPL was performed in 22,533 participants of the Myocardial Infarction Genetics Consortium, including 12,395 controls and 10,138 cases with CAD (Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
