        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MOFFITT_PC is the Moffitt Prostate Cancer Study (PMID:29892016), the study the Moffitt group&apos;s papers call MOFFITT. Replaced by COHO:0002077 (The Moffitt Group), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
