        <obo:IAO_0000115>An echocardiography study within the 2002-2006 re-examination of the Malmö Preventive Project in Malmö, Sweden, in which a subsample of re-examined participants, randomly selected from groups defined by glucometabolic status with impaired fasting glucose and diabetes oversampled, underwent echocardiography.</obo:IAO_0000115>
