        <obo:IAO_0000116>re-examined MPP participants who had echocardiography, 2002-2006</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7083427/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In a subsample of 1792 participants, UCG recordings were carried out.</rdfs:comment>
