        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:38846307</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The women&apos;s arm of the Mr. Osteoporosis and Ms. Osteoporosis Study in Hong Kong: a prospective cohort of community-dwelling Chinese women aged 65 years or older in Hong Kong, recruited in 2001–2003 in a sample stratified by age group, whose osteoporotic hip, spine and vertebral fractures have been followed up for about two decades, with other outcomes of ageing such as diet, cognition and mortality studied in the same cohort.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2000</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ms. OS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
