        <obo:IAO_0000116>women enrolled in the MSP sub-cohort of the NSHDS (as of May 2020)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11790227/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Selected characteristics of the NSHDS participants by subcohort Characteristic Full cohort Subcohorts NSHDS VIP MONICA MSP Participants, n (%) All 141 910a 127 069 12 298 28 822</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
