        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:32193507</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetic study of myopia at the Hong Kong Polytechnic University, which recruited unrelated adults of Chinese descent aged 18 to 45 years through the university&apos;s Optometry Clinic, excluding people with signs of ocular disorders or of inherited disorders associated with myopia, measured their refraction by cycloplegic autorefraction together with corneal curvature, lens thickness and axial length, and genotyped them genome-wide; it is a member study of the Consortium for Refractive Error and Myopia (CREAM).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MyGS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Myopia Genomics Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Myopia Genomics Study (Hong Kong HTI)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>The Myopia Genomics Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Myopia Genomics Study of Hong Kong</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
