        <obo:IAO_0000115>The national registry of healthy volunteer bone marrow donors in Norway, held at Oslo University Hospital, whose members are HLA-typed on inclusion in the registry; random selections of registered donors, with their HLA data and samples, serve as healthy population controls in Norwegian genetic and epidemiological studies of immune-mediated disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4514</coho:numberOfParticipants>
