        <owl:annotatedTarget>The national registry of healthy volunteer bone marrow donors in Norway, held at Oslo University Hospital, whose members are HLA-typed on inclusion in the registry; random selections of registered donors, with their HLA data and samples, serve as healthy population controls in Norwegian genetic and epidemiological studies of immune-mediated disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
