        <rdfs:comment>Additional DNA samples from CeAD patients of European origin were collected in 2010-2011 following CADISP inclusion criteria (Supplementary Fig. 1), through departments of neurology specialized in stroke care in Germany, the Netherlands, Sweden, Italy, France, Switzerland and the USA (Supplementary Table 4).</rdfs:comment>
