    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18428"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>colorectal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms5613/MediaObjects/41467_2014_BFncomms5613_MOESM440_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We enrolled 121 colorectal cancer cases.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms5613/MediaObjects/41467_2014_BFncomms5613_MOESM440_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A hospital-based case-control study 22 was conducted between October 1998 and March 2002 at four hospitals in Nagano Prefecture, Japan.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS002252</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Risk Stratification for Early-Onset Colorectal Cancer Using a Combination of Genetic and Environmental Risk Scores: An International Multi-Center Study.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35026030</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:25105248</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Trans-ethnic genome-wide association study of colorectal cancer identifies a new susceptibility locus in VTI1A.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25105248</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4180879/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the first GWAS, Japanese samples (n = 6,424) were identified from the Multiethnic Cohort study (MEC), the Colorectal Cancer Family Registry (CCFR), the Japan Public Health Center cohort study (JPHC) and three case-control studies in Hawaii (CR2&amp;3) and in Fukuoka and Nagano, Japan (Supplementary Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A hospital-based case-control study of colorectal cancer conducted between October 1998 and March 2002 at four hospitals in Nagano Prefecture, Japan, enrolling patients aged 20-74 with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed colorectal cancer and cancer-free controls from medical check-up examinees at the same hospitals, matched on sex, age, hospital and residential area, with self-administered and food-frequency questionnaires and blood samples.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25105248</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">121</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Original Nagano study recruitment, 1998-2002</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms5613/MediaObjects/41467_2014_BFncomms5613_MOESM440_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We enrolled 121 colorectal cancer cases.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">245</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Original Nagano study recruitment, 1998-2002</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms5613/MediaObjects/41467_2014_BFncomms5613_MOESM440_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Two controls were matched to each case on sex, age (within three years), hospital and residential area and 245 controls participated (participation rate = 99%).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002122"/>
