        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:22426144</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based series of histologically confirmed endometrial cancer cases recruited consecutively from 1992 to 2005 among women presenting for treatment at the Hunter Centre for Gynaecological Cancer, John Hunter Hospital, in Newcastle, New South Wales, Australia, with reproductive and environmental risk factors (including ethnicity) from self-reported questionnaires and recurrence, stage, grade and histology from medical records; from 2005 patients at this site were recruited by the Australian National Endometrial Cancer Study. Its cases were genotyped in the genome-wide association studies of the Endometrial Cancer Association Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">213</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NECS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Newcastle Endometrial Cancer Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
