        <rdfs:comment>The Newcastle Endometrial Cancer Study (NECS) includes histologically confirmed endometrial cancer cases consecutively recruited from 1992 up to 2005 at the Hunter Centre for Gynaecological Cancer, John Hunter Hospital, Newcastle, New South Wales, Australia</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002130"/>
