        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study identifies a possible susceptibility locus for endometrial cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22426144</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3372671/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>additional samples from ANECS that were not included in Stage 2 analyzed together with Australian cases recruited into the Newcastle Endometrial Cancer Study (NECS) and Australian controls recruited via the Australian Red Cross Blood Service (ARCBS)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
