    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid18523"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mexico"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002132"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000350</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:22570617</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study for a genome-wide association study of primary open-angle glaucoma, run by a consortium of investigators at 12 institutions across the United States, whose cases and controls, aged 35 or over and of European or Hispanic white ancestry, were collected at the 12 sites. Most came from university glaucoma and general ophthalmology clinics, and some from other studies such as the Marshfield Personalized Medicine Research Project and the CIGTS and AGIS glaucoma trials. The case and control definitions were harmonised with the GLAUGEN study, and the clinical data were reviewed centrally at the Massachusetts Eye and Ear Infirmary.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2517</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2428</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEI Glaucoma Human genetics collaBORation</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEIGHBOR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEIGHBOR consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEIGHBOR study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>National Eye Institute (NEI) Glaucoma Human Genetics Collaboration</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>National Eye Institute Glaucoma Human Genetics Collaboration study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">National Eye Institute Glaucoma Human Genetics Collaboration</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid18523">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005338"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18523"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>primary open-angle glaucoma</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3485429/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The NEIGHBOR consortium collected 2,517 POAG cases and 2,428 controls, and an additional 1,000 cases and 1,183 controls were collected for the GLAUGEN study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mexico"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3485429/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Additionally, 182 individuals of Mexican descent from the Nogales region of Northern Mexico were enrolled as part of the Duke dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3485429/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The NEIGHBOR (NEI Glaucoma Human genetics collaBORation) consortium is a unique collaborative effort involving investigators at 12 institutions located throughout the United States.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000350</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Association of a Primary Open-Angle Glaucoma Genetic Risk Score With Earlier Age at Diagnosis.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:31436842</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:22570617</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Common variants at 9p21 and 8q22 are associated with increased susceptibility to optic nerve degeneration in glaucoma.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22570617</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3343074/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>After data cleaning, 976 cases and 1,140 controls collected from three study sites [Nurses&apos; Health Study, Health Professionals Follow-up Study and the Genetic Etiologies of Primary-Open angle Glaucoma Study (GEP)] were analyzed for the GLAUGEN study, and 2,170 cases and 2,347 controls collected from 12 sites (Table S1) were analyzed for the NEIGHBOR study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study for a genome-wide association study of primary open-angle glaucoma, run by a consortium of investigators at 12 institutions across the United States, whose cases and controls, aged 35 or over and of European or Hispanic white ancestry, were collected at the 12 sites. Most came from university glaucoma and general ophthalmology clinics, and some from other studies such as the Marshfield Personalized Medicine Research Project and the CIGTS and AGIS glaucoma trials. The case and control definitions were harmonised with the GLAUGEN study, and the clinical data were reviewed centrally at the Massachusetts Eye and Ear Infirmary.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22570617</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22828004</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2517</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>POAG cases and controls collected by the NEIGHBOR consortium (2012)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3485429/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The NEIGHBOR consortium collected 2,517 POAG cases and 2,428 controls, and an additional 1,000 cases and 1,183 controls were collected for the GLAUGEN study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2428</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>POAG cases and controls collected by the NEIGHBOR consortium (2012)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3485429/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The NEIGHBOR consortium collected 2,517 POAG cases and 2,428 controls, and an additional 1,000 cases and 1,183 controls were collected for the GLAUGEN study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002131"/>
