    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002139">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. NEURO2006 is a funding programme, the 2006 neuroscience call of the French Agence Nationale de la Recherche, which funded the French bipolar disorder sample among other projects (PMID:19125158). Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
