        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ongoing population-based case-control study of lung cancer in Israel, run since 2005 by the Clalit National Israeli Cancer Control Center with Carmel Medical Center and the Technion, of newly diagnosed lung cancer cases of any histology and controls matched to them on age, sex and ethnicity, all interviewed face to face and giving a blood sample, with histology, tumour blocks and clinical follow-up available for most cases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
