    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002161 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002161">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-24. NJRCACH is not a cohort: its name joins two of the five participating sites of the NIH Consortium of Food Allergy Research (CoFAR) EoE Cohort, &apos;University of Colorado Health Center/National Jewish Research Center&apos; and &apos;Arkansas Children’s Hospital&apos; (PMID:29904099). That cohort is already in COHO as the CoFAR Eosinophilic Esophagitis Registry (COHO:0001429, which carries the PGS id USNIHFAREE&apos;s name &apos;US NIH CoFAR EoE cohort&apos;). No PGS Catalog score uses NJRCACH, so it is at most the Catalog&apos;s label for those two sites&apos; share of the CoFAR EoE participants, with no study name of its own. The two institution names should not be added to COHO:0001429 as synonyms. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete University of Colorado Health Center/National Jewish Research Center and Arkansas Childrens Hospital</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


