        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13123215/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Chinese datasets included the Nanjing GWAS (1,316 CRC cases and 2,207 controls) and the Wuhan GWAS (3,000 CRC cases and 3,000 controls), which have been described previously [12, 13].</rdfs:comment>
