        <rdfs:comment>Patients who were diagnosed in one of three hospitals (Radboud University Nijmegen Medical Center and Canisius Wilhelmina Hospital in Nijmegen and Rijnstate Hospital in Arnhem) and who were alive at April 15th, 2008 were recruited for a study on gene-environment interactions in lung cancer.</rdfs:comment>
