        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000740</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28604730</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of lung cancer run by Radboud University Medical Centre in Nijmegen, the Netherlands, to study gene-environment interactions. Its cases are patients diagnosed with lung cancer since 1989 at Radboud university medical center, Canisius Wilhelmina Hospital in Nijmegen or Rijnstate Hospital in Arnhem, identified through the cancer registry of the Netherlands Comprehensive Cancer Organisation, together with lung cancer cases found among participants of POLYGENE, the Nijmegen Biomedical Study and a Radboudumc urology outpatient study; its cancer-free controls are drawn from the Nijmegen Biomedical Study, a random sample of the general population of Nijmegen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">552</coho:numberOfCases>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NLC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
