        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of epithelial ovarian cancer in the eastern part of the Netherlands, run by Radboud University Medical Centre in Nijmegen, which draws on the Nijmegen Biomedical Study and the Nijmegen Polygene Study and collects its data by self-completed questionnaire. It is one of the studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium (study code NTH) and contributes to its pooled epidemiological analyses and genome-wide association studies of ovarian cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
