    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002176"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18768"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>COPD</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5414061/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 206 subjects with COPD defined by spirometry (forced expiratory volume (FEV)/forced vital capacity (FVC) &lt;0.7, FEV1% &lt;80%), over 40 years of age, and 338 controls, as part of the Nottingham Smokers Study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002176"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18770"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>smoking history of &gt; 10 pack years</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4006731/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Nottingham Smokers cohort is an ongoing collection in Nottingham using the following criteria; European ancestry, &gt;40 years of age and smoking history of &gt;10 pack years (currently n = 538).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002176"/>
