        <rdfs:comment>The Osaka Acute Coronary Insufficiency Study (OACIS) is a prospective, multicenter, observational study in which 25 collaborating hospitals in the Osaka region of Japan record demographic, procedural, and outcome data and collect blood samples from patients with AMI.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
