        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of DNA samples donated by healthy Japanese volunteers who were members of the Rotary Club of Osaka-Midosuji (Rotary International District 2660) in Osaka, Japan, used as controls in genome-wide association studies of the Japanese population, often together with BioBank Japan participants.</owl:annotatedTarget>
