        <obo:IAO_0000116>healthy volunteers of the club whose DNA served as controls in a 2012 Japanese GWAS of nephrolithiasis (the largest count of the club&apos;s volunteers stated; no size of the whole collection is stated)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3291538/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We also obtained 1023 Japanese control DNAs from healthy volunteers from the Osaka-Midosuji Rotary Club, Osaka, Japan.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
