        <rdfs:comment>Using a TMA with 181 patient ovarian cancer tissue samples we examined the nuclear and cytoplasmic expression of FANCD2 protein. cFANCD2 staining was observed in 73 (40.33%) of the ovarian carcinomas.</rdfs:comment>
