        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:36744914</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A national prospective population-based cohort of Australian women diagnosed with histologically confirmed invasive epithelial ovarian, primary peritoneal or fallopian tube cancer from 2012 to 2015, run from QIMR Berghofer Medical Research Institute in Brisbane, who completed questionnaires at recruitment and repeatedly during follow-up and whose medical records were abstracted, to study how lifestyle factors relate to outcomes after an ovarian cancer diagnosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">958</coho:numberOfParticipants>
