        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Latin_America_and_the_Caribbean"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_Africa"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oceania"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Poland"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/South_Asia"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sudan"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001922"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:27749845</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international hospital-based case–control study of cancer of the oral cavity and oropharynx, coordinated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in nine countries (Italy, Spain, Northern Ireland, Poland, Canada, India, Sudan, Australia and Cuba), which interviewed its participants and collected oral exfoliated cells and blood from cases and controls, and fresh tumour biopsies from cases, to study the role of human papillomavirus in these cancers. It is one of the studies of the International Head and Neck Cancer Epidemiology Consortium, and participants from its centres in Canada, Italy, Poland and Spain were genotyped for a genome-wide association study of oral cavity and pharyngeal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1670</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1732</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IARC - oral cancer</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IARC ORC multicenter study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IARC oral cancer</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ORC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">IARC Oral Cancer Multicenter study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid18986">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004608"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid18988">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005515"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18986"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>oropharyngeal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A14652239+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We recruited 1670 case patients (1415 with cancer of the oral cavity and 255 with cancer of the oropharynx) and 1732 control subjects and obtained an interview, oral exfoliated cells, and blood from all participants and fresh biopsy specimens from case patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid18988"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>oral cavity cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A14652239+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We recruited 1670 case patients (1415 with cancer of the oral cavity and 255 with cancer of the oropharynx) and 1732 control subjects and obtained an interview, oral exfoliated cells, and blood from all participants and fresh biopsy specimens from case patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cuba"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2363910/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The present Cuban case-control study was part of an international study of oral cancer and HPV carried out in Italy (Talamini et al, 2000), Spain, Northern Ireland, Poland, Canada, India, Sudan and Australia, and coordinated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer (Herrero et al, 2000).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:27749845</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association analyses identify new susceptibility loci for oral cavity and pharyngeal cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:27749845</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5131845/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In order to confirm array genotypes and imputed dosages, we genotyped at least one SNP within each associated (P &lt; 5x10–7) genomic region using TaqMan assays (Thermo Fisher Scientific) in a subset of approximately 900 individuals from ARCAGE, IARC Latin America, EPIC, and IARC oral cancer studies (Supplementary Table 14).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international hospital-based case–control study of cancer of the oral cavity and oropharynx, coordinated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in nine countries (Italy, Spain, Northern Ireland, Poland, Canada, India, Sudan, Australia and Cuba), which interviewed its participants and collected oral exfoliated cells and blood from cases and controls, and fresh tumour biopsies from cases, to study the role of human papillomavirus in these cancers. It is one of the studies of the International Head and Neck Cancer Epidemiology Consortium, and participants from its centres in Canada, Italy, Poland and Spain were genotyped for a genome-wide association study of oral cavity and pharyngeal cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:11437401</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:14652239</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:19190158</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21437268</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27749845</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1670</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Participants in the original nine-country IARC oral-cancer study</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A14652239+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We recruited 1670 case patients (1415 with cancer of the oral cavity and 255 with cancer of the oropharynx) and 1732 control subjects and obtained an interview, oral exfoliated cells, and blood from all participants and fresh biopsy specimens from case patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1732</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Participants in the original nine-country IARC oral-cancer study</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A14652239+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We recruited 1670 case patients (1415 with cancer of the oral cavity and 255 with cancer of the oropharynx) and 1732 control subjects and obtained an interview, oral exfoliated cells, and blood from all participants and fresh biopsy specimens from case patients.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002212"/>
