        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS001778</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:25855707</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A breast cancer case-control study at The Ohio State University in Columbus, Ohio, whose cases are incident triple-negative breast cancer cases enrolled at the Ohio State University James Comprehensive Cancer Center from 2003 to 2011 and banked in the Stefanie Spielman Breast Bank, and whose controls, recruited from 2007 to 2011 among people seen for routine care at primary care and internal medicine clinics and frequency matched to the cases on age and ethnicity, come from the Columbus Area Control Sample Bank. It took part in the Triple Negative Breast Cancer Consortium and, through it, in Breast Cancer Association Consortium analyses.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">207</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">203</coho:numberOfControls>
