        <obo:IAO_0000115>A single-centre prospective cohort of patients with abdominal aortic aneurysm managed on the routine NHS pathway at the Oxford University Hospitals NHS Trust in England, followed with repeated measurements of aneurysm diameter to study the pathogenesis and growth of aneurysms and biomarkers of their progression such as flow-mediated dilatation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">162</coho:numberOfParticipants>
