        <rdfs:comment>We assessed a cross-sectional cohort of people diagnosed with diabetes between the ages of 20 and 40 years (n=223), who had diabetes for more than 3 years and self-reported as white European, from Devon and Cornwall in South West England.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002225"/>
