        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000083</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:25086665</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of pancreatic cancer among members of two US health plans, Group Health in the Seattle Puget Sound area of Washington and Kaiser Permanente Northern California. It is one of the case-control studies of the Pancreatic Cancer Case-Control Consortium (PanC4) whose samples were genotyped in the PanScan genome-wide association studies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1209</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">874</coho:numberOfControls>
