        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Pancreatic Cancer Investigation: Finding Causes</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Pancreatic Cancer: Investigation into Finding Causes</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
