        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control consortium of basic and clinical research groups that pools biological samples and data from patients with pancreatic adenocarcinoma and other pancreatic diseases (endocrine pancreatic tumours, chronic pancreatitis) and from healthy controls, collected mainly in European countries and also in Brazil and Japan, to find genetic factors for pancreatic cancer risk, response to treatment and survival.</owl:annotatedTarget>
