        <rdfs:comment>So far 2220 cases of pancreatic adenocarcinoma, a smaller number of cases of endocrine pancreatic tumours (n=86), chronic pancreatitis (n=272) and 3847 healthy controls have been collected.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
