        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:25086665</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre prospective hospital-based study of patients with pancreatic and biliary diseases, among them incident cases of exocrine pancreatic cancer, recruited from 1992 to 1995 at five general university hospitals in eastern Spain and followed for survival, to study the role of KRAS mutations and other genetic alterations, and of environmental exposures such as persistent organic pollutants and trace elements, in the diagnosis, prognosis and aetiology of pancreatic cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">185</coho:numberOfCases>
