    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002230"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19106"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7689512/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, subject recruitment took place between 1992 and 1995 at five general university hospitals in eastern Spain, where 602 patients with biliopancreatic diseases, including 185 incident cases of PDAC, were prospectively identified.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002230"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19108"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>trace elements</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7689512/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Therefore, the present study aimed to investigate the individual and combined effects of these three factors on the survival of patients with PDAC.2.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002230"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19110"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>persistent organic pollutants</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7689512/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Therefore, the present study aimed to investigate the individual and combined effects of these three factors on the survival of patients with PDAC.2.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002230"/>
