        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, subject recruitment took place between 1992 and 1995 at five general university hospitals in eastern Spain, where 602 patients with biliopancreatic diseases, including 185 incident cases of PDAC, were prospectively identified.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002230"/>
