        <rdfs:comment>The new case-based studies were the Gastrointestinal Cancer Clinic of Dana-Farber Cancer Institute (DFCI-GCC), Spanish Pancreatic Cancer Study PANKRAS-II59, and PANDoRA-Heidelberg pancreatic cancer case-control study10.</rdfs:comment>
