    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19131"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Parkinson&apos;s disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3172377/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Potential PD patients in this cohort were first identified from self-reports in its follow-up survey in 2004–2006, and then were confirmed either by their treating physicians or by medical record review.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19133"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>caffeine intake</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3121544/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Our study is among the largest population-based studies on PD with both genetic and environmental data.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19135"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>smoking</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3121544/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Our study is among the largest population-based studies on PD with both genetic and environmental data.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3158052/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cases and controls were all unrelated, non-Hispanic Caucasian, from United States.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:21912625</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>An exploratory study on CLU, CR1 and PICALM and Parkinson disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21912625</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3166161/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PD cases and controls were from the Parkinson&apos;s, Genes, and Environment (PAGE) study that was nested within the large prospective cohort: the National Institute of Health (NIH)-AARP Diet and Health Study cohort (Formerly known as American Association of Retired Persons.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study of Parkinson&apos;s disease nested in the NIH-AARP Diet and Health Study, the prospective cohort established by the National Cancer Institute in 1995–1996, whose cases are cohort members who reported Parkinson&apos;s disease in the cohort&apos;s 2004–2006 follow-up survey and were confirmed by their treating physicians or by medical record review, and whose controls are randomly selected cohort members who did not report Parkinson&apos;s disease, frequency-matched to the cases on year of birth, sex and ethnicity, with DNA collected from saliva.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21741729</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21912625</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">838</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>physician-confirmed Parkinson&apos;s disease cases and controls genotyped</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3172377/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In total, 838 of physician-confirmed PD cases and 1,703 controls were genotyped.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002232"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1703</owl:annotatedTarget>
