        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000742</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33623038</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-institutional prospective cohort and biorepository of men with clinically localized prostate cancer managed by active surveillance, enrolled from 2008 at clinical sites in the United States and Canada and followed under a protocol of regular prostate-specific antigen tests and surveillance biopsies, supported by the Canary Foundation to discover and confirm biomarkers that distinguish aggressive from indolent disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2155</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Canary PASS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PASS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Prostate Active Surveillance Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Canary Prostate Active Surveillance Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid19160">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008315"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002236"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19160"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>clinically localized prostate cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11821537/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between 2008 and 2017, Canary PASS prospectively enrolled 1,455 patients with clinically localized prostate cancer (cT1-cT2 and Gleason Grade 1–2) to undergo AS at 1 of 10 national sites81.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002236"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3827723/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Canary Prostate Active Surveillance Study (PASS) is a multicenter, prospective active surveillance study that is currently enrolling participants at Stanford University, University of California at San Francisco, University of British Columbia, University of Washington, and University of Texas Health Science Center at San Antonio.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002236"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-021-21287-0/MediaObjects/41467_2021_21287_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Canary PASS (n=373) Prostate Active Surveillance Study USA Prospective, observational</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002236"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
