        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multi-institutional prospective cohort and biorepository of men with clinically localized prostate cancer managed by active surveillance, enrolled from 2008 at clinical sites in the United States and Canada and followed under a protocol of regular prostate-specific antigen tests and surveillance biopsies, supported by the Canary Foundation to discover and confirm biomarkers that distinguish aggressive from indolent disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
