    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002239"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:22402288</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Central adiposity and Prostate Cancer in a Black Population.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:22402288</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22402288+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This report includes 963 newly diagnosed cases of histologically confirmed prostate cancer and 941 randomly selected age-matched controls ascertained from the population-based Prostate Cancer in a Black Population study conducted between July 2002 and January 2011 in Barbados, West Indies.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002239"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A nationwide population-based case-control study of prostate cancer in Barbados, West Indies, whose cases were male citizens with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed prostate cancer identified from July 2002 to January 2011 and whose controls were age-matched residents randomly selected from a national database, designed to evaluate genetic and epidemiologic contributors to prostate cancer in this Afro-Caribbean population.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22936456</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:24399209</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002239"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1007</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>all PCBP consenting case and control participants, 2002–2011</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3551989/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 1,007 PC cases and 1,005 controls consented and participated in the PCBP, of which 963 cases and 941 controls self-reported their race as African-Barbadian.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
