        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1724</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>familial Parkinson&apos;s disease cases and NINDS repository controls in the final GWAS analysis sample (2009)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2627511/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The final sample used in analyses included 857 PD cases and 867 controls (n = 1,724 individuals).</rdfs:comment>
