        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, Toronto, is a cancer hospital; no score in the PGS Catalog uses the id, and every paper found by the name is a different clinical series at the hospital. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Princess Margaret Cancer Centre</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
