        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Postmenopausal Hormone study (PMH) is the Postmenopausal Hormones Supplementary Study to the Colon Cancer Family Registry, as the GECCO supplement of PMID:26151821 shows. Replaced by COHO:0002266 (Postmenopausal Hormones Supplementary Study to the Colon Cancer Family Registry), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Postmenopausal Hormone study</rdfs:label>
