        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5805863/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between Jan 24, 2000, and Jan 24, 2008, we recruited 3021 eligible women, of whom 2733 (91%) were included in the analysis population, and 288 (9%) were excluded (figure 1; appendix p 11).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
