        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:33004331</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002276"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:32665668</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Standardization procedure for flow cytometry data harmonization in prospective multicenter studies.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32665668</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7360585/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As part of the IMI PRECISESADS study project, a multicenter analysis, using eleven different instruments (Navios, Gallios from Beckman Coulter, Canto II, Fortessa, Verse, Aria from BD Biosciences), prospectively on blood freshly collected from 2,559 individuals over a period of 4 years, was required.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002276"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A European multicentre observational study of the PRECISESADS project that recruited adults with systemic autoimmune diseases (rheumatoid arthritis, systemic sclerosis, primary Sjögren&apos;s syndrome, systemic lupus erythematosus, primary antiphospholipid syndrome, mixed connective tissue disease and undifferentiated connective tissue disease) and healthy controls at 19 institutions in nine countries between December 2014 and December 2018, in a cross-sectional cohort and a prospective inception cohort, to reclassify these diseases into molecular clusters using omics profiles.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32665668</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT02890134?fields=IdentificationModule,DescriptionModule,DesignModule,ContactsLocationsModule,StatusModule</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002276"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2559</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>individuals (patients with seven systemic autoimmune diseases and healthy controls) included in the study, December 2014-December 2018 (2014-2018)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7360585/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The inclusion of the study&apos;s 2,559 individuals was done along the way during the 4 years of the PRECISESADS project between December 2014 and December 2018.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002276"/>
