        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS004588</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:36520433</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre research cohort of the PREMIER consortium, which from 2019 to 2022 enrolled people with mild cognitive impairment, with cognitively unimpaired people and people with Alzheimer&apos;s-type or frontotemporal dementia as control groups, from memory clinics, regional dementia centres and hospitals across South Korea, and assessed them with neuropsychological tests, questionnaires, brain MRI, amyloid PET and blood samples (DNA, plasma, serum) to build a platform for the early diagnosis and precision-medicine treatment of mild cognitive impairment and dementia; it is one of the cohorts of K-ROAD.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1700</coho:numberOfParticipants>
