        <rdfs:comment>Between May 2019 and May 2022, 1,700 participants were enrolled in the Precision Medicine Platform for MCI based on multi-omics, imaging, evidence-based R&amp;BD (PREMIER) consortium, a large-scale, multi-center study involving 25 centers across South Korea.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
