        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre prospective study in Australia and Belgium, enrolling since 2017, of atrial and ventricular remodelling and the prevalence and incidence of arrhythmias, especially atrial fibrillation, in endurance athletes aged 16 to 80 (young elite, retiring and retired athletes, including athletes referred with known or suspected arrhythmias) and in age- and sex-matched non-athletes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
