        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1643</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>men randomized to the three ProtecT treatment strategies, including pilot participants (1999–2009)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A25163905+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ProtecT trial randomly assigned 1643 men with localised prostate cancer to active monitoring, radiotherapy, or surgery.</rdfs:comment>
