        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000742</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33623038</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of prostate cancer in Queensland, Australia, contributed to the PRACTICAL consortium, whose cases were men with histopathologically confirmed prostate cancer recruited through urologists in Queensland from the Retrospective Queensland Study, the ProsCan (Prostate Cancer Supportive Care and Patient Outcomes Project) cohort of men newly diagnosed at 26 private practices and 10 public hospitals, and the Queensland node of the Australian Prostate Cancer BioResource. Its controls were healthy men with no personal history of prostate cancer, recruited through the Australian Red Cross Blood Service in Brisbane or, matched to the cases by age and postcode, through the Australian Electoral Commission.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3312</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1252</coho:numberOfControls>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4564</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>QLD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Retrospective Queensland Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Queensland Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
