        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of clinically ascertained depression samples genotyped together for genome-wide association studies of major depressive disorder, made up of the Depression Network (DeNT) study of sibling pairs with recurrent unipolar depression recruited at clinical sites in Europe and one in the United States, the Depression Case Control (DeCC) study of unrelated patients with recurrent depression recruited at three UK sites, and the Genome-Based Therapeutic Drugs for Depression (GENDEP) pharmacogenetic study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
