        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based breast cancer case-control study in the southwest of the Netherlands, whose cases are index patients from families with breast or breast and ovarian cancer counselled at the Clinical Genetics Centre of Erasmus University Medical Centre in Rotterdam from 1994, and whose geographically matched controls are women from cystic fibrosis families counselled at the same centre; it is one of the studies of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
