        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS002654</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:38533953</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre, international, phase 3, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (ACTG A5332) of pitavastatin calcium for the primary prevention of major adverse cardiovascular events in adults with HIV on antiretroviral therapy and at low-to-moderate traditional cardiovascular risk, which enrolled participants from 2015 to 2019 at sites in 12 countries across five Global Burden of Disease regions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7769</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>A5332</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>REPRIEVE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#PGS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Randomized Trial to Prevent Vascular Events in HIV</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid19753">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005109"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002313"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19753"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>HIV</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11979587/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Relevant inclusion criteria include diagnosis of HIV; low-to-moderate risk of atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease (ASCVD); receipt of stable ART; CD4+ count &gt;100 cells/μL; and satisfaction of laboratory thresholds including estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) ≥60 mL/minute/1.73 m2.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002313"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zimbabwe"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11979587/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Sites were located in 5 global burden of disease (GBD) regions spanning 12 countries: high-income countries (Canada, United States excluding Puerto Rico, Spain); Latin America and Caribbean (Brazil, Haiti, Peru, Puerto Rico); sub-Saharan Africa (Botswana, South Africa, Uganda, Zimbabwe); Southeast Asia (Thailand); and South Asia (India).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002313"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS002654</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Polygenic Scores and Preclinical Cardiovascular Disease in Individuals With HIV: Insights From the REPRIEVE Trial.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38533953</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002313"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:38533953</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Polygenic Scores and Preclinical Cardiovascular Disease in Individuals With HIV: Insights From the REPRIEVE Trial.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38533953</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A38533953+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>PRSs for CAD (GPSMult) and lipid traits were calculated in a global cohort of people with HIV treated with antiretroviral therapy with low-to-moderate atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease risk enrolled in REPRIEVE (Randomized Trial to Prevent Vascular Events in HIV).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002313"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multicentre, international, phase 3, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (ACTG A5332) of pitavastatin calcium for the primary prevention of major adverse cardiovascular events in adults with HIV on antiretroviral therapy and at low-to-moderate traditional cardiovascular risk, which enrolled participants from 2015 to 2019 at sites in 12 countries across five Global Burden of Disease regions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:38533953</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:39435321</obo:IAO_0000119>
