        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Netherlands"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000880"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33178576</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international, prospective, observational cohort study, funded by the European Union&apos;s Seventh Framework Programme, that between April 2014 and March 2017 recruited patients with breast, prostate or lung cancer planned for potentially curative radiotherapy at 26 hospitals in eight countries in Europe and the United States. With standardised data collection across centres, it gathered pre-treatment blood samples, treatment and dosimetry data and physician- and patient-reported outcomes during follow-up of at least 12 (lung) or 24 (breast, prostate) months, in a centralised database and biobank with genotype data, as a resource for validating models and biomarkers, including genetic ones, that predict toxicity after radiotherapy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4438</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>REQUITE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>REQUITE cohort study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>REQUITE study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Validating Predictive Models and Biomarkers of Radiotherapy Toxicity to Reduce Side-Effects and Improve Quality of Life in Cancer Survivors</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>validating pREdictive models and biomarkers of radiotherapy toxicity to reduce side effects and improve QUalITy of lifE in cancer survivors</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>validating pREdictive models and biomarkers of radiotherapy toxicity to reduce side-effects and improve QUalITy of lifE in cancer survivors</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">REQUITE cohort</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
