    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19828"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3034195/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Five hundred and four CRC cases (298 male) were ascertained through the National Study of Colorectal Cancer (NSCCG; Penegar, et al., 2007) and the Royal Marsden Hospital NHS Trust Family History and DNA Registry (RMHNHST).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid19830"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>colorectal cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3034195/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Five hundred and four CRC cases (298 male) were ascertained through the National Study of Colorectal Cancer (NSCCG; Penegar, et al., 2007) and the Royal Marsden Hospital NHS Trust Family History and DNA Registry (RMHNHST).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1925111/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Healthy individuals were recruited at centers throughout the UK as part of the National Cancer Research Network Trial (1999–2002), the Royal Marsden Hospital Trust/Institute of Cancer Research Family History and DNA Registry (1999–2004), or the National Study of Colorectal Cancer Genetics Trial (2004), all established within the United Kingdom.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000722</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Evaluating the Utility of Polygenic Risk Scores in Identifying High-Risk Individuals for Eight Common Cancers.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32596635</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:19050702</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Comprehensive analysis of common mitochondrial DNA variants and colorectal cancer risk.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:19050702</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2607223/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 2838 healthy individuals were recruited as part of ongoing National Cancer Research Network genetic epidemiological studies, NSCCG (1219), the Genetic Lung Cancer Predisposition Study (GELCAPS) (1999–2004; n=911), and the Royal Marsden Hospital Trust/Institute of Cancer Research Family History and DNA Registry (1999–2004; n=708).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of DNA samples from people with cancer, among them colorectal cancer patients, and from healthy people who were the spouses or unrelated friends of patients with malignancies, recruited from 1999 through the Institute of Cancer Research and the Royal Marsden Hospital NHS Trust in the United Kingdom for genetic epidemiological studies of cancer susceptibility.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:17615053</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:19050702</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:20949628</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22076443</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002323"/>
