        <rdfs:comment>The SABOR study is a National Cancer Institute Early Detection Research Network-sponsored Clinical and Epidemiologic Validation Center that includes a multi-ethnic cohort of 3880 men from San Antonio and South Texas area without prior diagnosis of PCa (https://edrn.nci.nih.gov/protocols/52-san-antonio-center-of-biomarkers-of-risk-for).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002335"/>
