        <rdfs:comment>SABOR is a cohort study which has been enrolling healthy male volunteers in San Antonio and South Texas area since 2001.22, 23 Participants were examined annually/biannually by digital rectal exam and serum prostate‐specific antigen level, and prostate biopsy was recommended for men with positive results.</rdfs:comment>
