        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A27807919+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To understand the genetic background of Addison&apos;s disease, we utilized the extensively characterized patients of the Swedish Addison Registry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
