        <owl:annotatedTarget>A nationwide multicentre research registry of patients with autoimmune Addison&apos;s disease in Sweden, with enrolment from 2008, whose patients are clinically and immunologically characterised and give samples for clinical, immunological and genetic studies of the disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
