        <rdfs:comment>DDS was a population-based cross-sectional study of non-pregnant urban black African adults of Zulu descent, aged &gt;18 years, residing in Durban, South Africa [15, 16].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002345"/>
