        <owl:annotatedTarget>A combined sample of South African Zulu type 2 diabetes cases and controls from Durban, South Africa, formed for genetic studies by aggregating the Durban Diabetes Study, a population-based cross-sectional study of urban Black African adults of Zulu descent, with the Durban Diabetes Case Control study, which added cases of the same ethnic group and locality who had type 2 diabetes and attended a diabetes clinic.</owl:annotatedTarget>
