    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid20021"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>dementia</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6080529/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Main outcome measures are clinical progression to MCI or dementia and decline in cognitive functioning.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid20023"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>mild cognitive impairment</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6080529/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Main outcome measures are clinical progression to MCI or dementia and decline in cognitive functioning.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Netherlands"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6080529/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Subjective Cognitive Impairment Cohort (SCIENCe) is a prospective cohort study including consecutive patients with SCD presenting at the Alzheimer Center of the VU University Medical Center Amsterdam.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000374"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12185448/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We included 329 participants with SCD from the Subjective Cognitive Impairment Cohort (SCIENCe), embedded within the Amsterdam Dementia Cohort at the Alzheimer Center Amsterdam, Amsterdam UMC for whom baseline amyloid status had been assessed using cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) or positron emission tomography (PET).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS001775</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Risk of dementia in APOE ε4 carriers is mitigated by a polygenic risk score.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34541285</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:34541285</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Risk of dementia in APOE ε4 carriers is mitigated by a polygenic risk score.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34541285</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8438688/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We retrospectively studied 829 cognitively normal individuals with SCD from the Amsterdam Dementia Cohort and SCIENCe project (Subjective Cognitive Impairment Cohort).20 We selected all individuals with a baseline SCD diagnosis with available array genotyping, and availability of either ATN biomarkers, and/or follow‐up information.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective cohort study, with inclusion from June 2014, of consecutive patients with subjective cognitive decline, without major psychiatric or neurological disorders, who presented at the memory clinic of the Alzheimer Center of VU University Medical Center Amsterdam, the Netherlands. After the clinic&apos;s standardised dementia screening they are followed annually, with repeated blood and cerebrospinal fluid collection for biobanking and optional amyloid PET, to study clinical progression and the factors contributing to subjective cognitive decline.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:30081935</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">151</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>participants included in the first two years of inclusion (from June 2014); inclusion ongoing (2016)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6080529/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In addition, we report results based on a selection of cross-sectional data of the first 151 SCIENCe participants.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002351"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>SCIENCe</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002352 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002352">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid20032"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid20034"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid20036"/>
