        <coho:isSubCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000456"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:18483556</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of skin cancer nested within the Nurses&apos; Health Study in the United States, in which women of the cohort&apos;s blood subcohort (blood given in 1989-1990) with incident melanoma, squamous cell carcinoma or basal cell carcinoma diagnosed after blood collection, and no earlier skin cancer, were compared with a common series of controls randomly selected from blood donors free of diagnosed skin cancer and matched by year of birth, with pigmentation and sun exposure information collected by a retrospective supplementary questionnaire.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">218</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">870</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SCNCCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Skin Cancer Nested Case-Control Study within the NHS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>skin cancer nested case-control study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Skin Cancer Nested Case-Control Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
