        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. SCOOP-UK is the Severe Childhood Onset Obesity Project: the childhood obesity GWAS of PMID:22484627 heads its study description with the Catalog&apos;s full name. Replaced by COHO:0000331 (Severe Childhood Onset Obesity Project), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
