        <rdfs:comment>The Seattle Familial Colorectal Cancer Registry identified incident population-based CRC cases aged 20–74 in 3 Washington state counties through the Puget Sound SEER program; controls were recruited through drivers license lists (age, &lt;65 y) and through health care finance files (age, 65–74 y).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
