        <obo:IAO_0000112>PGS000733</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:29117387</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of advanced prostate cancer among non-Hispanic White and African American men aged 40-79 in the San Francisco Bay Area, California, United States, whose cases were diagnosed from 1997 to 2000 and identified through the Greater Bay Area Cancer Registry and whose controls, men without a history of prostate cancer, were found by random-digit dialling and from Health Care Financing Administration rosters and frequency matched to cases on race and age; participants were interviewed about lifetime sun exposure and other risk factors and gave biospecimens.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">450</coho:numberOfCases>
