        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. Southern German Recurrent Depression is the name PMID:21521612 gives the southern German recurrent major depression case-control sample, citing the two papers the existing term is defined from. Replaced by COHO:0001182 (GSK Munich recurrent major depression case-control study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
