        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of the genome-wide genotyping of Chinese participants of population-based studies in Shanghai, China, run by Vanderbilt University with the Shanghai Cancer Institute and the Shanghai Institute of Preventive Medicine, that pools the scans of the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study, the Shanghai Breast Cancer Survival Study, the Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study, the Shanghai Women&apos;s Health Study and the Shanghai Men&apos;s Health Study for genetic association studies of breast cancer and other traits such as body mass index.</obo:IAO_0000115>
