        <owl:annotatedTarget>A hospital-based breast cancer study, supported by the German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ), of women diagnosed with primary in situ or invasive breast cancer at the Städtisches Klinikum Karlsruhe, Germany, from March 1993 to July 2005, with controls selected from the German Consortium for Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer (GC-HBOC); it contributes to the Breast Cancer Association Consortium.</owl:annotatedTarget>
