        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled, multicentre trial that enrolled patients with an acute coronary syndrome in 36 countries between 2009 and 2011, to determine the clinical benefit of direct inhibition of lipoprotein-associated phospholipase A2 with darapladib versus placebo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">13026</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SOLID-TIMI 52</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SOLID-TIMI_52</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Stabilization of Plaques Using Darapladib</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
