    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid20368"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>epithelial ovarian cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>From the Ontario Cancer Registry, all histologically confirmed, primary malignant or borderline malignant epithelial ovarian tumors first diagnosed from November 1989 through October 1992 among study-area residents aged 35-79 years were determined.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid20370"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>borderline malignant epithelial ovarian tumors</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>From the Ontario Cancer Registry, all histologically confirmed, primary malignant or borderline malignant epithelial ovarian tumors first diagnosed from November 1989 through October 1992 among study-area residents aged 35-79 years were determined.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid20372"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>saturated fat intake</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Our purpose was to evaluate whether saturated fat intake increases the risk of ovarian cancer development.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A7942759+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A case-control study of reproductive factors and cancer of the ovary was conducted during 1989-1992 in metropolitan Toronto and nearby areas of Southern Ontario, Canada.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:23339562</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Recent alcohol consumption and risk of incident ovarian carcinoma: a pooled analysis of 5,342 cases and 10,358 controls from the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:23339562</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3568733/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Daily alcohol intake was estimated using validated food frequency questionnaires (FFQs) in AUS [60], DOV [61], HAW [62], MAL, NEC [63], NJO [51] and SON [53].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case–control study of epithelial ovarian cancer in metropolitan Toronto and nearby areas of southern Ontario, Canada, which from 1989 to 1992 interviewed women aged 35–79 with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed malignant or borderline epithelial ovarian tumours, identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry, and randomly selected population controls frequency-matched to them on age, about their reproductive history and diet. It is one of the case–control studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23339562</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:36688720</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:7942759</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:8072035</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">450</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>interviewed cases and population controls in the Southern Ontario study, 1989-1992</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In total, 631 eligible case subjects were identified, of whom 450 (71.3%) were interviewed concerning reproduction and diet; 564 randomly selected population control subjects were similarly interviewed.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">564</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>interviewed cases and population controls in the Southern Ontario study, 1989-1992</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In total, 631 eligible case subjects were identified, of whom 450 (71.3%) were interviewed concerning reproduction and diet; 564 randomly selected population control subjects were similarly interviewed.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400"/>
