        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:20446946</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>The Levels of Inflammatory Markers in the Treatment of Stroke study (LIMITS): inflammatory biomarkers as risk predictors after lacunar stroke.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:20446946</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A20446946+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>SPS3 is an ongoing Phase III multicentre secondary prevention trial focused on preventing recurrent stroke in patients with small vessel ischaemic stroke, or lacunes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002406"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A randomised, multicentre phase III secondary-prevention trial in patients with recent, MRI-confirmed symptomatic lacunar (small subcortical) stroke, recruited between 2003 and 2011 at clinical centres in North America, Latin America and Spain, which tested in a two-by-two factorial design aspirin plus clopidogrel against aspirin alone and a lower against a higher systolic blood-pressure target for preventing recurrent stroke.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:20446946</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22931315</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23726159</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002406"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3020</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>SPS3 randomized participants with recent symptomatic MRI-defined lacunar infarcts (2011)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3979302/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between 2003 and 2011, 3020 participants were entered from North America (n=1960; 65%), Latin America (n=694; 23%) and Spain (n=366; 12%) and followed for a mean of 3.7 (range 0–8.6; ±SD 2) years</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002406"/>
