        <obo:IAO_0000116>patients tested for SARS-CoV-2 at Stanford Health Care whose residual nasopharyngeal swabs were collected, March-July 2020 (positive and negative)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9426371/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
