        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:34319387</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based study of Chinese children aged 6 to 72 months living in south-western and western Singapore, recruited door to door from 2006 to 2008 with disproportionate random sampling in 6-month age bands, who had parental questionnaires and eye examinations including visual acuity, cycloplegic autorefraction, ocular biometry and retinal photography, to study strabismus, amblyopia and refractive error in preschool children; a family study in 2008-2010 added parents and siblings.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3009</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>STARS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
