        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10722735/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>SUCCESS B was another open-label, multicenter, 1:1 randomized phase III study that enrolled 793 intermediate-to-high-risk breast cancer patients between June 2008 and September 2011.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
