        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28190761</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An open-label, multicentre, randomised phase III trial at study sites in Germany that enrolled patients with HER2-negative early breast cancer between 2009 and 2011 and compared anthracycline-containing with anthracycline-free (docetaxel and cyclophosphamide) adjuvant chemotherapy, with a second randomisation of patients with a body mass index of 24 to 40 kg/m2 to an individualised two-year telephone lifestyle intervention aiming at moderate weight loss or to general lifestyle recommendations.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3643</coho:numberOfParticipants>
