        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24001895</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cross-sectional survey of hypertension carried out in 2010 in four urban communities and four rural villages of the Jinchang district of Suzhou, Jiangsu province, China, whose 3,061 participants were Han Chinese adults aged 30 years or older without end-organ damage, chronic renal disease, tumours or urinary tract infections, with questionnaire, anthropometric and blood pressure data. All its participants were genotyped as a de novo replication sample of the Asian Genetic Epidemiology Network&apos;s genome-wide association meta-analysis of mean arterial and pulse pressure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3061</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Suzhou</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
