    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002422">
        <obo:IAO_0100001 rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002474"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id SwBCS and its name, Swedish Bladder Cancer Study, are a transcription error for TWBCS, the Taiwanese Breast Cancer Study of the breast cancer GWAS the id comes from (PMID:22267197), which has no Swedish or bladder cancer study. The name is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0002474 (Taiwanese Breast Cancer Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete Swedish Bladder Cancer Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


