        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetic study of memory performance in healthy young Swiss adults aged 18 to 45 years, university students or age-matched employees and trainees recruited at the University of Zürich and the University of Basel, whose verbal episodic memory is measured by an unexpected delayed free recall of visually presented words and who are genotyped at the Biozentrum of the University of Basel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
