        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genome sequencing study of Colombians with neurodegenerative disease, chiefly early-onset or autosomal dominant Alzheimer&apos;s disease, the frontotemporal lobar degeneration–motor neuron disease spectrum and other early-onset dementias, together with affected and healthy relatives and unrelated healthy participants, recruited or referred to the Grupo de Neurociencias de Antioquia of the University of Antioquia, Medellín, Colombia, with recruitment targeting early-onset dementia and families with several affected first-degree relatives, to study the admixture and rare disease-causing variants underlying neurodegeneration in Colombia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">900</coho:numberOfParticipants>
