        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6305368/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A community dwelling sample of adults aged between 60 and 85 years (n = 431) were randomly selected from the Southern Tasmanian electoral roll.</rdfs:comment>
