        <rdfs:comment>6) Taiwan Coronary Artery Disease GENetic (TCAGEN), a cohort study that enrolled patients undergoing coronary angiography or percutaneous intervention at the National Taiwan University Hospital (NTUH) in the setting of either stable angina pectoris or prior myocardial infarction;</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
