        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10175059/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>TCGS has created a comprehensive database comprising 20,367 participants born between 1911 and 2015 selected from four main ongoing studies in a family-based longitudinal framework.</rdfs:comment>
