        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multicentre, multinational prospective birth cohort study, run from six clinical centres in the United States, Finland, Germany and Sweden, that screened newborns from the general population and first-degree relatives of people with type 1 diabetes for high-risk HLA genotypes, enrolled eligible children before four months of age and follows them to age 15, to identify infectious, dietary and other environmental exposures associated with islet autoimmunity and type 1 diabetes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:17850472</obo:IAO_0000119>
