        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based, case-only study of the molecular epidemiology of lung cancer survival at the H. Lee Moffitt Cancer Center in Tampa, Florida, United States, whose participants are lung cancer patients recruited from Moffitt&apos;s Thoracic Oncology Clinic between April 2006 and August 2010 under the centre&apos;s Total Cancer Care protocol, which collects self-reported, medical record and cancer registry data and blood samples.</obo:IAO_0000115>
