        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:23143601</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case–control study of lung cancer in Tianjin, China, whose cases were patients with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed primary non-small cell lung cancer at Tianjin Medical University Cancer Hospital, excluding those with a previous cancer or earlier radiotherapy or chemotherapy, and whose controls were people attending regular health check-ups in the same period who lived in the same or nearby neighbourhoods, frequency-matched to the cases on sex and age; all participants were ethnic Chinese. Its never-smoking women were genotyped genome-wide as one of the studies of the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">339</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">237</coho:numberOfControls>
