        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based cohort study of respiratory health that began in 1968 with a survey of the children born in 1961 who were attending school in Tasmania, Australia, and has followed these probands with repeated surveys and lung function testing from age 7 into their sixth decade, with their parents also surveyed.</owl:annotatedTarget>
