        <obo:IAO_0000116>children born in 1961 and attending school in Tasmania, surveyed at baseline in 1968 (the probands)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12926821/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, the baseline survey was carried out to assess the respiratory illnesses of 8583 offspring born in 1961, who were attending schools in Tasmania, Australia, in 1968.</rdfs:comment>
