        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective population-based cohort of community-dwelling men and women aged 50 to 79, selected at random in equal numbers by sex from the electoral roll of southern Tasmania, Australia, and enrolled between March 2002 and September 2004, with follow-up assessments, to identify environmental, genetic and biochemical factors in the development and progression of osteoarthritis at multiple sites.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1099</coho:numberOfParticipants>
