        <obo:IAO_0000116>community-dwelling older adults randomly chosen from the southern Tasmanian electoral roll and enrolled at baseline (2002-2004)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11889593/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Between March 2002 and September 2004, 1099 individuals out of 1904 older adults were randomly chosen from the electoral roll in Southern Tasmania (population 229,000) and enrolled in this cohort, resulting in a response rate of 57 %.</rdfs:comment>
