        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-25. A misspelt duplicate of the Tohoku Medical Megabank Project (COHO:0000533); found when the IHCC Cohort Atlas&apos;s entry for the Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization was checked. Replaced by COHO:0000533 (Tohoku Medical Megabank Project), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by the IHCC Cohort Atlas review, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
