        <rdfs:comment>The University of California San Francisco (UCSF) Cardiovascular Research Institute (CVRI) Resource in Arteriosclerosis and Metabolic Disease is an ongoing multi-ethnic study of adults ≥ 18 years of age which was started in 1989 and now includes 28,000 participants recruited from the UCSF medical system.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
