        <obo:IAO_0000115>A community-based prospective cohort study in Leidsche Rijn, a newly developed residential area of the city of Utrecht, the Netherlands, in which all new inhabitants are invited by their general practitioner to take part, receive a baseline individual health profile from research nurses, and are followed up through continuous linkage with the general practitioners&apos; electronic medical records.</obo:IAO_0000115>
