        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. UK2 GCC is the UK Type 2 Diabetes Genetics Consortium collection, whose subjects all lived in Tayside, Scotland (PMID:17767157): the case-control collection of the Genetics of Diabetes Audit and Research in Tayside Scotland, funded by the same grant. Replaced by COHO:0000082 (Genetics of diabetes Audit and Research), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.</rdfs:comment>
