        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id ULM is the Ulm prostate cancer case-control study of the PRACTICAL consortium (PMID:29892016, PMID:33623038). Every score that uses it is a cancer score, so the Catalog&apos;s name for it, Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0002517 (Familial Prostate Cancer Study Ulm), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.</rdfs:comment>
