        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prostate cancer case-control study run by the Institute of Human Genetics and the Department of Urology of Ulm University Hospital, Germany. Familial cases were identified through family-history questionnaires sent by collaborating urologists throughout Germany, sporadic cases came from radical prostatectomy series at the Ulm urology clinic, and controls were men from Ulm without prostate cancer. It is used for linkage and association studies of inherited prostate cancer susceptibility and contributes to the PRACTICAL consortium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
