    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid21367"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:23770605</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collaborative case-control study of chronic lymphocytic leukemia with sites in Utah, USA, and Sheffield, UK, whose prevalent cases came from the hematology clinics of the Huntsman Cancer Hospital and the Utah Cancer Registry, verified by medical records and pathology reports, and from National Health Service hospitals in the North Trent region of the UK, and whose controls were ascertained from the Utah Population Database; its cases and controls, genotyped at the University of Utah, were a replication series of the genome-wide association studies of chronic lymphocytic leukemia published in 2013 and 2016.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfCases rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">236</coho:numberOfCases>
        <coho:numberOfControls rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">227</coho:numberOfControls>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>UTAH-SHEFFIELD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Utah-Sheffield</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Utah/Sheffield Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Utah/Sheffield Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia Collaborative Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid21367">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_patients_with"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004948"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid21367"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>chronic lymphocytic leukemia</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms10933/MediaObjects/41467_2016_BFncomms10933_MOESM1570_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Utah/Sheffield Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia Collaborative Study UTAH- SHEFFIELD 236 227 Mixed: clinic- and population- based cases and controls UTAH: Prevalent cases from Huntsman Cancer Hospital&apos;s Hematology Clinics and Prevalent cases identified in the Utah Cancer Registry, verified by medical records and pathology report. SHEFFIELD: Prevalent cases from National Health Service Hospitals in the North Trent region of the UK Controls ascertained from the Utah Population Database</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2652/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2652_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Partial support for data collection in Sheffield, UK was made possible by funds from Yorkshire Cancer Research.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2652/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2652_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Partial support for data collection at the Utah site was made possible by the Utah Population Database (UPDB) and the Utah Cancer Registry (UCR).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:23770605</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study identifies multiple risk loci for chronic lymphocytic leukemia.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:23770605</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3729927/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In stage 3, 10 SNPs in the most promising loci and one SNP from an established locus were taken forward for de novo replication in an additional 392 cases and 4561 controls from the NCI replication study (NCI Rep) and from the Utah/Sheffield Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia study (Utah-Sheffield) (Supplementary Table 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002532"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collaborative case-control study of chronic lymphocytic leukemia with sites in Utah, USA, and Sheffield, UK, whose prevalent cases came from the hematology clinics of the Huntsman Cancer Hospital and the Utah Cancer Registry, verified by medical records and pathology reports, and from National Health Service hospitals in the North Trent region of the UK, and whose controls were ascertained from the Utah Population Database; its cases and controls, genotyped at the University of Utah, were a replication series of the genome-wide association studies of chronic lymphocytic leukemia published in 2013 and 2016.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23770605</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26956414</obo:IAO_0000119>
