        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of patients with cervical artery dissection at the University of Virginia, Charlottesville, United States, which contributed patients of European origin, meeting the inclusion criteria of the CADISP study, to the second sample (CADISP-2) of the 2015 genome-wide association study of cervical artery dissection and, with controls from the Ischemic Stroke Genetics Study and the Siblings with Ischemic Stroke Study, to its follow-up sample.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>VCAD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
