    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid21453"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>breast cancer</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC2375093</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, residents of Saarland with a first diagnosis of colorectal cancer (CRC), gastric cancer and breast cancer below age 80 between November 1996 and February 1998 were recruited.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2364177/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A population-based, statewide study on diagnostic delay and late stage diagnosis was conducted among patients with various forms of cancer in Saarland, a state with about 1 million inhabitants in Western Germany (Verlauf der diagnostischen Abklärung, VERDI).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PGS000765</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Discovery of common and rare genetic risk variants for colorectal cancer.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:30510241</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:11953844</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Patient delay and stage of diagnosis among breast cancer patients in Germany -- a population based study.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:11953844</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2364177/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A population-based, statewide study on diagnostic delay and late stage diagnosis was conducted among patients with various forms of cancer in Saarland, a state with about 1 million inhabitants in Western Germany (Verlauf der diagnostischen Abklärung, VERDI).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based, statewide study of patients with newly diagnosed cancers of various sites in Saarland, Germany, identified in the late 1990s by their treating physicians at the hospitals of Saarland and adjacent counties and interviewed about the diagnostic process, to study diagnostic delay and late-stage diagnosis; conducted by epidemiologists of the University of Ulm and the German Centre for Research on Ageing with the Saarland Cancer Registry. It is distinct from the ESTHER cohort, with which consortia pool it as ESTHER/VERDI.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:11953844</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:27140836</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">908</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Saarland residents with a first diagnosis of colorectal (439), gastric (82) or breast (387) cancer enrolled November 1996 to February 1998 (1996-1998)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC2375093</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Overall, 908 patients (439 patients with CRC, 82 patients with gastric cancer and 387 patients with breast cancer) living in Saarland were enrolled.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002544"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>VERDI</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


