        <rdfs:comment>The 125 subjects used for all cellular studies were enrolled into the WAHCS which is a prospective, observational study of HIV-infected individuals established in 1983 and approved by the Royal Perth Hospital Ethics Committee and conforms to the provisions of the Declaration of Helsinki.</rdfs:comment>
