        <rdfs:comment>The Weiss Laboratory Autism Collections are a combination of Californian cohorts including the UCSF/Weiss (42 trios, 13 cases), UCSF/Hendren</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002575"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs13229-017-0137-9/MediaObjects/13229_2017_137_MOESM1_ESM.docx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Weiss Laboratory Autism Collections are a combination of Californian cohorts including the UCSF/Weiss (42 trios, 13 cases), UCSF/Hendren</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002575"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:28540026</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Meta-analysis of GWAS of over 16,000 individuals with autism spectrum disorder highlights a novel locus at 10q24.32 and a significant overlap with schizophrenia.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:28540026</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs13229-017-0137-9/MediaObjects/13229_2017_137_MOESM1_ESM.docx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The contributing Discovery Cohorts are; Autism Centre of Excellence (Geschwind Laboratory) Autism Genome Project (AGP) Autism Genetic Resource Exchange Finnish Autism Collection NIMH Repository and Montreal/Boston Collection Population-based Autism Genetics and Environment Study (PAGES) Simons Simplex Collection (SSC) Weiss Laboratory Autism Collection</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002575"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A combination of Californian autism spectrum disorder collections, namely the UCSF/Weiss trios and cases, the UCSF/Hendren cases, the USC/Levitt cases and controls, trios, cases and controls from the CHARGE study at UC Davis and cases and controls of the Autism Phenome Project of the UC Davis MIND Institute, whose samples were genotyped by the laboratory of L. A. Weiss at the University of California, San Francisco, on Affymetrix Axiom EUR arrays, and which contributed its European-American participants to the Psychiatric Genomics Consortium autism GWAS.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28540026</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs13229-017-0137-9/MediaObjects/13229_2017_137_MOESM1_ESM.docx</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
