        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1326</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>warfarin users of the inception cohort analysed in its 2017 paper (African and European Americans)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5657532/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Baseline characteristics of the 1326 participants (mean age 61.0 years; standard deviation (SD) ± 15.8) are presented in Table 1.</rdfs:comment>
