        <rdfs:comment>We recruited in a completely anonymized fashion consecutive consenting ischemic stroke patients from hospitals in northwest Germany through the regional Westphalian Stroke Register and from the University Hospital of Greifswald in northeast Germany.</rdfs:comment>
