    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002582 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002582">
        <obo:IAO_0100001 rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002434"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Obsoleted 2026-09-24. same cohort as review name E1086. WSULC is the PGS Catalog&apos;s id for the study the OncoArray lung cancer paper (PMID:28604730) describes under the heading &apos;The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study&apos; and lists in its study table as the &apos;Tampa Lung Cancer Study&apos; (acronym Tampa, institution WSU, PI P. Lazarus, hospital case-control 1999-2003): a Moffitt Cancer Center (Tampa, Florida) case-control study run by an investigator now at Washington State University. That study is the placeholder TampaLC (E1086, COHO:0002434, &apos;Tampa Lung Cancer Study&apos;), so WSULC is the same sample. When E1086 is curated, &apos;The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study&apos; should be added as a synonym and WSULC as an acronym. Not the Total Lung Cancer Study (TLC, E-row COHO:0002458), which is a separate Moffitt study described next to it. Replaced by COHO:0002434 (Tampa Lung Cancer Study), which now carries this term&apos;s names. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">obsolete The Washington State University Lung Cancer Study</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


