        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002593"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1814</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>5980 ZJCRC subjects genotyped; 1814 cases and 1814 controls in its case-control component</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11170922/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 1814 patients with advanced colorectal neoplasm (including 1622 advanced adenoma and 192 cancer cases) and 1814 lesion-free controls were finally included in this study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002593"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5980</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>5980 ZJCRC subjects genotyped; 1814 cases and 1814 controls in its case-control component</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11170922/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Five thousand nine hundred eighty subjects from ZJCRC case–control set and ZJCRC cross-sectional screening set were genotyped using the Illumina™ Asian Screening Array (ASA) system (Additional file 2: Figure S1, Additional file 1: Table S7).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002593"/>
