        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90292534</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An umbrella of three prospective cohorts of nurses: the original Nurses&apos; Health Study established in 1976, Nurses&apos; Health Study II, and Nurses&apos; Health Study 3, which is still enrolling nurses and nursing students in the United States or Canada; together they count more than 275,000 participants and are among the largest prospective investigations into the risk factors for major chronic diseases in women.</obo:IAO_0000115>
