        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:40205852</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of women screened for human papillomavirus and cervical abnormalities in the capital region of Sweden, in the organised screening programme and in non-organised testing, enrolled from 2011 by the Center for Cervical Cancer Elimination at Karolinska Institutet and Karolinska University Hospital, with biobanked cervical samples and individual screening data updated from the Swedish National Cervical Screening Registry (NKCx), for long-term follow-up studies of cervical cancer and other diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
