        <rdfs:comment>The priority research themes selected for ELFE were:aspects of children&apos;s environment that have undergone the most striking changes over recent decades including: modification of nutritional intake; reduction of physical activity; exposure to emerging exogenous pollutants;</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
