        <obo:IAO_0000115>The participants of a community-randomised phase IV trial in which early adolescents born 1992–1995 and resident in 33 Finnish communities were invited in 2007–2009 and assigned by community to gender-neutral HPV16/18 vaccination, HPV16/18 vaccination of girls with hepatitis B vaccination of boys, or gender-neutral hepatitis B vaccination, and followed up with cervicovaginal sampling from 18.5 years of age, to compare the overall and herd effects of gender-neutral and girls-only HPV vaccination.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">32175</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/HPV</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
