        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">32175</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>early adolescents (20,514 girls, 11,661 boys) enrolled in the trial, 2007-2010</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25593103</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Recruitment resulted in equal enrolment of four birth cohorts (born 1992-1995) comprising altogether 32,175 (40% response) early adolescents: 20,514 girls (50.5-53.0% response by arm) and 11,661 boys (21.9-31.6%% response by arm).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
