        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:39808632</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An Italian internet-based birth cohort of children born to pregnant women who volunteered through the study website, started as a pilot in Turin in July 2005 and extended to the rest of Italy, with recruitment until 2016 and online questionnaires completed by the mothers during pregnancy and repeatedly through the child&apos;s childhood and adolescence, set up to investigate the effects of pre-natal and early post-natal exposures on infant, child and adult health.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7423</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/NINFEA</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
