    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid22147"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cyprus"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:42044183</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Cypriot site of the CHILDREN_FIRST multi-country prospective exposome cohort: children in the first grade of randomly selected public primary schools in Cyprus, recruited from October 2023 by the Cyprus University of Technology with the biobank of the University of Cyprus and assessed every year until the end of primary school with questionnaires, urine and saliva samples and home and school environmental measurements, to study how the exposome shapes early risk of cardiometabolic, neurodevelopmental and respiratory disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">350</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/CHILDREN%20FIRST</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CHILDREN FIRST</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CHILDREN HEALTH AND ENVIRONMENT OBSERVATORY</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CHILDREN_FIRST</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Κυπριακό Παρατηρητήριο Υγείας και Περιβάλλοντος Παιδιών</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GEC_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cypriot Children&apos;s Health and Environment Observatory</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid22147">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/is_designed_to_study_exposure"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ExO_0000002"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22147"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>children&apos;s exposome (molecular biomarkers, sensors and questionnaires across the three exposome domains)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13119864/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CHILDREN_FIRST international cohort observatory study aims to investigate how the spatio-temporal evolution of the children’s exposome profiles in the Mediterranean region influences early-life programming of chronic disease risk during the critical window of susceptibility in primary school years (6–11 years of age).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cyprus"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13119864/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In Cyprus, participant recruitment took place between October 2023 and January 2024 and data collection for the baseline assessment was conducted from January 2024 to June 2024.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:42044183</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Designing a children&apos;s health exposomics study protocol: The CHILDREN_FIRST multi-country prospective cohort using multi-omics and personalized prevention approaches.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:42044183</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13119864/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In Cyprus, participant recruitment took place between October 2023 and January 2024 and data collection for the baseline assessment was conducted from January 2024 to June 2024.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002633"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The Cypriot site of the CHILDREN_FIRST multi-country prospective exposome cohort: children in the first grade of randomly selected public primary schools in Cyprus, recruited from October 2023 by the Cyprus University of Technology with the biobank of the University of Cyprus and assessed every year until the end of primary school with questionnaires, urine and saliva samples and home and school environmental measurements, to study how the exposome shapes early risk of cardiometabolic, neurodevelopmental and respiratory disease.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:42044183</obo:IAO_0000119>
