        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/ROLS</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Rome Longitudinal Study: administrative cohort of &gt;2 million individuals all ages, enrolled at Census date (Oct. 9 2011) and followed up until 2019 (to be updated).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
