        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33171599</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre hospital-based case–control study of children and adolescents in Spain, recruited at the university hospitals of Santiago de Compostela (Hospital Clínico Universitario de Santiago), Zaragoza (Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa) and Córdoba (Hospital Universitario Reina Sofía): cases attending hospital with suspected overweight or obesity, and controls attending for minor disorders or common infections that were not confirmed, studied to understand the pathophysiology and cardiometabolic, inflammatory and oxidative-stress risk factors of childhood obesity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1775</coho:numberOfParticipants>
