        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8998578/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PIPA Project is a prospective birth cohort study based in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, whose pilot study was carried out between October 2017 and August 2018.</rdfs:comment>
