        <rdfs:comment>In the PROGRESS cohort (n = 434) in Mexico City, we modeled ambient PM2.5 exposure during pregnancy and the first year of life.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002651"/>
