    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22375"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>dietary intake</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8776471/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ENSIN-2015 estimated dietary intake using the 24-hour recall method (24 HR) [13, 14].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22377"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>nutritional situation</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8776471/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The ENSIN-2015 estimated dietary intake using the 24-hour recall method (24 HR) [13, 14].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Colombia"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8776471/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In Colombia, South America, the Colombian Institute for Family Wellbeing (ICBF in Spanish) along with the Ministry of Health (MinSalud) conducted the ENSIN-2015, which is representative of 99% of the Colombian population</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:35070447</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Intake of Animal Protein and Dietary Sources in the Colombian Population: Results of the National Nutrition Survey (ENSIN-2015).</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35070447</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8776471/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>This study was based on data gathered from the 2015 National Nutrition Survey (ENSIN in Spanish).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A repeated nationally representative cross-sectional household survey of the nutritional situation of the population of Colombia, conducted by the Colombian Institute for Family Welfare (ICBF) with the Ministry of Health in 2005, 2010 and 2015, covering people aged 0 to 64 years and pregnant women, that measures nutritional status, dietary intake, food security, breastfeeding and physical activity to inform public food and nutrition policy.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:35070447</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.icbf.gov.co/bienestar/nutricion/encuesta-nacional-situacion-nutricional</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">151343</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>people interviewed in the 2015 round (44,202 households), 2015-2016</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.icbf.gov.co/bienestar/nutricion/encuesta-nacional-situacion-nutricional</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>La tercera Encuesta Nacional de Situación Nutricional de Colombia (ENSIN) 2015 es una operación estadística poblacional realizada entre noviembre de 2015 a diciembre de 2016, en la cual, se entrevistaron 151.343 personas de 44.202 hogares en 295 municipios del país.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002657"/>
