        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nationwide community-based survey of adults in Tuvalu, on Funafuti and the eight outer islands, run in waves since 2020 and funded jointly by the Taiwan International Cooperation and Development Fund and the Tuvalu government, studying diet, lifestyle behaviours, climate-related exposures and obesity and other non-communicable diseases; from 2025 it is being continued as a longitudinal cohort with repeated surveys, clinical assessments and biomonitoring.</obo:IAO_0000115>
