        <rdfs:comment>Butajira Nutrition, Mental Health, and Pregnancy (BUNMAP) Study, a population-based prospective cohort study aimed at evaluating the role of maternal nutrition, mycotoxin exposure, and mental health on prenatal and postnatal growth and development that was conducted between October 2017 and November 2020 in the Butajira Health and Demographic Surveillance Site under Addis Ababa University, Ethiopia.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
