        <obo:IAO_0000115>A platform established by the UK Medical Research Council to accelerate the development of new treatments for dementia, run from the University of Oxford, whose Data Portal, launched in 2017, brings together data from independent population and clinical cohorts, most of them in the United Kingdom, in a shared remote-access environment for collaborative and multi-cohort research on dementia and neurodegeneration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
