        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40018598</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The IMHDSS cohort covers a catchment area of 155 km2 with a population of 95 000 individuals and is served by 23 health facilities.</rdfs:comment>
