        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22590"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>dementia</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12678644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Participants from the HUNT4 70+ sub-study were re-evaluated four years later, which offers a unique opportunity to investigate the incidence of dementia and progression from MCI to dementia within this representative cohort.</rdfs:comment>
