        <obo:IAO_0000116>mild cognitive impairment</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12678644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Participants from the HUNT4 70+ sub-study were re-evaluated four years later, which offers a unique opportunity to investigate the incidence of dementia and progression from MCI to dementia within this representative cohort.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Norway"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12678644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A longitudinal cohort design was used, with baseline assessment in the Norwegian HUNT4 70+ study (2017–19) and at follow-up four years later (2021–23).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000395"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12678644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The fourth wave of the study, referred to as HUNT4, was conducted from 2017 to 2019. Within this wave, a sub-study, HUNT4 70+, focused on individuals aged 70 and older.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:40879407</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Incidence of dementia among individuals 70 years and older in Norway: A HUNT study.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40879407</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12678644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In HUNT4 70+, all inhabitants aged 70+ were invited (N = 19,403), with 9956 (51.3%) participating (Figure 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A sub-study of the fourth wave (HUNT4, 2017–2019) of the Trøndelag Health Study in which all inhabitants aged 70 years and older in the northern Trøndelag region of Norway were invited to detailed assessments of cognition and health, used to study the prevalence and incidence of dementia and mild cognitive impairment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:40879407</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9956</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>inhabitants aged 70+ who took part in HUNT4 70+ (2017-2019)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40879407</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In HUNT4 70+, all inhabitants aged 70+ were invited (N = 19,403), with 9956 (51.3%) participating (Figure 1).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>HUNT 70+</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002681"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>HUNT 70+, The HUNT Study</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002682 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002682">
