        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of volunteers recruited online from 2020 by the MRC Human Genetics Unit at the University of Edinburgh who shared genotype data from direct-to-consumer genetic testing services and completed questionnaires on their health, lifestyle and COVID-19 symptoms, to identify genes that influence the risk and severity of COVID-19.</obo:IAO_0000115>
