        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:39150951</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of adults in the United States and Puerto Rico recruited by the American Cancer Society between 2006 and 2013, mainly at community events, who gave a blood sample and survey information and are followed through repeat surveys and linkage with cancer registries and the National Death Index, to study lifestyle, genetic and other causes of cancer and other outcomes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">303682</coho:numberOfParticipants>
