        <obo:IAO_0000115>A subset of the Cancer Prevention Study II participants, men and women living in 21 US states, enrolled by the American Cancer Society through a mailed questionnaire in 1992–1993 and followed by biennial questionnaires, medical records and registry linkage for incident cancer and death, with blood samples from a subgroup, to study diet and other lifestyle factors and exposures in relation to cancer risk, mortality and survival.</obo:IAO_0000115>
