        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8000483/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Men and women in this study were participants in the CPS-II Nutrition Cohort, a subset of 1.2 million participants in the CPS-II Cohort (1982), who resided in 21 U.S. states when they were invited to enroll in the CPS-II Nutrition Cohort of incident cancer follow-up, beginning in 1992–1993</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
