    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="genid22712"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Asia"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/China"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eastern_Asia"/>
        <coho:isCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002701"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:33038086</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A government-funded, population-based cardiovascular screening cohort run by the National Center for Cardiovascular Diseases (Fuwai Hospital, Beijing) that, after a pilot in four provinces, enrolled community-dwelling residents aged 35 to 75 years at urban districts and rural counties in all 31 provinces of mainland China from 2014, with blood pressure, anthropometric and lipid measurements and a health questionnaire, and gave further assessment, counselling and follow-up to those at high risk, to identify people at high risk of cardiovascular disease and support research on its prevention.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym MPP also denotes Malmö Preventive Project (COHO:0000787); this term is China Patient-centered Evaluative Assessment of Cardiac Events Million Persons Project.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2660666</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE (Patient-centered Evaluative Assessment of Cardiac Events) Million Persons Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE MPP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE Million Persons Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE million persons project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE-MPP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China PEACE-Million Persons Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China Patient-Centered Evaluative Assessment of Cardiac Events Million Persons Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China-PEACE Million Persons Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MPP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#IHCC_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">China Patient-centered Evaluative Assessment of Cardiac Events Million Persons Project</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="genid22712">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/is_population_study_of"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004995"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22712"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cardiovascular disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4716208/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The pilot is the first large-scale population-based screening project in China aimed at identifying subjects at high risk of cardiovascular disease (CVD) and collecting detailed information and biospecimens as part of a precision medicine project.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/China"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7928212/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>From September 2014 to November 2018, we used a purposive sampling strategy to select 189 sites (114 rural counties, 75 urban districts) from all 31 provinces in mainland China.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:33038086</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Severe hypertension in China: results from the China PEACE million persons project.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:33038086</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7928212/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We enrolled 2 660 666 participants aged 35–75 years from 31 provinces between 2014 and 2018 in the cross-sectional China Patient-Centered Evaluative Assessment of Cardiac Events Million Persons Project.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A government-funded, population-based cardiovascular screening cohort run by the National Center for Cardiovascular Diseases (Fuwai Hospital, Beijing) that, after a pilot in four provinces, enrolled community-dwelling residents aged 35 to 75 years at urban districts and rural counties in all 31 provinces of mainland China from 2014, with blood pressure, anthropometric and lipid measurements and a health questionnaire, and gave further assessment, counselling and follow-up to those at high risk, to identify people at high risk of cardiovascular disease and support research on its prevention.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26729395</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:33038086</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002693"/>
