        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:28557991</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research consortium funded by the European Commission under Horizon 2020 that pooled and harmonised data from existing adult and child cohort studies in Europe, the USA and Australia, including CoLaus, SKIPOGH, Constances and the Melbourne Collaborative Cohort Study, with biomarker and omics sub-studies, to investigate the biological pathways through which socioeconomic position affects healthy ageing over the life course.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <coho:numberOfParticipants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1700000</coho:numberOfParticipants>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>LIFEPATH</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
