        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/is_population_study_of"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004995"/>
    </owl:Restriction>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002703"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22864"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>diet</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13092225/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The intervention is unique in that it began in infancy and continued for 20 years, with personalized dietary counseling provided to children and their parents in the intervention group.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002703"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid22866"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>cardiovascular disease</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13092225/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>It aimed at improving fat quality and promoting healthy foods to prevent cardiovascular diseases.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002703"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Finland"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13092225/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The STRIP study enrolled children and their families who were recruited at well‐baby clinics at their routine 5‐month visit between December 1, 1989, and May 30, 1992 in the city of Turku, Finland. The children constituted a representative sample of 5‐month‐old children in the area. A total of 1062 7‐month‐old infants and their parents were enrolled in the trial.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002703"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/isSubCohortOf"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002415"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13092225/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The STRIP study enrolled children and their families who were recruited at well‐baby clinics at their routine 5‐month visit between December 1, 1989, and May 30, 1992 in the city of Turku, Finland. The children constituted a representative sample of 5‐month‐old children in the area. A total of 1062 7‐month‐old infants and their parents were enrolled in the trial.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002703"/>
