        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:24836286</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based case-control study of multiple cancers in South Korea, with disease-specific series including breast and colorectal cancer at Chonnam National University Hwasun Hospital in Jeollanam-do province. It recruits newly diagnosed cancer patients and community controls to investigate factors in cancer development and clinical progression; its disease-specific series use interview and medical-record information and blood samples.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HCES</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hwasun Cancer Epidemiology Study</rdfs:label>
