        <dcterms:title>A variant at 9p21.3 functionally implicates CDKN2B in paediatric B-cell precursor acute lymphoblastic leukaemia aetiology.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26868379</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4754340/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As the French and Aus–ALL data sets are both part of the Childhood Leukemia International Consortium47, we merged them to create the combined ‘Aus–French&apos; data set, from which 11 cases and 59 controls were removed following QC before imputation (described below).</rdfs:comment>
