    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002711"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium established in 2007 that pools harmonized individual-level epidemiologic and germline genetic data from independent case-control and cohort studies to investigate causes of childhood leukemia and other childhood cancers, with its scope expanded to other cancers in 2019. Its collaborative analyses examine environmental and genetic risk factors, their interactions, exposure timing, and differences among disease subtypes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:23403126</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:42628293</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002711"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfCases"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">150000</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Approximate consortium-wide all-cancer case/control inventory reported in the 2026 own profile; not exact unique-person enrolment and not a single analysis sample. (2026 profile)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13544941/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Membership has grown from 13 studies in 9 countries to 57 studies in 21 countries; recruitment spans the early 1960s to the present and encompasses approximately 150,000 cases across all tumor types and 300,000 controls with clinical, demographic, and exposure data, centralized via harmonized data dictionaries at the Data Coordination Center, established in 2014 at the International Agency for Research on Cancer, and supported by a secure analysis platform.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002711"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfControls"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">300000</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Approximate consortium-wide all-cancer case/control inventory reported in the 2026 own profile; not exact unique-person enrolment and not a single analysis sample. (2026 profile)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13544941/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Membership has grown from 13 studies in 9 countries to 57 studies in 21 countries; recruitment spans the early 1960s to the present and encompasses approximately 150,000 cases across all tumor types and 300,000 controls with clinical, demographic, and exposure data, centralized via harmonized data dictionaries at the Data Coordination Center, established in 2014 at the International Agency for Research on Cancer, and supported by a secure analysis platform.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
