        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:19706757</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium formed in 2005 that pools comparable data from independent bladder cancer studies to investigate environmental and genetic risk factors and their interactions. Its collaborative analyses combine case-control and case-only data, including investigations of DNA repair gene variation and cigarette smoking in bladder cancer susceptibility.</obo:IAO_0000115>
