        <rdfs:comment>The International Consortium of Bladder Cancer (ICBC; http://dceg.cancer.gov/icbc/) was formed in 2005 to facilitate the pooling of comparable data on environmental and genetic risk factors across studies in order to overcome the limited statistical power of individual studies.</rdfs:comment>
