        <rdfs:comment>Cases were all new incident breast cancer patients histologically diagnosed at the National Cancer Institute in Bangkok and at the hospital in Khon Kaen province of North Eastern of Thailand during the period of May 2002 to March 2004 [21], with a participation rate of 99.6% (554/556).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
