        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/numberOfParticipants"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1496</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>patients with acute myocardial infarction (STEMI or NSTEMI) prospectively enrolled over one year (2009)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22777311+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We compared clinical features, hospital management and prognosis of STEMI/NSTEMI in an unselected cohort of 1,496 prospectively enrolled patients (STEMI, 36.9 % and NSTEMI, 63.1 %), admitted in 1 year to one of the six hospitals in Florence health district (Italy).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
